msgstr "과학이 가득한 눈초리다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
