msgstr "이를 '바살리바'라고 부른다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
