#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
