msgstr "잡았다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "Something's digging underground!"
msgstr "뭔가 지하에서 땅을 파고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED"
msgid "Look at those defenses! how does he do that?"
msgstr "방어하는 것 좀 봐! 어떻게 하는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH"
msgid "I memorized my Pinetree Pioneer handbook, I can memorize this!"
msgstr "소나무 개척단 핸드북도 외웠으니, 이것도 외울 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE"
msgid "Aaah... I don't want to do that again."
msgstr "아아... 다시는 하기 싫어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE"
msgid "You look better already!"
msgstr "벌써 훨씬 나아 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE"
