#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Should I start carrying something like this in my first aid kit?"
msgstr "구급 상자에 이런 걸 넣고 다녀야 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "이야, 착하고 귀여운 로봇이 어디 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "이야, 착하고 귀여운 로봇이 어디 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Aww, who's a good little robot?"
msgstr "이야, 착하고 귀여운 로봇이 어디 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "I guess it's taking a nap."
msgstr "낮잠 자나봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "What is it boy? Do you have something to show WX?"
msgstr "이게 뭐니, 얘? WX에게 보여줄 만한 게 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "With this on, I'm invincible! Right?"
msgstr "이게 있으면 나는 무적이야! 그렇지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "Is it supposed to feel warm?"
msgstr "원래 이렇게 따뜻한가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Y'ello to you too! Okay, that was bad."
msgstr "안녕 노란녕! 음, 역시 너무 썰렁한가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "It never hurts to have a little star power."
msgstr "별의 힘을 가져서 나쁠 건 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr "좋지 않아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I should offer it something, but what should it be..."
msgstr "뭘 좀 줘야할 것 같은데 뭘 주지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What should we make, Woby?"
msgstr "워비, 우리 뭐 만들까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope Woby doesn't think it's a chew toy..."
msgstr "워비가 장난감 껌이라고 생각하지 않았으면 좋겠는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB"
msgid "What do you think, Woby? Should I show it to the judge?"
msgstr "어떻게 생각해, 워비? 심사위원에게 보여줘야 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope Woby doesn't think it's a chew toy..."
msgstr "워비가 장난감 껌이라고 생각하지 않았으면 좋겠는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB"
msgid "What do you think, Woby? Should I show it to the judge?"
msgstr "어떻게 생각해, 워비? 심사위원에게 보여줘야 할까?"

