msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP"
msgid "It seems sensible enough to me, if a bit unpleasant."
msgstr "약간 불쾌하긴 하지만 내가 보기엔 충분히 합리적이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW"
msgid "Tampering with the timestream, are we? Good lad."
msgstr "시간의 흐름을 함부로 바꾸고 있는 거야, 그렇지? 좋은 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "분명히 신중하게 만든 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "어린아이치고는 기발하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "어린아이치고는 기발하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
