msgstr "몽 듀(맙소사), 두 번째 과정이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
