msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "반짝이는 걸 먹여야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "I'm quite good at this one!"
msgstr "내가 이 게임에 소질이 있나 보군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "Perhaps I'll toss it around with the children."
msgstr "아마도 아이들과 함께 던지겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID"
msgid "Bonjour! And who might you be, little one?"
msgstr "봉쥬르! 그리고 넌 누굴까, 꼬맹이?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "A token for le carnaval!"
msgstr "르 카니발(사육제)의 토큰이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST"
msgid "He's a bit odd, but so is everything around here, non?"
msgstr "조금 이상하지만 여기선 모든 것이 그렇지, 농(안 그래)?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, it's looking a bit bland around here."
msgstr "흠, 주변이 좀 밋밋해 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2"
msgid "Having more decorations around would certainly give it some zest!"
msgstr "장식품을 더 많이 두면 확실히 활기를 띠게 될 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
msgid "Magnifique!"
msgstr "굉장해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "This tree has a certain je ne sais quoi."
msgstr "이 나무에는 특정한 쥬느세꾸아(쉽지 않아)가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "They have quite a menu of prizes to choose from!"
msgstr "상금을 선택할 수있는 메뉴가 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "All the ingredients are together, now let's get cooking!"
msgstr "재료를 모두 모아왔으니 이제 요리를 해보자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC"
msgid "One lonely ticket."
msgstr "티켓 한 장이 외롭게 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK"
msgid "Mon dieu, a mountain of tickets!"
msgstr "몽듀(맙소사), 산더미 같은 티켓이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK"
msgid "Quite a few tickets."
msgstr "티켓이 꽤 많아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "They could use a bit of seasoning."
msgstr "조미료가 좀 필요할 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "Ah, I remember this style being quite popular in Paris."
msgstr "아, 이 스타일이 파리에서 꽤 유행했던 걸로 기억해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "It provides a nice bit of shade."
msgstr "그늘이 좀 생기니 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "When at a crow carnival, dress like the crows do, non?"
msgstr "까마귀 축제에 가면 까마귀처럼 옷을 입겠지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "Will it slice le jambon?"
msgstr "햄 자르는 데 쓸 수 있으려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
msgid "C'est la vie..."
msgstr "인생이 원래 그렇지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit of furniture would be nice around here."
msgstr "여기 가구가 조금 있으면 좋을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder what you'd taste like."
msgstr "무슨 맛인지 궁금하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "I... think I had a nightmare like this once."
msgstr "전에... 이런 악몽을 꿨던 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "Would you be a meat or a vegetable?"
msgstr "고기 할래, 채소 할래?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "Bonne nuit."
msgstr "잘 자렴."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
msgid "Oh! Well aren't you... cute?"
msgstr "아! 너 꽤... 귀엽구나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Fresh picked produce!"
msgstr "갓 딴 채소다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a dash of olive oil and cilantro..."
msgstr "올리브기름과 고수가 있었으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How many different ways could I prepare carrots of this size..."
msgstr "당근을 이런 크기로 준비하는 데 얼마나 다양한 방법을 쓸 수 있었는지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "Ah, a fresh carrot!"
msgstr "아, 신선한 당근이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "미래의 식재료야, 다만 자라기를 기다리고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Oh dear!"
msgstr "저런!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that won't help our explorations much."
msgstr "탐험에 별로 도움은 안 되겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope my penmanship is legible."
msgstr "내 글씨체가 읽을 만해야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "What perky little ears."
msgstr "저 쫑긋한 귀 좀 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "Vacant of critters."
msgstr "비어 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "How many critters can fit in there?"
msgstr "안에 동물이 몇 마리나 들어갈까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Not quite my style."
msgstr "내 스타일은 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "I'm afraid I don't have any clockwork cheese."
msgstr "내겐 태엽 장치로 돌아가는 치즈가 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm sure I'm strong enough to move it."
msgstr "이 정도는 내 힘으로 움직일 수 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "I can't get at it."
msgstr "손이 안 닿아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "Bananas! Just the flavor I needed!"
msgstr "바나나다! 딱 내가 원하는 맛이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "I would have liked more fresh bananas."
msgstr "신선한 바나나를 더 먹을 수 있으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Could use some oats and a few chocolate chips..."
msgstr "오트밀과 초콜릿 칩이 있었으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "There must be monkeys close by."
msgstr "근처에 원숭이가 있을 수도 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "I wonder what is underneath that?"
msgstr "아래에 뭐가 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "Someone else is having their turn in there."
msgstr "지금 차례인 사람이 들어가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what is underneath that?"
msgstr "아래에 뭐가 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "Dare I?"
msgstr "들어갈까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "What is within?"
msgstr "안에 무엇이 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "I'll wait til there's a little more room."
msgstr "공간이 더 생길 때까지 기다려야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Now isn't a good time to leave."
msgstr "지금은 떠나기 좋은 때가 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "I should like to see the surface again."
msgstr "다시 지상으로 나가고 싶다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "How does anything grow down here?"
msgstr "어떻게 지하에서 식물이 자랄 수 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Truly what I live for!"
msgstr "내 인생의 기쁨이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "This, a grill and some meat and I'd have dinner."
msgstr "여기에 그릴과 고기만 있으면 훌륭한 저녁 식사인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "It needs an important ingredient."
msgstr "중요한 재료가 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "What a rude bird!"
msgstr "건방진 새 같으니!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "A play? Here?"
msgstr "연극이라고? 여기서?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "Mon dieu... Is that the face I've seen peering from the shadows?"
msgstr "세상에나... 저건 그림자에서 날 바라보던 얼굴 아니야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "I have the feeling I am being watched."
msgstr "왠지 누가 날 지켜보는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "Broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "부서진 체스말?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "More broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "부서진 체스말이 더 있네?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "And yet more broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "부서진 체스말이 또 더 있네?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "I think Maman would like this."
msgstr "마망이 좋아할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "I do like her better like this."
msgstr "이쪽이 마음에 들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "I can't believe we survived that beast!"
msgstr "저 짐승으로부터 살아남았다니 안 믿겨!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "A second course of monster that I didn't ask for!"
msgstr "괴물은 이제 그만!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "What a beautifully marbled steak."
msgstr "이 스테이크는 마블링이 너무너무 예쁘네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Muse for my new honey glaze!"
msgstr "새로 개발한 벌꿀 요리의 영감을 준 친구야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a bishop."
msgstr "약간 비숍 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "세상에나! 움직이잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "How lovely!"
msgstr "사랑스러운걸!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "Looking at it is making me a little hungry..."
msgstr "보고 있으니까 좀 출출한데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "At least this one won't try to sneak off with my lunch."
msgstr "최소한 이 녀석은 내 점심을 빼돌리려 하지 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "I'm glad it's not trying to bite me."
msgstr "날 물려고 하지 않아서 다행이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "I'm not sure why we memorialized this very scary creature."
msgstr "왜 이렇게 무서운 괴물을 기념하는지 모르겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "I'm getting a sudden craving for seafood."
msgstr "갑자기 해산물이 당겨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "I have to admit, I think I prefer him this way."
msgstr "인정해야겠군. 이 편이 더 나은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "He put me off pork for some time."
msgstr "덕분에 한동안 돼지고기를 못 먹었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "It was much scarier in the flesh."
msgstr "실제로 봤을 때는 훨씬 더 무서웠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "Brr... it still gives me the shivers..."
msgstr "덜덜... 아직도 몸이 떨리네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "How could I forget the chewing."
msgstr "씹힐 뻔했던 일을 어떻게 잊겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "I was afraid I was going to be broiled alive!"
msgstr "산 채로 구워질까 봐 두려웠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Did it just blink?"
msgstr "방금 깜빡였나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "This must be the king?"
msgstr "왕인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "A three course fight I won't soon forget."
msgstr "금방 잊지는 못할 전투 세 코스네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "One can dream."
msgstr "꿈은 꿀 수 있잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "I think Mme. Wickerbottom is particularly fond of this one."
msgstr "내 생각엔. 위커바텀 여사가 이걸 특히 좋아하는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "A table centerpiece fit for a holiday feast."
msgstr "연회에 어울리는 식탁 장식이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a knight."
msgstr "약간 나이트 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "세상에나! 움직이잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "I hope this won't bring us ill luck at sea..."
msgstr "바다에서 불운을 불러오지 않았으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "As far as battles go, it was probably the most pleasant."
msgstr "전투 중에서는 가장 기분 좋은 경험이었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "Perhaps now you can keep watch over my crock pot."
msgstr "이제 네가 내 냄비를 지켜보면 되겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "Hits my eye like a big pizza pie."
msgstr "내 눈에는 큰 피자 파이로 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "I should whip up some roast goose with cranberry sauce."
msgstr "구운 거위랑 크랜베리 소스를 후딱 만들어야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "This one looks like a queen."
msgstr "퀸 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "It looks a bit like a pawn."
msgstr "약간 폰 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I hope it doesn't set a bad example for the little ones."
msgstr "꼬마들에게 나쁜 예가 되면 안 되는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a rook."
msgstr "약간 루크 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "세상에나! 움직이잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "It seemed to think it was top of the food chain."
msgstr "자기가 먹이 사슬의 정점이라고 생각하나 보군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "If only I could use those bones in a broth."
msgstr "저 뼈로 육수를 낼 수만 있다면."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "Stone mushroom soup anyone?"
msgstr "돌 버섯 수프 먹을 사람?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "They weren't the most polite guests, non?"
msgstr "아주 예의바른 손님은 아니었어, 농?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "I'm relieved it's just a statue."
msgstr "그냥 조각상이라 다행이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "It sure had an appetite."
msgstr "식성이 엄청난 녀석이었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "Ah, the sweet taste of victory!"
msgstr "아, 달콤한 승리의 맛!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "I remember the chewing."
msgstr "씹힐 뻔했던 일이 아직도 기억나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "You look cute and inedible."
msgstr "귀여운데 먹을 수 없구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "The eye follows me wherever I go..."
msgstr "어딜 가든 눈이 나를 따라오네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "It sleeps."
msgstr "자고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Ah! Can this give me the storage space I crave?"
msgstr "아! 드디어 저장 공간을 얻을 수 있으려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "It's quite horrible!"
msgstr "꽤나 끔찍하군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHUM"
msgid "I suppose fish don't have an especially sophisticated palate."
msgstr "물고기는 미각이 그리 정교하지 않은 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't eat me, I'm unseasoned!"
msgstr "날 먹지 마, 나는 양념도 안 됐어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE"
msgid "Someone's a very talented sculptor."
msgstr "아주 재능이 뛰어난 조각가군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not on the menu!"
msgstr "난 먹이가 아니야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE"
msgid "It looks quite nice."
msgstr "꽤 멋져 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "I should stoke the fire."
msgstr "불을 다시 지펴야겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire that cools?"
msgstr "식혀 주는 불이라?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "The flames climb higher!"
msgstr "화염이 더 커지고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW"
msgid "It's getting low."
msgstr "약해지고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "I should like to sit by you for a moment."
msgstr "불 옆에 잠깐 앉고 싶네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
msgid "I will have to light you again."
msgstr "불을 다시 피워야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "I should stoke the fire."
msgstr "불을 다시 지펴야겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Fire that cools?"
msgstr "식혀 주는 불이라?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "The flames climb higher!"
msgstr "화염이 더 커지고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "It's getting low."
msgstr "약해지고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "I should like to sit by you for a moment."
msgstr "불 옆에 잠깐 앉고 싶네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "I will have to light you again."
msgstr "불을 다시 피워야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST"
msgid "I'm tired of the whole \"deconstructed\" trend."
msgstr "참치 해체하듯 완전히 산산조각 났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E"
msgid "East."
msgstr "동."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmm, no reading."
msgstr "흠, 방향을 알 수가 없네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N"
msgid "North."
msgstr "북."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE"
msgid "Northeast."
msgstr "북동."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW"
msgid "Northwest."
msgstr "북서."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S"
msgid "South."
msgstr "남."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE"
msgid "Southeast."
msgstr "남동."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW"
msgid "Southwest."
msgstr "남서."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W"
msgid "West."
msgstr "서."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOST"
msgid "The garden needs to be fed too, and proper plating is important!"
msgstr "정원에도 음식을 줘야하고 플레이팅도 중요해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED"
msgid "Tres bon!"
msgstr "트레 봉(아주 좋아)!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp."
msgstr "바삭하게 탔어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY"
msgid "Non, far too dry!"
msgstr "농(아니), 너무 건조해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "A good place for food scraps."
msgstr "음식물쓰레기를 두기에 안성맞춤인걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET"
msgid "Too runny, it needs less moisture."
msgstr "너무 묽으면 수분이 덜 넣어야해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP"
msgid "I'm frankly offended."
msgstr "이건 나에 대한 모독이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS"
msgid "It's a recipe for building!"
msgstr "건축 도면이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK"
msgid "I added a few of my own personal recipes."
msgstr "나만의 비밀 레시피를 몇 가지 적어 넣었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE"
msgid "Could use horseradish..."
msgstr "서양고추냉이가 있었으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT"
msgid "Could use a chimichurri sauce..."
msgstr "치미추리 소스가 있었으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT"
msgid "Could use... uh... I don't even..."
msgstr "뭔가가 더 필요한데... 전혀 감이 안 오네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT"
msgid "Could use sea salt..."
msgstr "바다 소금이 있었으면..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER"
msgid "Could I interest you in something other than my boat?"
msgstr "배 말고 다른 데는 관심이 없니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT"
msgid "Not the best looking hat, but c'est la vie."
msgstr "멋진 모자는 아니지만 인생이 원래 그렇지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL"
msgid "Reminds me a bit of a durian... mostly the smell."
msgstr "약간 두리안 같아... 특히 냄새가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, non! I cannot make out the recipe!"
msgstr "아, 이런! 레시피를 알아볼 수가 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "Tragique."
msgstr "비극이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "A masterpiece takes time."
msgstr "걸작은 오래 걸리는 법."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Nearly there..."
msgstr "거의 다 됐어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Ahh, fini!"
msgstr "아, 완성이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "Empty pot, empty heart."
msgstr "솥이 비니 마음도 허탈하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL"
msgid "Chat noodle."
msgstr "국수처럼 생겼네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN"
msgid "Corn! Sweet, sweet corn!"
msgstr "옥수수다! 정말 반갑다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED"
msgid "Could use miso and lardons..."
msgstr "된장과 비계가 있었으면 좋았을 텐데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Let's see, what shall I make with you? Corn gratin? Maque choux?"
msgstr "보자, 너로 뭘 만들지? 옥수수 그라탕? 옥수수 마끄 슈?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "미래의 식재료야, 다만 자라기를 기다리고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume for a blacksmith."
msgstr "대장장이 의상인 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume for a doll."
msgstr "인형 의상인 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume for a fool."
msgstr "어릿광대 의상인 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume fit for a King."
msgstr "왕에 걸맞은 의상인 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY"
msgid "I wonder whose costume this could be?"
msgstr "이건 누구의 의상이려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume fit for a Queen."
msgstr "여왕에 걸맞은 의상인 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY"
msgid "It seems to be a costume for a... tree?"
msgstr "이건... 나무를 위한 의상인 것 같은데?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC"
msgid "This statue is hungry for fuel."
msgstr "이 조각상은 연료에 굶주려 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT"
msgid "Perhaps I could fix it up a bit."
msgstr "조금 고칠 수 있을지도 모르겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC"
msgid "This statue is hungry for fuel."
msgstr "이 조각상은 연료에 굶주려 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
msgid "What a sweet little statue."
msgstr "이 작은 조각상은 정말 사랑스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC"
msgid "This statue is hungry for fuel."
msgstr "이 조각상은 연료에 굶주려 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT"
msgid "Such a comforting glow."
msgstr "참 따스한 빛이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET"
msgid "What an odd little chapeau."
msgstr "정말 이상한 모자군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "What a cozy-looking fellow."
msgstr "정말 푹신해 보이는 친구네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, the dishes I could make with that much crab meat..."
msgstr "아, 저 정도 게살이면 만들 수 있는 요리가 얼마야..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "It seems to be missing a few shiny ingredients."
msgstr "반짝이는 재료 몇 개가 사라진 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "It reminds me of a seafood tower, but more deadly."
msgstr "탑처럼 쌓인 해산물 요리가 생각나는군. 더 위험하지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "I had a nightmare like this back in culinary school."
msgstr "요리 학교에 다닐 때 이런 악몽을 꿨었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "The big crab built its own refridgerator."
msgstr "커다란 게가 냉장고를 만들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "You would go perfect with some lemon butter."
msgstr "레몬 버터를 곁들이면 딱 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "Wow. It's not even the main course."
msgstr "이야. 메인 메뉴도 아닌데 대단하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "I could use a friend in this difficult world."
msgstr "이런 힘든 세계에 친구가 있으면 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "Her name is \"Flambé\" and she is precious."
msgstr "귀염둥이 \"플랑베\"야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Would you like me to make you some bacon and eggs?"
msgstr "베이컨과 에그를 좀 만들어 줄까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "She's a great comfort in times of stress."
msgstr "스트레스를 받을 때 큰 위안이 돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "Sweet petite chat."
msgstr "작고 귀여운 고양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "This is Lambchop, my little kitchen helper."
msgstr "주방에서 날 도와주는 양 갈비야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "The light of my life!"
msgstr "내 삶의 빛이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "I would never eat you."
msgstr "넌 절대 먹지 않을게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Le petit chien!"
msgstr "작은 개야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Raven stew perhaps?"
msgstr "까마귀 스튜라도 끓일까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "Hush, my pet."
msgstr "쉿, 조용히 하렴."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "I'm on its delicious trail!"
msgstr "맛있는 흔적을 뒤쫓자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "It gives me a strange, bad feeling..."
msgstr "이상하고 불길한 느낌이 들어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "What shall I craft?"
msgstr "무엇을 만들까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "That is not a sword, it's a toothpick!"
msgstr "그건 검이 아니라 이쑤시개잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Hmm, odd."
msgstr "흠, 이상해라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Smells like greenery."
msgstr "풀 냄새가 나네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Compressed stones, nice presentation."
msgstr "반듯하게 잘 잘렸네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "I have decided on fear!"
msgstr "두려워해야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "I don't know whether to feel fear or pity."
msgstr "두려워해야 할지 불쌍하게 여겨야 할지 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "I may regret this, but I feel the urge to help this poor creature."
msgstr "나중에 후회할지도 모르지만, 이 불쌍한 생물을 돕고 싶군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps he is not so bad after all."
msgstr "그렇게 나쁜 녀석은 아닐지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "Uh-oh! Monsieur Cochon is boiling mad!"
msgstr "이런! 무슈 꼬숑이 부글부글 화를 내고 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "Ah zut, that stone is far too tough for me to break."
msgstr "아, 이런. 이 돌은 너무 단단해서 부술 수가 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps I could free the poor creature?"
msgstr "저 불쌍한 생명체를 풀어줘야 하지 않을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "I would not recommend this."
msgstr "별로 추천하고 싶진 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "Hmm... that might be good in a soup."
msgstr "흠... 수프에 넣으면 괜찮겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "Au revoir, tree."
msgstr "안녕, 나무야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Crisp, no?"
msgstr "아주 바삭하네?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Sliced!"
msgstr "썰렸네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A bouquet of leaves."
msgstr "잎이 무성하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "No thank you!"
msgstr "싫어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Maman loved her cards."
msgstr "어머니가 카드를 좋아하셨는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "It's no Rodin."
msgstr "로댕의 작품은 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "We must replace these at once."
msgstr "지금 당장 새 꽃을 꽂아야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Now we can all shine a little brighter."
msgstr "이제 전부 좀 더 밝게 빛날 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty, though I prefer flour."
msgstr "예쁘지만, 나는 식용 꽃이 더 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "It's looking pretty dim."
msgstr "꽤 어둑해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "I'm sorry, Maman."
msgstr "미안해요, 어머니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "Lumiere!"
msgstr "빛이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fine."
msgstr "괜찮아 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "My art is done in the kitchen."
msgstr "내 예술은 주방에서 이루어지지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "I long to see the face of Maman."
msgstr "어머니의 얼굴이 그립군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Shouldn't they have two antlers?"
msgstr "뿔이 두 개 있어야 하지 않나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "Imagine... succulent venison bourguignon."
msgstr "육즙이 풍부한 사슴 고기 부르기뇽이라… 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "I once had a saucier who looked like that."
msgstr "전에 이렇게 생긴 소스 담당자랑 일한 적 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "It is done. Well done."
msgstr "아주 푹 익었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What an unappetizing smell."
msgstr "입맛 떨어지는 냄새야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Mon dieu! What is happening?"
msgstr "세상에나! 이게 어떻게 된 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "If you can't take the heat, freeze the kitchen."
msgstr "\"더위를 견딜 수 없다면 주방을 얼려라\"."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "It's missing the SEEcret ingredient."
msgstr "비밀 재료가 빠졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "I'll whip it up tout de suite!"
msgstr "순식간에 설치할 수 있어, 뚜 드 수위뜨!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
