msgstr "이런, 농사를 망쳤네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
