msgstr "제발 안식에 들기를!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
