msgstr "간단히 무게를 재는 방법이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
