msgstr "가엾은 녀석이 너무 어지럽진 않아야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT"
