msgstr "열심히 훈련해, 친구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM"
