msgstr "전장의 조각이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK"
msgid "A piece of the battlefield."
msgstr "전장의 조각이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR"
msgid "Wooden flooring, a fine surface for mortal combat."
msgstr "나무 바닥은 필사의 투쟁을 하기에 좋은 표면이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER"
msgid "A true feast."
msgstr "진정한 진수성찬이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP"
msgid "I shall not consume it!"
msgstr "먹지 않겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "Ach! I shall not eat thee!"
msgstr "으악! 난 안 먹을 거다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "'Tis a handful of seeds, for not-meat."
msgstr "고기가 아닌 것의 씨앗 한 줌."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS"
msgid "Your armor shalln't stop my spear."
msgstr "네 갑옷은 내 창을 막지 못해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING"
msgid "The wood's ablaze!"
msgstr "나무가 불타고 있군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Loge took that one."
msgstr "로게께서 데려가셨군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Chopped by the warrior in the woods!"
msgstr "숲의 전사에게 베였군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "Disease festers within its soul."
msgstr "혼까지 병들었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Triumph will accompany its many resources."
msgstr "그 많은 자원에는 승리가 따르리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "It will one day rival Yggdrasil!"
msgstr "언젠가 위그드라실에 필적하게 될 테지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "Grow tall and strong."
msgstr "크고 씩씩하게 자라거라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "It will soon return to the earth."
msgstr "곧 흙으로 돌아가겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "Good for making spears."
msgstr "창을 만드는 데 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1"
msgid "Do thine worst, foul metal fiend!"
msgstr "최악으로 구는 구나, 불결한 금속 악마!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2"
msgid "Do thine worst, foul metal fiend!"
msgstr "최악으로 구는 구나, 불결한 금속 악마!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "Rain protection made from the trophy of a hunt."
msgstr "사냥의 전리품으로 만든 비 보호구로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "No need for food to be so fancy."
msgstr "음식이 그리 고급스러울 필요는 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "A mysterious relic, sure to contain great power."
msgstr "위대한 힘을 간직한 신비로운 유물이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET"
msgid "Bah! The eggs have been spoiled by non-meats!"
msgstr "쳇! 알이 고기가 아닌 것에 더럽혀졌지 않은가!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Good! Let it rot!"
msgstr "좋아! 썩으렴!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER"
msgid "Its spiciness intrigues me not!"
msgstr "양념을 해도 흥미 없다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Odd looking armor for a beast..."
msgstr "짐승을 위한 기이한 갑옷이야..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Remnants of a fallen foe."
msgstr "쓰러진 적의 흔적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT"
msgid "I despise the thought of hiding one's face in combat."
msgstr "전투에서 얼굴을 감추다니 혐오스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG"
msgid "There will be no escape for my foes."
msgstr "나의 적들이 도망칠 수 없으리라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT"
msgid "Even the sturdiest armor will sometimes need repairs."
msgstr "아무리 튼튼한 갑옷도 때로는 수리가 필요하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE"
msgid "A formidable weapon against non-meats."
msgstr "안고기를 상대하는 막강한 무기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A shield against the elements."
msgstr "기후에 대비하기 위한 방패로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY"
msgid "Well, it is technically made from a beast."
msgstr "뭐, 엄밀히 따지면 짐승으로 만든 것이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "Waffles are no way to prepare for battle!"
msgstr "전투를 준비하는 데 와플은 적당하지 않아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "'Tis an iron golem."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG"
msgid "We have severed the iron golem's limbs and yet it still stands."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED"
msgid "The forged beast is cursed!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET"
msgid "What doth he veil from us?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON"
msgid "It doth form a wall unseen? Witchcraft!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED"
msgid "'Tis dead but its parts may bring new life to another."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC"
msgid "Cursed iron harpies!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE"
msgid "It slumbers."
msgstr "자는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS"
msgid "Clockwork from a cursed contrivance."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED"
msgid "Shall it be resurrected, or its steel organs claimed to renew another?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY"
msgid "'Tis friend, no longer foe."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC"
msgid "I shall sunder thee, O metal menace!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE"
msgid "It slumbers."
msgstr "자는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT"
msgid "How may one kill with this?"
msgstr "이걸로 어떻게 죽이라는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT"
msgid "This helm doth be possessed by the spirit of a cunning warrior."
msgstr "이 투구에는 교활한 전사의 영혼이 깃들어 있구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS"
msgid "What use would a warrior have for such leavings?"
msgstr "전사에게 이런 쓰레기가 무슨 소용이란 말이냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL"
msgid "Let no soul flee the arena!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT"
msgid "Njord will not be pleased."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER"
msgid "A warrior trusts not cursed toggles."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION"
msgid "What maketh the gear-wright now?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1"
msgid "He hath left his gauntlet in our realm."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2"
msgid "These runes hath taken physical form."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY"
msgid "Be these the remains of a sacked outpost?"
msgstr "이건 약탈당한 전초기지의 잔해인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE"
msgid "Save it for the scholars!"
msgstr "이런 건 학자들에게나 줘라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC"
msgid "Hail stranger! Are ye friend or foe?"
msgstr "안녕 낯선 사람! 친구인지 적인지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS"
msgid "'Twas my pleasure dispatching that beast."
msgstr "그 짐승을 처치하는 건 내게도 기쁜 일이었노라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK"
msgid "The man doth make haste."
msgstr "아주 재빠른 자로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1"
msgid "Mayhaps this is what I seek."
msgstr "아마도 내가 찾는 그건데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2"
msgid "The odd stranger requested a tool, mayhaps this is it."
msgstr "이상한 낯선 사람이 도구를 달라는데 아마도 이거 겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3"
msgid "Is this what the odd stranger seeks?"
msgstr "이상한 낯선 사람이 이걸 찾는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4"
msgid "Mayhaps this is what the odd stranger lost."
msgstr "이상한 낯선 사람은 이걸 잃어버렸나봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5"
msgid "How strange. Perhaps it belongs to that odd stranger."
msgstr "정말 이상해. 아마 이건 저 이상한 낯선 사람 꺼 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "I shall never abandon my vessel!"
msgstr "난 절대 내 배를 버리지 않겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT"
msgid "I shall never abandon my vessel!"
msgstr "난 절대 내 배를 버리지 않겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS"
msgid "I shall never abandon my vessel!"
msgstr "난 절대 내 배를 버리지 않겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD"
msgid "Nay, a Viking doesn't quit so easily!"
msgstr "아니, 바이킹은 그리 쉽게 포기하지 않는다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK"
msgid "Carved with a fine blade, by a skilled hand."
msgstr "뛰어난 솜씨와 훌륭한 칼날로 조각했구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE"
msgid "These fortifications will strike fear into my enemies' hearts!"
msgstr "이 방어 시설이 적의 마음 속에 공포심을 불어넣으리라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM"
msgid "Fashioned from cursed stone."
msgstr "저주받은 돌로 만들었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "That won't do at all."
msgstr "그것으로는 안되겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "A minor deterrent to attackers."
msgstr "누가 쳐들어오면 별로 막지 못하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "Perhaps my foes will get lost in this hay."
msgstr "적이 지푸라기 속에서 길을 잃을지도 모르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Wholly impregnable, a worthy fortification!"
msgstr "절대로 뚫리지 않을 단단한 요새로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "Our fortress shall be impenetrable!"
msgstr "우리 요새는 절대 뚫리지 않아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "Nigh impenetrable."
msgstr "거의 뚫을 수 없을 정도야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2"
msgid "Nigh impenetrable."
msgstr "거의 뚫을 수 없을 정도야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "Only the finest barriers for my fort."
msgstr "내 요새에는 좋은 자재만 쓸 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP"
msgid "It'll do."
msgstr "쓸 만하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM"
msgid "It'll do."
msgstr "쓸 만하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "My enemies will dash themselves on these rocks."
msgstr "적들은 이 돌벽에 몸을 던지겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2"
msgid "My enemies will dash themselves on these rocks."
msgstr "적들은 이 돌벽에 몸을 던지겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "A sturdy wall, fashioned from the earth."
msgstr "땅으로 만든 튼튼한 벽이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Fire, wood's only weakness!"
msgstr "불은 나무의 유일한 약점이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "It may impale a foe."
msgstr "적을 꿰뚫을 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "A mediocre fortification."
msgstr "그저 그런 자재로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "Those tusks could pierce even the finest armor."
msgstr "저 엄니는 최고의 갑옷도 뚫을 수 있지요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "Highland filth!"
msgstr "산악 지대의 쓰레기!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "They have departed for a great journey."
msgstr "긴 여행을 위해 떠났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "A proper winter camp."
msgstr "제대로 된 겨울 야영지로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "Rended from the mouth of the sea beast."
msgstr "바다 짐승의 입에서 뽑아낸 것이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Consider your actions wisely, %s."
msgstr "행동을 신중하게 해라, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s, why do you break your cherished code?"
msgstr "%s, 잘 따르던 규칙을 왜 어기는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Good health to you, %s, and to your loyal beast!"
msgstr "몸 건강하기를, %s! 네 충성스러운 짐승도!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "By my honor, I will bring you back to this world!"
msgstr "내 명예를 걸고 너를 되살리겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "Have at thee, you and your wicked beast!"
msgstr "각오해라, 사악한 짐승 달린 녀석!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s carries with him a true sense of honor."
msgstr "%s, 도의심이 대단해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "The helm of the \"Pinetree Pioneer\" clan."
msgstr "\"소나무 개척단\" 부족의 투구다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER"
msgid "You think it wise to test me, %s?"
msgstr "나를 시험하는 게 현명하다고 생각하니, %s?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I don't wish to question your intentions, %s..."
msgstr "왜 그런 건지 묻고 싶지는 않아, %s..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC"
msgid "Good health to you through the ages, %s!"
msgstr "세월이 흘러도 건강하렴. %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST"
msgid "Fear not! I will find you a heart, with utmost haste!"
msgstr "겁내지마! 최대한 빨리 심장을 찾아줄게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER"
msgid "Thou shall answer for this betrayal, %s! Meet my spear!"
msgstr "배신에 대한 답을 들어야지, %s! 내 창을 받아라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a powerful ally indeed."
msgstr "%s 녀석은 실로 강력한 동맹이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC"
msgid "Wretched beast. Shall I grant it peace?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED"
msgid "The pelt-bearer cometh to ply his wares."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "No, my furs and cloaks!"
msgstr "안 돼! 안에 내 모피랑 망토가 들었는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "No use crying over burnt pelts."
msgstr "이제 와 울어봤자 무슨 소용이람."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's where I keep my furs and cloaks."
msgstr "내 모피와 망토를 보관하는 곳이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "Be that you, Fenrir?"
msgstr "그대인가요, 펜리르?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Thou art worthy of a Viking funeral."
msgstr "그대에게는 바이킹 장례를 치를 자격이 있도다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "The creature is slain."
msgstr "괴물이 죽었구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "The beast's spirit will not be put to rest!"
msgstr "저 짐승의 영혼은 안식에 들려 하지 않는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGLET"
msgid "Ha! I've felled more fearsome beasts than ye!"
msgstr "하! 나는 너보다 더 무시무시한 야수도 쓰러뜨렸어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Laid to waste."
msgstr "폐허가 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What doth thou need?"
msgstr "무엇을 원하는가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "The gods are pleased!"
msgstr "신들이 기뻐하는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER"
msgid "What nefarious plots doth %s stew upon?"
msgstr "%s이(가) 어떤 흉악한 음모를 꾸미는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s's summoned Hel's flames this day!"
msgstr "%s이(가) 오늘 헬의 화염을 소환했다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hail, %s, blessed feast-forge!"
msgstr "축복받은 성찬 요리사 %s 만세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST"
msgid "The feast hall of Valhalla will one day welcome you. But not today."
msgstr "언젠가 발할라의 연회장이 널 반기겠지만 그게 오늘은 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "We will hold a valorous feast at your defeat!"
msgstr "널 물리치고 성대한 잔치를 베풀겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's heart is as full as his belly."
msgstr "%s의 마음은 그 배만큼이나 넉넉하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Garb befitting a warrior's steed!"
msgstr "전사의 군마에 어울리는 복장이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "Bees of war!"
msgstr "전쟁의 벌들!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "Prepare to engage in water-y battle!"
msgstr "물의 전투 개시 준비!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "The plants expect me to fetch water for them as well?"
msgstr "식물들도 내가 물을 길러오기를 기대하려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Watering the garden is not a task befitting a warrior."
msgstr "정원에 물을 주는 것은 전사에게 어울리는 일이 아니지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "It makes a good sound when you hit it."
msgstr "두드리면 듣기 좋은 소리가 난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "It's almost like wearing a pelt."
msgstr "가죽 모자를 쓴 거랑 느낌이 비슷하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "You cannot fool me by hiding in frozen fruit, stick."
msgstr "얼린 과일 안에 숨어도 막대기는 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Warm and red, but it doesn't flow."
msgstr "따뜻하고 빨간색이지만 흐르지는 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Was this grown by a jotunn?"
msgstr "이거 요툰이 키운건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "Seedy."
msgstr "씨 많거든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid "Have we entered the realm of giants?"
msgstr "거인의 왕국에 들어온 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "Grow fast and strong, young one."
msgstr "튼튼하게 빨리 자라렴, 꼬마야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "Have at thee, plant!"
msgstr "각오해라, 식물!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Fear not, I shall return you to the sea in time."
msgstr "두려워하지 마. 곧 바다로 되돌려줄 테니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "We hath safeguarded our vessel against a fiery end."
msgstr "우리 배가 화염 속에 스러지는 일을 막았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "By the gods, have I found Yggdrasil itself?"
msgstr "아이고, 내가 위그드라실 그 자체를 찾은 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT"
msgid "What is it you seek, yon root?"
msgstr "찾고 있는 게 뭐야, 저 뿌리?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is tempting fate."
msgstr "%s은(는) 위험한 장난을 좋아하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "A fellow Viking, forged in flames!"
msgstr "불에 단련된 바이킹 동지로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Hail, %s, fellow shieldmaiden!"
msgstr "여어 %s, 방패 여전사 동료 만세!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "You'll not away to Valhalla yet, %s. A heart!"
msgstr "아직은 발할라로 갈 수 없어, %s. 심장이여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "한 명만 있을 수 있지요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s, the perfect warrior!"
msgstr "최고의 전사 %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "The power of the unicorn is great."
msgstr "일각수의 힘은 위대하여라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT"
msgid "The unicorn hath bestowed its power onto me."
msgstr "유니콘이 내게 힘을 내렸도다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD"
msgid "I shall defend my allies with spear and shield!"
msgstr "창과 방패로 내 아군을 보호하리라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT"
msgid "Unnaturally preserved... it doth make one's skin crawl."
msgstr "자연의 섭리를 거스르고 보존되다니... 소름이 돋는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Waxen to the touch."
msgstr "만지면 왁스가 묻어난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "I sense Loki's influence in %s."
msgstr "%s에게서 로키의 손길이 느껴지는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Loki has brought %s into a world of flame."
msgstr "로키가 %s을(를) 불의 세계로 인도했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s, my ally!"
msgstr "전우 %s, 안녕!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "A heart could return %s to this realm if we so wished."
msgstr "원한다면 %s을(를) 다시 부활시킬 수 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "%s! Back to your old tricks, I see!"
msgstr "%s! 예전 버릇을 차마 못 버렸구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has uncovered the kindness buried within his heart."
msgstr "%s이(가) 간만에 좋은 일을 했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC"
msgid "A tragic tale of woe and misery!"
msgstr "비애와 비참함으로 가득한 비극적인 이야기!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "There's a new hunger in %s's eyes."
msgstr "%s의 눈빛에 전에는 없던 갈급함이 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "His flames are as open as his heart."
msgstr "불길이 곧 심장에 구멍을 내고 말겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "Blessings upon you, spiderchild %s!"
msgstr "거미 아이 %s에게 축복이 있기를!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "Return with Sleipnir's swiftness, many-legged one."
msgstr "슬레이프니르의 신속함으로 돌아오기를, 많은 다리를 가진 자여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "I've felled greater monsters than you, %s!"
msgstr "난 너보다 더 강한 몬스터도 많이 쓰러뜨렸다고, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s's spirit burns brighter than Sol."
msgstr "%s의 영혼이 솔보다 더 밝게 빛나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "He fought boldly, but his burial will not be that of a Viking."
msgstr "그는 용감하게 싸웠지만 바이킹의 장례를 치르지는 않겠군요."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "I see naught but allies."
msgstr "아군밖에 안 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY"
msgid "This weed is armed with thorns."
msgstr "이 잡초는 가시로 무장했네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Do not test me, fair maiden!"
msgstr "나를 시험하지 마라, 예쁜 아가씨야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Ah. Have you singed your dress, fair maiden?"
msgstr "저런, 옷에 불똥이라도 튀었니, 예쁜 아가씨?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Spirits be with you, %s!"
msgstr "혼령들이 함께 하기를, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "%s's restless spirit could be revived with a heart."
msgstr "심장이 있으면 %s의 쉬지 못하고 있는 혼을 부활시킬 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "%s, your body is weak but your heart is strong! Fight!"
msgstr "%s, 네 몸은 비록 약하지만 마음은 강하지! 싸워!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is channeling the spirit of Eir."
msgstr "%s이(가) 에이르의 영을 중재하고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE"
msgid "A warrior doth run toward death, not from it!"
msgstr "전사는 죽음을 피하는 게 아니라 죽음을 향해 달려든다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER"
msgid "Is this meant to summon your fylgja?"
msgstr "이게 네 필기야를 소환하는 방법인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE"
msgid "It's... er... very fearsome!"
msgstr "어... 참... 무시무시하구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE"
msgid "It represents a warrior's spirit!"
msgstr "전사의 혼을 상징하는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "Do you bite your thumb at me, mime?"
msgstr "지금 나를 모욕하려는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't ruin your fair makeup with ashes, %s."
msgstr "화장 잘 먹은 얼굴을 재로 망치지 마, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Good health to you, %s!"
msgstr "몸 건강하기를, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "Meditate on Hoenir's blessings, %s. I'll find a heart."
msgstr "회니르의 축북을 명상하고 있어, %s. 심장은 내가 찾아줄게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "May we meet again in Valhalla!"
msgstr "발할라에서 다시 만나기를!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has Hoenir's blessing."
msgstr "%s에게 회니르의 축복이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "Slop."
msgstr "질퍽하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "Tis drenched."
msgstr "흠뻑 젖었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "A treasure lies within!"
msgstr "안에 보물이 있다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "Loud and powerful!"
msgstr "요란하고 강하군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "If %s is looking for trouble, I shall oblige!"
msgstr "%s이(가) 문제를 일으키고 싶다면, 응해줘야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I'll not question your wisdom, %s."
msgstr "분명 무슨 이유가 있어서 그런 거겠지, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Good health and wisdom to you, elder %s!"
msgstr "건강과 지혜가 늘 함께하기를, %s(이)여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "A heart! A heart! My base for a heart!"
msgstr "심장! 심장! 심장이 필요한 곳!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Face me in battle!"
msgstr "살인자! 당당하게 나와 붙자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "The wisdom of Wotan dwells within you, %s."
msgstr "%s 안에 보탄의 지혜가 깃들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "Should it come to blows, may the best maiden triumph."
msgstr "싸우게 된다면 가장 뛰어난 여전사가 이기기를."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s has more fire in her eyes than usual."
msgstr "%s의 눈에 불기운이 평소보다 더 이글거리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s, the Inflammable!"
msgstr "반갑군, 불의 용사 %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "A heart shall wrench %s back from the jaws of death!"
msgstr "심장이 있으면 %s을(를) 죽음의 아가리에서 꺼내줄 수 있지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "My spear was forged in passionate fires, %s!"
msgstr "내 창은 열정의 불로 벼린 것이지, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "%s has a noble heart."
msgstr "%s의 마음씨는 참으로 고귀하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "Your honor wavers, %s."
msgstr "당신의 명예가 훼손되고 있어요, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Hm. I worry about you sometimes, %s."
msgstr "흐음. 가끔은 %s이(가) 걱정된다니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Wisdom guide you, %s!"
msgstr "지혜가 인도하기를, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "The fate of the Draugr is not yours, %s. A heart!"
msgstr "%s에게 드라우그의 운명은 허락되지 않았지. 심장이 필요하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "%s! Let us settle this in battle!"
msgstr "%s! 전투로 승부를 내자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "%s protects our people."
msgstr "%s은(는) 아군을 보호하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC"
msgid "The ocean is mine to pillage."
msgstr "바다는 내가 약탈하겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM"
