msgstr "불을 조금 더해서 극적인 효과를 내 볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT"
msgid "A homely statue. Perhaps it can be improved."
msgstr "아늑한 조각상이군. 개선할 수 있을지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's add a little fire for dramatic effect."
msgstr "불을 조금 더해서 극적인 효과를 내 볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT"
msgid "How delightfully ominous."
msgstr "즐거울 정도로 불길하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's add a little fire for dramatic effect."
msgstr "불을 조금 더해서 극적인 효과를 내 볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT"
msgid "There's something captivating about it."
msgstr "뭔가 매혹적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET"
msgid "Not my size, sadly."
msgstr "아쉽지만 나한텐 안 맞아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "I could have sworn I left you all underground."
msgstr "분명 너희를 전부 지하에 놔두고 온 줄 알았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "Say, pal, why don't we try to work this out?"
msgstr "어이, 친구. 말로 해결하는 게 어때?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "I suppose we can't just leave well enough alone, can we?"
msgstr "긁어 부스럼을 만들어야 직성이 풀리나 보지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "Watch it where you shoot those things!"
msgstr "잘 보고 쏴라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "Best to avoid that."
msgstr "저건 피하는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
