msgstr "누군가 어둠의 마법과 주술로 장난을 친 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "누군가 어둠의 마법과 주술로 장난을 친 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "누군가 어둠의 마법과 주술로 장난을 친 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "It appears someone has been toying with the dark arts and crafts."
msgstr "누군가 어둠의 마법과 주술로 장난을 친 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "An elegantly wrapped social obligation."
msgstr "우아하게 포장한 사회적 의무."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "For wrapping odds and ends..."
msgstr "무언가를 포장할 때 쓰는 것..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "Entirely too gaudy."
msgstr "전반적으로 너무 촌스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "Must you make me chase you?"
msgstr "꼭 내가 쫓아가게 해야겠나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Pretty brash for something so edible."
msgstr "먹을 수 있는 것치고는 꽤 건방지군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "Not the castle I had in mind for myself."
msgstr "내가 원하는 성은 이런 게 아닌데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "Sharp like my wit."
msgstr "내 재치처럼 날카롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "I hope I'm not so transparent."
msgstr "내가 이렇게까지 투명하진 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "A flying goop factory."
msgstr "날아다니는 점액 공장이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's drooling in its sleep."
msgstr "자면서 침을 흘리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "Flower power forever."
msgstr "영원한 꽃의 힘이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Flower power."
msgstr "꽃의 힘이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Well, that's rank."
msgstr "흠, 고약하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "They're sticky."
msgstr "끈적끈적하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "What a nice change it is to know someone who cooks."
msgstr "요리하는 사람을 알게 돼서 다행이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "It seems you've lost something, pal."
msgstr "뭔가 잃은 모양이군, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "Shame about your horn, pal."
msgstr "뿔이 그렇게 돼서 유감이야, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "We've come to an agreement."
msgstr "합의점을 찾았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps it could be reasoned with."
msgstr "잘 타이를 수 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "Impressive."
msgstr "대단하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "It's charged with nutrients."
msgstr "영양분이 가득 들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Not my sort of fashion."
msgstr "내 취향의 패션은 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "It gets sharper with every cut."
msgstr "도끼질할 때마다 날카로워지지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "This must be game logic."
msgstr "게임 논리에선 이게 통용되나 보군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "I'm not sure this was a good investment."
msgstr "괜히 낭비를 한 건 아닌가 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "This shovel is worth a princely sum."
msgstr "정말 값나가는 삽이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "A bit extravagant, don't you think?"
msgstr "약간 사치스러워, 그렇지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "This was important to me once."
msgstr "한때는 나에게 매우 중요했었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "I could use a pillow filled with these."
msgstr "이걸로 가득 채운 베개를 쓰고 싶군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "Needs manure."
msgstr "거름이 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr "이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "What has brought this blight upon my world?"
msgstr "누가 나의 세계에 이런 끔찍한 병을 일으킨 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Looks a little off, if you ask me."
msgstr "좀 상한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Tufty."
msgstr "잘 자라는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "Nothing to harvest."
msgstr "수확할 것이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "You'd think grass could withstand this heat..."
msgstr "풀이라면 이 정도 더위는 견딜 수 있을 줄 알았는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "Quite a skittish creature."
msgstr "꽤 겁이 많은 생명체야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "It's sickly and frail."
msgstr "병들고 약하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm sure its tail grows back."
msgstr "꼬리가 다시 자라겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "It's more \"pretty\" than \"dapper\"."
msgstr "멋지다기보다는 예쁘다고 해야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone forgot to add the spirit."
msgstr "누가 영혼을 넣는 걸 깜빡했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "I have to be nice to dead people now?"
msgstr "이젠 망자들한테도 친절하게 굴어야 하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "I have a tendency to overdo it on the gravy."
msgstr "난 그레이비를 너무 오래 익히는 경향이 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "A crutch for pitiful mortals without godlike powers. What?"
msgstr "신의 능력이 없는 비참한 중생에게 필요한 보조 도구지. 뭐라고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Only the nightmare fuel will unlock its true potential."
msgstr "악몽 연료만이 진정한 잠재력을 해방시킬 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "It's useful for keeping in contact with my... acquaintances."
msgstr "아는... 자들과 연락할 때 유용하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "It is a focusing tool."
msgstr "초점이 되어주는 도구군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "I should eat it."
msgstr "먹어야겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Salty!"
msgstr "짜군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Green fungus."
msgstr "녹색 버섯이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "When do those ones come up?"
msgstr "이건 언제 올라오려나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Been there. Done that."
msgstr "다 보고, 다 해봤지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "Don't expect me to wade in there for some wretched moon glass."
msgstr "형편없는 달 유리를 찾아 거기에 걸어 들어가리라고는 기대하지 말아줘."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "I suppose it is quite picturesque."
msgstr "상당히 그림같은 풍경이 아닐까 싶어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "There's a mole in the mix."
msgstr "뭐가 잔뜩 섞였군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Disgusting!"
msgstr "역겹군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Now THIS I like."
msgstr "이건 정말 마음에 드는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "Oh good, it's solid candy. I feared something healthy had snuck in."
msgstr "오호라, 달달한 사탕이군. 건강 식품 같은 게 들어왔을까 봐 걱정했는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "No one is above enjoying a good lollipop."
msgstr "맛있는 막대사탕을 마다할 사람은 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "Eating them makes me feel powerful."
msgstr "먹으면 강해진 느낌이 들지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "Ah, maggots... how novel."
msgstr "아, 구더기... 진부하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's not terrible."
msgstr "나쁘진 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "Only ruffians enjoy torturing themselves like this."
msgstr "겁쟁이들이나 이런 걸로 스스로를 고문하는 걸 즐기지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "Waxy, just like me."
msgstr "매끈하군, 나처럼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "Who is making all this candy, exactly?"
msgstr "대체 이 많은 사탕은 누가 다 만드는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Black licorice, my favorite."
msgstr "내가 좋아하는 검은 리코리스군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "Almost endearing. Almost."
msgstr "귀여우려다 말았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "A mystery I'm not keen on solving."
msgstr "딱히 풀고 싶지 않은 수수께끼다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "I am much more disappointed than I thought I'd be."
msgstr "생각보다 훨씬 더 실망스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "No one is above enjoying a good lollipop."
msgstr "맛있는 막대사탕을 마다할 사람은 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "How the tables have turned, worm."
msgstr "상황이 역전되었군, 벌레여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "Takes away the horrors. But who would want that?"
msgstr "공포를 없앴군. 그럼 무슨 재미가 있다고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "Ah. This'll do the trick."
msgstr "아. 이것이면 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "Could be a little stronger."
msgstr "좀 더 강했으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "Might as well throw it in the fire."
msgstr "불에 넣어버리는 게 낫겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "A fine pot of tea, with a side of mutation."
msgstr "돌연변이 효과가 있는 근사한 차 한 주전자군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Oh joy. Is there really need for decoration?"
msgstr "이런. 장식 따위가 정말 필요한가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "Such a burden to carry it. If only there were a place to leave it."
msgstr "들고 다니기 부담스럽군. 어디 적당히 놓아둘 만한 데 없나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "I like the real ones better."
msgstr "진짜 거미가 더 좋은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "Shouldn't it be hanging from somewhere."
msgstr "어디에 걸어야 하지 않나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "Ugh. These guys again."
msgstr "윽. 또 이 놈들이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "Why do I hear \"Nevermore\"?"
msgstr "\"이젠 끝이야\"라고 하는 소리가 들리는 것 같다?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "An undignified weapon for a less refined time."
msgstr "덜 세련된 시대의 품위 없는 무기이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "It feels good to undo the work of others."
msgstr "다른 자의 작업을 망치는 것은 기분이 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "I would never resort to something so brutish."
msgstr "저런 무식한 것은 절대로 쓰지 않겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "What is the thread count on this?"
msgstr "이건 몇 수짜리 원단으로 만들었지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Looking at it is making me seasick."
msgstr "보기만 해도 뱃멀미가 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Can you rightfully call a sack of potpourri a pillow?"
msgstr "꽃잎을 채운 자루도 베개라고 할 수 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "At least it will make a satisfying thwack."
msgstr "적어도 만족스러운 찰싹 소리가 나긴 하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "You must be joking."
msgstr "지금 농담하는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "The dapperest of them all."
msgstr "아주 말쑥한 차림이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Just a bit of venom and some dirty old ash."
msgstr "약간의 독액과 더럽고 오래된 재를 섞었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "Must everything in this cursed place be either slimy or smelly or both?"
msgstr "이 저주받은 곳은 뭐든 끈적거리거나, 냄새나거나, 둘 다여야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I could be persuaded to dabble in white magicks."
msgstr "백마법을 조금 써도 괜찮겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "Pleasantly cool."
msgstr "기분 좋게 서늘하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "It's almost too cold to hold."
msgstr "쥐기 어려울 정도로 차갑군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "A pocketful of stone and temperature."
msgstr "주머니에 들어가는 돌과 온기지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "It's almost too hot to hold."
msgstr "쥐기 어려울 정도로 뜨겁군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "Comfortably lukewarm."
msgstr "기분 좋게 따뜻하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "The critics here will really eat you alive."
msgstr "이곳의 비평가들은 말 그대로 잡아먹을 기세야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Nice try."
msgstr "시도는 좋았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "I have better things to do than being berated by an old crab."
msgstr "늙은 게한테 욕을 먹고 있을 정도로 한가하진 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "Picky crab wants the perfect spot."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "It's an improvement."
msgstr "나아졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a sad little hovel."
msgstr "참 작고 초라한 우리군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "How... quaint."
msgstr "참으로...진기하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "Nautical decor was never my style."
msgstr "항해를 컨셉으로 하는 장식은 절대로 내 스타일이 아니었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "Ah. I thought I'd run out of people to disappoint."
msgstr "아. 이제 더는 실망시킬 사람도 없을 줄 알았건만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "It's... strange to be so trusted."
msgstr "이렇게... 신뢰를 받으니 기분이 이상하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "Makes one feel like royalty."
msgstr "왕족이 된 느낌이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "There's no place like it."
msgstr "가장 편한 곳이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Somehow, it says even less now."
msgstr "어째 전보다 더 적힌 글이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "\"You are here\"... I wish I wasn't!"
msgstr "'현재 위치'라... 내 의지로 여기 있는 건 아니야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "This requires profundity."
msgstr "심오하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Sticky and sweet."
msgstr "끈적하고 달다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "It's full of bee maggots."
msgstr "벌 애벌레가 가득 들어있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Tender."
msgstr "연하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "These look childish, but they're delicious."
msgstr "애들이 먹는 것이지만 맛있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "Call forth the beasts!"
msgstr "짐승을 대령하라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "That's the good stuff."
msgstr "이건 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Hot as heck!"
msgstr "아주 뜨겁다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "How posh."
msgstr "참 고급스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "It's of no use to me like this."
msgstr "이래서는 아무 쓸모가 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "I miss a good long bath."
msgstr "느긋한 목욕이 그립군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "I could make use of that glass."
msgstr "저 유리를 쓸 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "They don't recognize me!"
msgstr "나를 못 알아보는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "Hungry devils, aren't they?"
msgstr "아주 배가 고팠나 보군?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "걸맞은 최후로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish we'd get rid of that."
msgstr "없애 버리고 싶군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's coming alive again!"
msgstr "다시 살아나고 있잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "It's a tunnel down to the hounds' nest."
msgstr "개 소굴로 내려가는 터널이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "It could be used for fashion."
msgstr "패션 소품으로 사용할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "Houndstooth? Both deadly and debonair."
msgstr "개 이빨이라고? 치명적이고도 멋지군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "Howl I ever find a use for this?"
msgstr "이게 쓸 데나 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Stick your tongue in. You're getting slobber on my pantlegs."
msgstr "혀를 그렇게 빼물고서는 내 바지에 침을 잔뜩 묻히는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "Better him in that bowl than me."
msgstr "저 어항에 내가 들어가 있는 것보다야 낫지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "His spirit is free now."
msgstr "영혼이 드디어 자유를 찾았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "Baby glaciers."
msgstr "아기 빙하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Ice, ice, maybe."
msgstr "얼음, 얼음 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "It's melted."
msgstr "녹았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "It's melted."
msgstr "녹았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "A little piece of winter in a box."
msgstr "상자 안에 작은 겨울이 들어 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "Sundae, sundae, sundae!"
msgstr "선디, 선디, 아이스크림 선디!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Strap some ice on your head."
msgstr "머리를 얼음찜질하기 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "I had a lot of surplus gems!"
msgstr "나 보석이 정말 많이 남아돌았었구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Its contents are hibernating."
msgstr "내용물이 동면하고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "Cool staff."
msgstr "차가운 지팡이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Chilling."
msgstr "차갑다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can see its true nature now!"
msgstr "이제 진짜 모습을 볼 수 있군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "It only half-exists on this plane."
msgstr "이 차원에선 절반만 존재하고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "How long has that old fool been hiding his trash here?!"
msgstr "그 늙은이가 언제부터 이곳에 쓰레기를 숨겨 놓은 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "I still look dapper, right? As if I need to check."
msgstr "그래도 여전히 멋지군. 확인할 필요도 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "Disgusting."
msgstr "역겹군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "I nearly got my suit caught on those thorns!"
msgstr "가시에 옷이 걸릴 뻔 했잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "It's soiled my good gloves."
msgstr "나의 좋은 장갑을 망쳤군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "I think there's seventeen in there."
msgstr "안에 열일곱 개가 들어 있는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "Have I really been reduced to sifting through the trash?"
msgstr "진정 내 신세가 쓰레기를 뒤지는 지경까지 이른 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG"
msgid "One false move could send the whole pile tumbling down."
msgstr "한 번만 실수해도 온 더미가 쓰러지겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "We couldn't even spare a little salt?"
msgstr "우리가 소금도 못 치는 형편이라니!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Cooked to perfection."
msgstr "완벽하게 요리했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "Can I eat something that's not slimy for once?"
msgstr "한 번이라도 미끈거리지 않는 것 좀 먹을 수 없나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "You really expect me to wear this?"
msgstr "나보고 정말 이걸 쓰라고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "This was not an improvement."
msgstr "달라진 게 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "Sadly, I've eaten worse out here."
msgstr "슬프지만 여기선 더한 것도 먹어 봤지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "What is that bee so angry about?"
msgstr "벌이 왜 저리도 화난 상태인 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "I've caught a tiger by the tail."
msgstr "호랑이의 꼬리를 잡고 있는 격이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Whatever will we do without it."
msgstr "이게 없이 하게 되는 건 뭐라도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "Those creatures are so feeble of mind they can't tell a real bird from a wooden one."
msgstr "이 생명체는 마음이 너무 여려서 진짜 새와 나무 새조차 구별할 수 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Surely someone else can set it up."
msgstr "누가 설치해주겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "A pity."
msgstr "한심하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "At least it should keep them occupied."
msgstr "최소한 녀석들을 동분서주하게 할 수는 있겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Physical labor is what underlings are for."
msgstr "육체노동은 아랫것들의 몫이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "No place to hide anymore."
msgstr "더는 숨을 곳이 없단다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "A house for kitcoons? Can the pitiful little things not climb trees yet?"
msgstr "애옹쿤의 집인가? 이 가련한 꼬맹이 녀석들은 아직 나무 위로 올라가지 못하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "They are not here, they are out hiding."
msgstr "여긴 없어, 다른 데 숨어 있을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "We are nearly out of time to find all of the rascals."
msgstr "이 악동들을 전부 찾기에는 시간이 거의 끝나가고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "I don't see why I need to build them a house. They need to learn to climb trees like adults."
msgstr "왜 내가 쟤네들 집을 지어줘야 하는 지 모르겠어. 쟤네도 어른들처럼 나무를 타고 오르는 걸 배워야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It will likely grow up to pick my pockets."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 자라서 내 주머니를 털겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. Those ears are ridiculous."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 귀가 우스꽝스러워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It's encumbered by excess fur."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 털속에 파묻혔구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. Just looking at it makes me itch."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 보기만 해도 간질간질해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It smells of sulphur."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 유황 냄새가 나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It requires dental work."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 치과 치료를 받아야겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "I've named so many creatures at this point, the novelty has worn off."
msgstr "여기서 참 많은 생물의 이름을 지어줬고 참신함이 사라졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It doesn't even have the grace of a catcoon."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 냥냥쿤의 위엄조차 보이지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature. It's pretending to be a much more respectable beast."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체구나. 자기보다 훨씬 더 존경스러운 짐승인 척 하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "What a pathetic little creature, and in such a gaudy outfit."
msgstr "정말 애처롭고 귀여운 생명체인데다 옷차림이 휘황찬란하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "My, what a magnificently horrific creature."
msgstr "이런, 대단히 공포스러운 생물체군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Magic has done things to this beast's horn."
msgstr "마법이 짐승의 뿔에 이상한 짓을 했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "What dark treasures lie within?"
msgstr "어떤 어둠의 보물이 들어있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "Such quality workmanship!"
msgstr "훌륭한 장인의 솜씨군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "It looks beyond repair."
msgstr "수리가 불가능한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "What else can I say about this dirty carcass?"
msgstr "이 더러운 시체에 대해 달리 할 말이 뭐 있겠어?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "A distant cousin of the beefalo."
msgstr "비팔로의 먼 사촌이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "It has its winter coat on."
msgstr "겨울 코트를 입고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "I hope it was well cleaned before we stuffed the figs inside."
msgstr "안에 무화과를 채우기 전에 깨끗히 씻어져 있으면 좋겠네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "You won't catch me!"
msgstr "날 잡을 순 없지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "It's really light."
msgstr "정말 가볍군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "I hope it keeps Them away."
msgstr "이걸로 거리를 유지할 수 있으면 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "They're acceptable."
msgstr "그럭저럭 괜찮군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY"
msgid "Quite a clunky looking thing."
msgstr "꽤 거추장스러워 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "Seems heavy."
msgstr "무거워 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "It is nearly useless."
msgstr "거의 쓸모가 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "Swiftly useless."
msgstr "빠르지만 쓸모가 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "It offers a serviceable amount of protection."
msgstr "적당한 방어력을 제공하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "This was intended for someone physically-inclined."
msgstr "신체 능력이 뛰어난 자를 위한 것이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "Decent protection that will enhance my power."
msgstr "내 능력을 향상시킬 적당한 방어구로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "A little extra armor never hurt."
msgstr "갑옷이 튼튼해서 나쁠 건 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "We must destroy that Battle Standard."
msgstr "전투 깃발을 파괴해야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "That thing's still shambling about, I see."
msgstr "아직도 움직이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "You seem severely deluded, good sir."
msgstr "심각한 착각에 빠져있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "You'd need a thick neck to wear such a thing."
msgstr "이런 걸 착용하려면 목이 아주 굵어야 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "You shall serve us."
msgstr "우리를 섬겨라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "I must have it."
msgstr "내가 꼭 가져야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "Horsefeathers."
msgstr "말의 깃털."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "Not really my style."
msgstr "내 스타일이 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "I could use the invigoration."
msgstr "나도 그 힘이 탐나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "Self sufficiency in wreath form."
msgstr "자급자족에 최적화된 꽃."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "Too brutish for my tastes."
msgstr "내가 쓰기엔 너무 투박하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "A key is key."
msgstr "열쇠는 열쇠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Right as rain."
msgstr "꼭 맞는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "That is not suited to me."
msgstr "나에게는 어울리지 않는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "I have no desire to use that."
msgstr "쓰고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Meddling with it will only cause further trouble."
msgstr "쓰면 문제만 생기겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Let us end this chapter of our journey."
msgstr "이 여행에 종지부를 찍지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "It will quickly restore my powers."
msgstr "내 능력을 빠르게 다시 사용할 수 있게 해주는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "It's a one-way portal."
msgstr "편도 포털이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'd never wear such an undapper thing."
msgstr "저런 추한 것은 절대로 쓰지 않겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "A decent wreath, should I feel like healing."
msgstr "치료가 필요할 때 쓰기 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "Foul beast! Know your place!"
msgstr "더러운 짐승! 주제를 알아야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "It's no threat in this state."
msgstr "이 상태로는 위협이 아니지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's alive in there."
msgstr "안에 생명이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "I knew I would make a terrible pa-pa."
msgstr "나는 좋은 아빠가 될 사람이 아니란 건 알고 있었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "I can say with pride that it is comfy and cozy."
msgstr "정말로 편하고 아늑하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "It's happy with me, and I with it."
msgstr "나와 있어서 행복하고, 나도 함께 있어서 행복하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "You're not a hellbeast, are you? Nooo. Just misunderstood!"
msgstr "지옥의 짐승이 아닌가? 아니군. 내 오해였군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "It's hungry. Why is it hungry?"
msgstr "배고픈 모양이군. 왜지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "I think it's going to die!"
msgstr "죽을 것 같군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "The lavae's baby tooth."
msgstr "애벌레의 젖니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "It's cold and dry now."
msgstr "이제 차갑고 건조하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Spitfire."
msgstr "불을 뿜는 것이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "A touch hot, but it could cook my food in a pinch."
msgstr "조금 뜨겁지만, 필요하다면 요리하는 데 사용할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "With each day I get a little boulder."
msgstr "날이 지나면서 돌이 자꾸 생기는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Exceptionally mediocre."
msgstr "엄청나게 어중간하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "How pedestrian."
msgstr "대단한 보행자군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "I appreciate the attempt at presentation."
msgstr "플레이팅은 제법 괜찮군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "Disgusting creature!"
msgstr "역겨운 짐승이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "How very folksy."
msgstr "아주 서민적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "Disgusting creature!"
msgstr "역겨운 짐승이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "This fungus survived the downfall."
msgstr "역경에서도 살아남는 균류로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "Who would put this filth in their veins?"
msgstr "이런 오물을 정맥에 주사하는 이도 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "It will run out eventually."
msgstr "언젠가는 꺼지겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Oh good. The island is crawling with vermin."
msgstr "거참 잘됐군. 섬에 이런 미물이 들끓다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "It does the job, I suppose."
msgstr "뭐, 제 기능은 하니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Finally, a mutation that's actually useful."
msgstr "마지막으로, 실용적인 돌연변이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Chaaarge!"
msgstr "충전!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "What's it always chewing on?"
msgstr "대체 뭘 맨날 씹고 있는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "It'd make a nice horn."
msgstr "괜찮은 뿔이 나오겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Energy flows through it."
msgstr "에너지가 흐르고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "A little bit of protection."
msgstr "약간의 보호를 제공하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "A chip off the old block."
msgstr "부전자전이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "I like the noise they make when you burn them."
msgstr "태울 때 나는 소리가 마음에 든다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "It's got a face."
msgstr "얼굴이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Ah. A chance to grow something horrible."
msgstr "아. 끔찍한 것을 재배할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Just days away from dreadful."
msgstr "며칠 있으면 이것도 흉물로 변하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "Ah, I do enjoy the finer things."
msgstr "아, 나에겐 이렇게 고급스러운 것이 어울리지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "Finally, something to suit my refined palate."
msgstr "드디어 내 고급스러운 입맛에 맞는 음식을 먹겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "Well. That was fun while it lasted."
msgstr "뭐, 잠깐 동안이지만 재미있었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a piece of wood. What more is there to say?"
msgstr "나무 조각이군. 뭐, 더 얘기할 것도 없지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "Hmph, they let just anyone be a lord these days."
msgstr "흠, 요즘은 아무나 주인 행세를 하게 두네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7"
msgid "I'd better leave that be."
msgstr "가만히 놔두는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Gold's gold as far as I'm concerned."
msgstr "어쨌든 금이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "Ah. How have you been, Lucy?"
msgstr "아. 잘 지냈니, 루시?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "Where did this appear from?"
msgstr "이게 대체 어디에서 나타난 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Repulsive."
msgstr "역겹다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It looks wonderfully ominous."
msgstr "아주 놀라울 정도로 불길하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "The blasted thing is finally dead."
msgstr "저 망할 것이 드디어 죽었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "Some things can be repaired."
msgstr "세상에는 고칠 수 있는 것도 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "Crystals? How very Bohemian."
msgstr "수정이라고? 아주 보헤미안스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "I don't like the look of this."
msgstr "생긴 게 마음에 안 드는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "I don't think it's from around here."
msgstr "이곳의 토착 식물은 아닌 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "Some aggressive pruning might be in order."
msgstr "공격적으로 가지치기를 좀 해야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "To work, then."
msgstr "그럼 어디 일해볼까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "There's more to be done."
msgstr "할 일이 아직 남았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "I have a feeling this pest won't be dispatched so easily."
msgstr "이 해충이 날 쉬이 내버려둘 것 같지는 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "I told you it was no match for my abilities."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "A vicious plant."
msgstr "사나운 식물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Perhaps I can use this to my advantage."
msgstr "이것을 유리하게 써먹을 수 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "It has an odd, yet strangely mouthwatering aroma."
msgstr "이상한데 묘하게 군침이 도는 향이 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "How maddening."
msgstr "광기가 서려 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "If you're worried about getting stuck inside, don't rummage through my things."
msgstr "안에 갇히기 싫다면 내 물건을 뒤지지 마."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "I've no desire to do battle with that thing."
msgstr "저것이랑 싸울 생각은 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "Ugh, I don't want to touch that."
msgstr "윽, 만지고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "This would be a nice feather in my cap."
msgstr "모자에 달면 아주 멋질 것 같은 깃털이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "Hopefully it catches the wind as well as the eye."
msgstr "바람도 시선도 사로잡았으면 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "Better him than me."
msgstr "나보단 남이 당하는 것이 낫지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "My ears are still ringing."
msgstr "귀가 아직도 울리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "There'll be no more crying out of you."
msgstr "넌 더 이상 비명을 지를 수 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "Oh shut UP, will you?"
msgstr "좀 닥쳐줄래?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Looks like I got the last meep."
msgstr "결국엔 내가 이겼군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "What a disturbing root."
msgstr "참으로 불쾌한 뿌리군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "Silly rabbit."
msgstr "실없는 토끼군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "There's nothing to be gleaned from this."
msgstr "알아낼 수 있는 게 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "It's strong stuff."
msgstr "단단한 것이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "Let me guess, it grows a marble stalk?"
msgstr "대리석 줄기에 열리나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "Stone cold growth."
msgstr "돌처럼 차갑게 자라지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "I've always wondered who built those."
msgstr "누가 이걸 만들었는지 언제나 궁금했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "I've found a shrubbery."
msgstr "관목이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "How whimsical."
msgstr "묘하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "I should ask it questions."
msgstr "질문이라도 해볼까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "It is finished."
msgstr "끝났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It's twisted and prickly, just like me!"
msgstr "나처럼 꼬여 있고 가시가 있군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "That was painful."
msgstr "꽤 아팠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "What a generic little plant."
msgstr "무척이나 평범한 작은 식물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "There it goes."
msgstr "저렇게 가는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "It's no use to anyone now."
msgstr "이제는 그 누구에게도 쓸모없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Tree 0, Maxwell 1."
msgstr "나무 0점, 맥스웰 1점."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A tree with a foul demeanor."
msgstr "품행이 단정치 못한 나무군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES"
msgid "I do love mashed potatoes."
msgstr "나도 매시드 포테이토는 좋아하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT"
msgid "I'd prefer not to put that on my face."
msgstr "그걸 얼굴에 쓰고 싶지는 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT"
msgid "I'd prefer not to put that on my face."
msgstr "그걸 얼굴에 쓰고 싶지는 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT"
msgid "I'd prefer not to put that on my face."
msgstr "그걸 얼굴에 쓰고 싶지는 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT"
msgid "How very dramatic."
msgstr "정말 극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST"
msgid "Every vessel mast have one."
msgstr "모든 배에는 돛대가 하나씩 있어야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM"
msgid "Far more practical than setting a fire on our boat."
msgstr "배에 불을 지르는 것보다 훨씬 실용적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD"
msgid "Far more practical than setting a fire on our boat."
msgstr "배에 불을 지르는 것보다 훨씬 실용적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD"
msgid "How dare you look down on me!"
msgstr "감히 날 내려다 보다니!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM"
msgid "Very prudent."
msgstr "매우 신중하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM"
msgid "Do I look like a shipyard laborer?"
msgstr "내가 조선소 노동자로 보이나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS"
msgid "A warning to any waterfowl that cross us."
msgstr "우리를 거스르는 물새에게 보내는 경고지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM"
msgid "Must I do everything?"
msgstr "전부 내가 해야 하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD"
msgid "Those \"wings\" haven't been clipped from a real Dragonfly. A pity."
msgstr "저 '날개'는 진짜 용파리에서 떼어 낸 게 아니군. 참 아쉬워."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM"
msgid "Do I look like a shipyard laborer?"
msgstr "내가 조선소 노동자로 보이나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL"
msgid "Looking good!"
msgstr "좋아 보여!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD"
msgid "Hey, handsome."
msgstr "안녕, 잘생긴 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT"
msgid "Aw, it remembers me."
msgstr "호오, 날 기억하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK"
msgid "It keeps the master in the chair."
msgstr "주인을 의자에 묶어 두지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH"
msgid "That accursed thing!"
msgstr "저주스러운 것!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE"
msgid "It's less painful than it looks. Barely."
msgstr "보기보단 덜 고통스럽군. 큰 차이는 없지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEAT"
msgid "I'm used to much finer fare."
msgstr "내 입은 고급 요리에 맞춰져 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS"
msgid "My compliments to the chef!"
msgstr "요리사 실력이 정말 좋군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT"
msgid "It's too brittle to hang meat on now."
msgstr "고기를 걸 수 없을 정도로 망가졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE"
msgid "Like the desert."
msgstr "사막처럼 건조하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Like the desert."
msgstr "사막처럼 건조하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING"
msgid "Still moist."
msgstr "아직 습하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Moist and staying that way."
msgstr "계속 습한 상태겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Moist and staying that way."
msgstr "계속 습한 상태겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Still moist."
msgstr "아직 습하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC"
msgid "It can dry meats so they'll last longer."
msgstr "더 오래 먹을 수 있도록 고기를 건조할 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT"
msgid "It's too brittle to hang meat on now."
msgstr "고기를 걸 수 없을 정도로 망가졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE"
msgid "Does she even have teeth?"
msgstr "이가 있긴 한가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Like the desert."
msgstr "사막처럼 건조하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING"
msgid "Still moist."
msgstr "아직 습하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN"
msgid "Moist and staying that way."
msgstr "계속 습한 상태겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Moist and staying that way."
msgstr "계속 습한 상태겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Still moist."
msgstr "아직 습하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps if she were fed, she'd be less ill-tempered."
msgstr "배가 차면 덜 괴팍해질지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD"
msgid "This seems suspect."
msgstr "수상쩍은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED"
msgid "My teeth are getting too old for this."
msgstr "이걸 먹기에는 내 치아가 너무 약해진 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE"
msgid "I'd have to be foolish or desperate to use that."
msgstr "어리석거나 절박한 사람이나 쓸 물건이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM"
msgid "They were already here when I arrived."
msgstr "내가 여기에 왔을 때 그들이 이미 여기에 있었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT"
msgid "Does it look I have the bulbous head of a merm?"
msgstr "내 머리가 어인처럼 둥글납작해 보이나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT"
msgid "Does it look I have the bulbous head of a merm?"
msgstr "내 머리가 어인처럼 둥글납작해 보이나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD"
msgid "I'd best try to stay on their good side."
msgstr "계속 잘 보이려고 노력해야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR"
msgid "They managed to get even uglier."
msgstr "거기서 더 못생겨지다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW"
msgid "Quite the improvement."
msgstr "이제 좀 보기 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
msgid "This seems rather... fishy."
msgstr "상당히... 비린내 나는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Roasted merm head. Delicious."
msgstr "구운 어인 머리. 맛있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "The eyes follow you around."
msgstr "눈이 자꾸 따라온다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, it burns just as well as the pigs' version."
msgstr "돼지의 집처럼 잘 타는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "They copied the pigs, but they're even less intelligent."
msgstr "돼지를 따라 했지만 지능이 더 낮군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "It's been burned to the ground."
msgstr "완전히 타 버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "It's slightly less offensive to my eyes than the others."
msgstr "다른 것보다는 약간 덜 거슬리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "A crown can be a heavy burden..."
msgstr "왕관은 무거운 짐이기도 하지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Someone finally took care of that hideous throw rug."
msgstr "누군가 드디어 저 흉한 담요 양탄자를 처리했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Not especially impressive for a \"throne\"."
msgstr "\"옥좌\"치고는 별로 인상적이지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "Such a waste of time and energy."
msgstr "시간 낭비, 힘 낭비군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "What is that little creature up to?"
msgstr "저 작은 녀석이 뭘 하려는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "A kingdom without a king."
msgstr "왕 없는 왕국이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "They're flying the royal banner."
msgstr "왕실 깃발을 휘날리고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "Apparently, I'm not invited. Oh how shall I ever go on."
msgstr "나는 초대받지 못한 것 같군. 이렇게 안타까울 데가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "Apparently, I'm not invited. Oh how shall I ever go on."
msgstr "나는 초대받지 못한 것 같군. 이렇게 안타까울 데가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "They managed to get even uglier."
msgstr "거기서 더 못생겨지다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "Kings are easily made around here."
msgstr "왕이 되기 참 쉬운 곳이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW"
msgid "Quite the improvement."
msgstr "이제 좀 보기 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "Why specialize when you can be mediocre at everything, hm?"
msgstr "모든 일을 적당히 잘할 수 있는데, 왜 전문성을 기르겠나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "I'm certain there's nothing inside I'd want."
msgstr "저 안에 내가 탐낼 만한 건 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "I'm certain there's nothing inside I'd want."
msgstr "저 안에 내가 탐낼 만한 건 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "Why specialize when you can be mediocre at everything, hm?"
msgstr "모든 일을 적당히 잘할 수 있는데, 왜 전문성을 기르겠나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Someone sensibly bottled up their feelings and tossed them out to sea."
msgstr "누가 현명하게 병에 감정을 억눌러 바다로 던졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "It's empty inside."
msgstr "안이 비었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "The show's over."
msgstr "쇼는 끝났어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmph. I suppose some people are impressed by shows of brute strength."
msgstr "흠. 어떤 사람들은 완력으로 하는 쇼에 감동하나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "Nauseating. It must still contain some evil energy."
msgstr "역겨워. 아직 어떤 사악한 에너지가 들어 있는 게 틀림없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "Eventually the firefly will starve."
msgstr "결국에는 반딧불이도 굶어 죽겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "It's oddly beautiful."
msgstr "묘하게 아름답군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "This pathetic device... gets the job done."
msgstr "참으로 보잘것 없는 장치지만... 작동은 하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "For those with a flare for the dramatic."
msgstr "극적인 장치를 좋아하는 이들이 쓸 만한 물건이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "It was drawn in a steady hand."
msgstr "필체가 꽤 시원시원하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
msgid "There's nothing on it, currently."
msgstr "지금은 아무것도 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM"
msgid "A sign is useless if it has nothing to mark."
msgstr "표시할 게 없는 표지판은 쓸모가 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR"
msgid "My my, the fuel has changed you."
msgstr "이럴 수가. 연료 덕분에 많이 변했구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST"
msgid "It's almost like he's still alive."
msgstr "마치 살아있는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN"
msgid "A regrettable end, my old friend."
msgstr "안타까운 종말이군, 옛 친구여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND"
msgid "I'll take that as a \"yes\"."
msgstr "\"예\"라고 받아들이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD"
msgid "End of the line."
msgstr "여기가 끝이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND"
msgid "Are you picking up what I'm putting down? Do you dig it?"
msgstr "너는 내가 놓는 것을 집는가? 이해하지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT"
msgid "Indecent."
msgstr "망측해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL"
msgid "Do I even want anything I find in there, knowing it spent time in a rodent's nostrils?"
msgstr "설치류의 콧구멍에서 시간을 보냈다는 사실을 알면서도 그곳에서 발견한 건 뭐라도 원하는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT"
msgid "No wonder they can dig for hours."
msgstr "덕분에 몇 시간 동안이나 계속 팔 수 있는 거로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL"
msgid "Burrow deep, I'm coming for you."
msgstr "계속 깊게 파고 들어가보렴. 내가 잡으러 간다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY"
msgid "I don't have time for you!"
msgstr "널 상대할 시간은 없어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL"
msgid "What a disgusting home."
msgstr "끔찍히 더러운 집이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT"
msgid "They've been smoked out."
msgstr "원숭이들이 싹 다 사라졌어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "This place is infested with those monkey miscreants."
msgstr "이곳은 저 못된 원숭이들이 들끓는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL"
msgid "Something is wrong with it."
msgstr "뭔가 이상한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Someone has been meddling."
msgstr "누군가 손을 댔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR"
msgid "How quaint."
msgstr "참으로 구식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN"
msgid "Hmph. I'd hardly call that a throne."
msgstr "흠. 왕좌라고 부르기도 민망한걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "I don't trust it."
msgstr "안 믿어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT"
msgid "I'm sure it's full of fleas."
msgstr "벼룩으로 가득하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT"
msgid "Ugh, it makes me look like a common deckhand."
msgstr "윽. 이걸 쓰니 하찮은 뱃놈 같아 보이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA"
msgid "It would be unwise to ingest this."
msgstr "섭취하는 것은 좋지 않지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT"
msgid "How revolting."
msgstr "무척 혐오스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "My teeth are getting too old for this."
msgstr "이걸 먹기에는 내 치아가 너무 약해진 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE"
msgid "It's less than appetizing."
msgstr "식욕을 전혀 돋우지 않는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN"
msgid "Ruins of an ancient relic."
msgstr "고대 유물의 폐허군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "I had thought these all destroyed eons ago."
msgstr "이런 건 수십 억 년 전에 다 파괴된 줄 알았는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF"
msgid "The staff is powered by the \"moon's\" energy."
msgstr "\"달\"의 에너지로 힘을 쓰는 지팡이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED"
msgid "Something magic-y needs to happen, I think."
msgstr "뭔가 마법스러운 일이 일어나야 할 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF"
msgid "Waste of a good staff."
msgstr "좋은 지팡이를 낭비했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "How wretchedly graceful."
msgstr "우아하다 못해 끔찍하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "You can't escape my villainous grasp!"
msgstr "내 사악한 손아귀를 벗어날 순 없지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with these?"
msgstr "이걸로 뭘 할 수 있다는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING"
msgid "It's a small moon tree."
msgstr "작은 달 나무로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE"
msgid "The cave provides sanctuary from the \"moon's\" prying eyes."
msgstr "감시하는 \"달\"의 눈길을 피할 수 있는 동굴이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC"
msgid "The gem conjures water springs in conjunction with the \"moon's\" cycles."
msgstr "\"달\"의 주기에 따라 물을 만들어내는 보석이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED"
msgid "I can feel its eye upon me... watching..."
msgstr "나를 바라보는 시선이 느껴져... 지켜보고 있다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL"
msgid "The \"moon\" is full in the sky."
msgstr "\"달\"이 하늘을 가득 채우는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW"
msgid "The... \"moon\"... has retreated for now."
msgstr "\"달\"이... 지금은 후퇴했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE"
msgid "The \"moon\" is on the wane."
msgstr "\"달\"이 이지러지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX"
msgid "The \"moon\" is waxing."
msgstr "\"달\"이 차고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS"
msgid "But does it look as sharp as me?"
msgstr "나만큼 날카로워 보이나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE"
msgid "Go on. Axe me what the moon's made of."
msgstr "자, 달이 무엇으로 만들어졌는지 확인해 볼까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED"
msgid "Nearly as sharp as I am, but with a garish glow."
msgstr "나 만큼이나 날카롭지만 현란하게 빛나는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK"
msgid "\"Moon\" detritus."
msgstr "\"달\" 폐기물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "I suppose life finds a way."
msgstr "생명은 끈질긴 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER"
msgid "This will make a decent magical vessel."
msgstr "적당한 마법 용기가 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL"
msgid "They always need an offering."
msgstr "언제나 제물이 필요하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET"
msgid "\"Moon\" rock."
msgstr "\"달\" 돌이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED"
msgid "Oooh, some new knowledge."
msgstr "아, 새로운 지식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES"
msgid "This might be bad."
msgstr "불길한 예감이 드는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN"
msgid "I'd rather not peek inside."
msgstr "안을 엿보진 않는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's been turned to glass."
msgstr "유리로 변했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED"
msgid "Hm. This may be useful."
msgstr "흠. 유용할 지도 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "There are hardly enough inventors brave enough to harness the power of potatoes."
msgstr "감자의 힘을 이용할 만큼 용감한 발명가는 거의 없었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK"
msgid "They give off a rather unsettling sensation."
msgstr "다소 불안한 느낌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC"
msgid "What is he meddling with?"
msgstr "뭘 간섭하고 있는 거야?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM"
msgid "There's power trapped inside."
msgstr "그 안에 갇힌 힘이 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Yes. I desire the knowledge of the moon."
msgstr "그래. 달의 지식을 알고 싶어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP"
msgid "There is powerful energy pouring out of it."
msgstr "강력한 힘이 쏟아져 나오고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL"
msgid "Why do I get the sense... ah, I'm sure it's nothing."
msgstr "왜 이해가 ... 아, 아무것도 아닐 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC"
msgid "It is not yet time?"
msgstr "아직 때가 안 됐나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN"
msgid "This powerful energy... I've seen it before."
msgstr "이런 강력한 힘... 전에도 본 적이 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS"
msgid "This is not its desired destination."
msgstr "여기가 원하는 목적지는 아니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON"
msgid "I know where you need to be."
msgstr "네가 있어야 할 곳을 알고 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL"
msgid "Let me know your wishes, and I will oblige."
msgstr "소원을 말하면 원하는 대로 해 주겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK"
msgid "Events have been set into motion..."
msgstr "이벤트가 진행되고 있어..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS"
msgid "The thing inside wants out."
msgstr "안에 있는 게 나오고 싶어 하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL"
msgid "The thing inside wants out."
msgstr "안에 있는 게 나오고 싶어 하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "The thing inside wants out."
msgstr "안에 있는 게 나오고 싶어 하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED"
msgid "Where shall I take you?"
msgstr "어디로 데려갈까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD"
msgid "I'll take you to the others."
msgstr "널 다른 것들에게 데려가야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP"
msgid "Strange, my eyelids are getting heavy just looking at it."
msgstr "이상하게 보기만 해도 눈꺼풀이 무거워지네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Odd, but not unpleasant."
msgstr "이상하지만 불쾌하지는 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1"
msgid "I don't see why I must be the one to do all the work."
msgstr "왜 내가 일을 다 해야 하는지 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2"
msgid "How odd to be the one laboring on a machine for an unknown purpose..."
msgstr "목적도 없이 기계에서 일하는 사람이라니, 얼마나 이상한지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC"
msgid "That old fool..."
msgstr "그 늙은 바보..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's not shadow magic."
msgstr "그림자 마법이 아니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT"
msgid "I've more important things to deal with than holes in the ground."
msgstr "땅에 있는 구멍을 신경 쓸 만큼 한가하진 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED"
msgid "It's almost genius in its simplicity... but it does smell."
msgstr "간단한 것은 인정하지만... 냄새는 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning."
msgstr "불에 타고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "A burnt tree stump."
msgstr "불에 탄 나무 그루터기군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Someone's chopped it down already."
msgstr "이미 누가 베었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a moon tree."
msgstr "달 나무로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM"
msgid "It came from that odd tree."
msgstr "저 이상한 나무에서 나왔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSE"
msgid "It's definitely from the North, whatever that is."
msgstr "뭔진 몰라도 북부에서 온 것만은 확실하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG"
msgid "Ride the lightning, you big egg."
msgstr "번개를 타고 달려라, 큰 알아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND"
msgid "Filthy."
msgstr "불결하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA"
msgid "I've never had it before."
msgstr "한 번도 먹어 본 적 없는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC"
msgid "Bloody bloodsucking bloodsuckers."
msgstr "못된 흡혈 벌레."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD"
msgid "I got him."
msgstr "잡았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB"
msgid "What sort of fiend would come up with this?"
msgstr "이건 대체 어떤 악마가 생각해 낸 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER"
msgid "Nasty stuff."
msgstr "징그럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE"
msgid "Let's test it on one of those merms, shall we?"
msgstr "어인한테 시험해 볼까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK"
msgid "Do I have to touch it? What if I just stand near it?"
msgstr "꼭 만져야 하는 건가? 그냥 근처에 서 있으면 안 되나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK"
msgid "A bloody sack. With blood in it."
msgstr "피 주머니군. 피가 들었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING"
msgid "That's a fluffy... thing."
msgstr "복슬복슬한... 무언가이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG"
msgid "That one's already been done in."
msgstr "그것은 이미 파헤쳤지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "What lies beneath?"
msgstr "저 아래에 뭐가 있을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK"
msgid "It brings a small respite from this wretched cold."
msgstr "끔찍한 추위가 잠시나마 가시는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL"
msgid "Always did have a flair for the dramatic..."
msgstr "나는 언제나 극적인 것을 좋아했지..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK"
msgid "A bit ominous looking."
msgstr "조금 불길해 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE"
msgid "The duality of mine."
msgstr "나의 이중성 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME"
msgid "I don't trust anyone who walks so jauntily."
msgstr "그렇게 씩씩하게 걷다니, 안 믿어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB"
msgid "It's gonna blow!"
msgstr "터지겠군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT"
msgid "It possesses a spritely magic."
msgstr "요정 마법이 들어있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT"
msgid "Singing it released the toxic cloud!"
msgstr "노래를 부르자 독구름이 퍼져 나오는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't like how much magic is collecting in that."
msgstr "그 안에 마법이 축적되는 것이 마음에 들지 않는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "Only ash and ruin remain here."
msgstr "여긴 이제 재와 폐허만이 남았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "Smells... \"piney\"."
msgstr "\"소나무\" 냄새가 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS"
msgid "The mushrooms have really taken to the log."
msgstr "버섯이 통나무에서 잘 자라는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN"
msgid "Rotten, all the way through. I relate."
msgstr "안이 완전히 썩었군. 내 처지 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED"
msgid "Nothing grows in these frigid wastes."
msgstr "이렇게 언 땅에서는 아무것도 자라지 못하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME"
msgid "They seem to be doing well."
msgstr "잘 자라고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED"
msgid "It's so full it's almost obscene."
msgstr "너무 가득해서 거의 외설적일 정도야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT"
msgid "C'est la vie."
msgstr "인생이 원래 그렇지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "I suppose we're decorating with fungus now."
msgstr "이제 곰팡이로 장식하는 건가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "A rather pale light."
msgstr "창백한 빛이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT"
msgid "Who ordered the mushroom flambe?"
msgstr "누가 버섯 플람베를 주문했지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF"
msgid "I'm partial to the lavender shade, myself."
msgstr "난 라벤더 등이 더 마음에 들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON"
msgid "A light to repel the encroaching shadow."
msgstr "다가오는 그림자를 쫓아버리는 빛."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Exceptionally disgusting."
msgstr "매우 역겹군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM"
msgid "I hope I'm not standing next to it when it goes off."
msgstr "터질 때 근처에 있으면 안 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Where's Waldo?"
msgstr "월리를 찾아라?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON"
msgid "How garish."
msgstr "정말 현란하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Exceptionally disgusting."
msgstr "매우 역겹군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM"
msgid "Oh fine, do what you like."
msgstr "알았다, 마음대로 해라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh, it smells bad."
msgstr "윽, 냄새가 나쁘군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Exceptionally disgusting."
msgstr "매우 역겹군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM"
msgid "It's spawning."
msgstr "포자가 퍼지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It smells of rot and failure."
msgstr "부패와 실패의 냄새가 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED"
msgid "Exceptionally disgusting."
msgstr "매우 역겹군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC"
msgid "Could it get any less appealing?"
msgstr "여기서 더 흉측스러워질 수가 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER"
msgid "It's even more brutish than before."
msgstr "예전보다도 난폭해졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS"
msgid "That creature has seen better days."
msgstr "그 생명체가 옛날에는 잘 살았지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD"
msgid "That is probably for the best."
msgstr "차라리 잘 된 걸지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC"
msgid "If anything ever looked evil, it's that."
msgstr "딱 봐도 사악함을 형상화한 모습이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING"
msgid "I don't desire to rouse it."
msgstr "깨우고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG"
msgid "I don't care for the new look."
msgstr "새로운 모습이 마음에 안 드는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "걸맞은 최후로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "What an atrocious beast."
msgstr "정말 끔찍한 짐승이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "May you never wake."
msgstr "절대 일어나지 않기를."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER"
msgid "How sickeningly endearing."
msgstr "정말 넌더리나게 사랑스럽구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER"
msgid "How sickeningly endearing."
msgstr "정말 넌더리나게 사랑스럽구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER"
msgid "I'm not eating that."
msgstr "안 먹어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON"
msgid "I'm not eating that."
msgstr "안 먹어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER"
msgid "How sickeningly endearing."
msgstr "정말 넌더리나게 사랑스럽구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR"
msgid "I'm not eating that."
msgstr "안 먹어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER"
msgid "I'm not eating that."
msgstr "안 먹어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Florals. How saccharine."
msgstr "꽃무늬네. 달디 달다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT"
msgid "I can't remember the last time I slept well."
msgstr "마지막으로 푹 잔 게 언제인지 기억도 안 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "It burns with a beautiful glow."
msgstr "아름다운 빛을 내며 타는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "Ahhh. Refreshing."
msgstr "아. 시원하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH"
msgid "Charlie... what are you planning?"
msgstr "찰리... 어쩌려는 거니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "The overuse of fuel was their downfall."
msgstr "연료를 과도하게 사용한 것이 실패의 원인이었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE"
msgid "I'm going to have dreams about this pie nightmare."
msgstr "악몽에 나올 것 같은 파이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "The heart of the city is still."
msgstr "도시의 심장이 멈추었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "It calms once more."
msgstr "다시 진정하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "The pulse has no influence here."
msgstr "박동이 여기에서는 영향이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "The pulse is holding steady."
msgstr "박동이 안정적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "The pulse is waning."
msgstr "박동이 약해지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "It beats once again."
msgstr "또 박동하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "The pulse is quickening."
msgstr "박동이 빨라지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr "좋은 아침."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Snicker-snack!"
msgstr "쓱싹!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "One third of the way there..."
msgstr "삼 분의 일은 되었군..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "A large growth of nitre."
msgstr "초석이 대량 형성됐군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I suppose the Ancients were farmers once, before they turned to the fuel."
msgstr "고대인들은 한때 농부였을 거야, 연료로 변해버리기 전에는 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR"
msgid "I have no desire to toil like a common sailor."
msgstr "천한 선원처럼 고생하고 싶진 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD"
msgid "Hmph. I've never been one for manual lab-oar."
msgstr "흠. 직접 노를 저어 본 적은 없는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY"
msgid "Careful where you're paddling, pal."
msgstr "그 노를 함부로 휘두르지 마, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's not in season."
msgstr "지금은 시기가 아니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC"
msgid "Didn't think I'd ever come back here."
msgstr "내가 여기에 다시 올 것이라고는 생각하지 않았지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
msgid "Disappointing."
msgstr "실망스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
msgid "How quaint."
msgstr "참으로 구식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
msgid "I used to see quill floats like this back in England."
msgstr "영국에서 이렇게 깃털이 떠다니는 모습을 보곤 했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW"
msgid "I used to see quill floats like this back in England."
msgstr "영국에서 이렇게 깃털이 떠다니는 모습을 보곤 했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE"
msgid "A bit of extra flair goes a long way."
msgstr "성능을 약간만 개선해도 더 멀리 날아가지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS"
msgid "A bit of extra flair goes a long way."
msgstr "성능을 약간만 개선해도 더 멀리 날아가지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE"
msgid "It seems to be missing something."
msgstr "뭔가 빠진 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL"
msgid "It's made of tougher stuff."
msgstr "튼튼한 것으로 만들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
msgid "I used to see quill floats like this back in England."
msgstr "영국에서 이렇게 깃털이 떠다니는 모습을 보곤 했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "I used to see quill floats like this back in England."
msgstr "영국에서 이렇게 깃털이 떠다니는 모습을 보곤 했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY"
msgid "I think Higgsbury already got too close to one of these."
msgstr "힉스버리가 이런 물건을 너무 가까이해서 그 꼴이 된 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY"
msgid "I'm reluctant to see what manner of fish would bite THAT."
msgstr "대체 어떤 물고기가 저런 것을 물지 확인하기 꺼려지는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN"
msgid "Go fishing in the rain? And ruin my last good suit?"
msgstr "빗속 낚시? 마지막으로 남은 좋은 옷을 버리라고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW"
msgid "Why would anyone want to fish while it's snowing?"
msgstr "눈이 오는 데 낚시하고 싶어 하는 사람도 있나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED"
msgid "At least I don't have to use worms."
msgstr "적어도 지렁이를 쓸 필요는 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD"
msgid "A more in-depth approach to fishing."
msgstr "좀 더 심도 있게 낚시할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1"
msgid "It looks positively revolting."
msgstr "혐오스럽기 그지없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2"
msgid "It has a rather unsettling stare."
msgstr "어쩐지 불안해지는 눈빛이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3"
msgid "I'd best take care to avoid those spines."
msgstr "가시에 찔리지 않게 조심해야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4"
msgid "I'm not sure it was worth the effort."
msgstr "애쓴 보람이 있는지 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5"
msgid "What an odd creature."
msgstr "정말 이상한 물고기군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6"
msgid "Don't be koi with me."
msgstr "잉어 정도면 훌륭하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7"
msgid "Don't be koi with me."
msgstr "잉어 정도면 훌륭하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8"
msgid "Stay frosty, pal."
msgstr "계속 차갑게 있으라고, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9"
msgid "It seems we share an appreciation for figs."
msgstr "무화과에 감사하는 건 똑같은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1"
msgid "This was barely worth my time."
msgstr "들인 시간이 아깝군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2"
msgid "Hardly bigger than a minnow."
msgstr "크기가 피라미와 거의 비슷하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3"
msgid "I was hoping for something bigger."
msgstr "좀 더 큰 걸 기대했는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4"
msgid "Just a cold fish."
msgstr "그냥 차가운 물고기군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5"
msgid "Its smell oddly reminds me of the theater house..."
msgstr "묘하게 영화관에서 날 법한 냄새가 나는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6"
msgid "What an ugly thing."
msgstr "정말 못생기기도 했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7"
msgid "It seems more plant than fish."
msgstr "물고기보단 식물에 더 가까워 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8"
msgid "The sunfish! It burns!"
msgstr "해복치다! 뜨겁잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9"
msgid "How vulgar."
msgstr "정말 천박하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE"
msgid "An aquatic tree, what next?"
msgstr "물에서 사는 나무다, 다음은 뭐지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT"
msgid "I have no interest in lugging that thing around. Back in the drink you go."
msgstr "저걸 나르는 데는 관심이 없어. 네가 있어야 할 곳으로 가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "It could use a good pruning."
msgstr "가지치기를 잘 해줘야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE"
msgid "It's just hanging around."
msgstr "그냥 어슬렁거리네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON"
msgid "It looks like someone's already made themselves comfortable here."
msgstr "누군가 이미 여기에서 편안하게 지내고 있는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT"
msgid "Not quite so comfortable anymore."
msgstr "더는 그다지 편안하지 않네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL"
msgid "Is it safe? We should send Wilson in first."
msgstr "안전한가? 윌슨부터 들여보내야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT"
msgid "That went surprisingly well."
msgstr "놀라울 정도로 성공적이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "뭐, 예상한 일이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED"
msgid "It will do for now."
msgstr "일단 이 정도면 됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "Some fresh seafood would be a welcome sight."
msgstr "신선한 해산물을 먹을 수 있으면 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED"
msgid "The trap is set."
msgstr "함정을 설치했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT"
msgid "Another irksome chore, left to me."
msgstr "이 몸이 또 하찮은 잡일이나 해야 하다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC"
msgid "The fishheads are out of salad."
msgstr "그 생선 녀석들에게 샐러드가 부족하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "Satisfied?"
msgstr "만족했나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP"
msgid "Not enough? Where does it end?"
msgstr "부족하다고? 대체 언제까지 해야 하는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC"
msgid "The fishheads are out of salad."
msgstr "그 생선 녀석들에게 샐러드가 부족하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP"
msgid "Satisfied?"
msgstr "만족했나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP"
msgid "Not enough? Where does it end?"
msgstr "부족하다고? 대체 언제까지 해야 하는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND"
msgid "It has a good beat, and you can dance to it."
msgstr "비트가 멋져서 거기에 맞춰서 춤도 출 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION"
msgid "It's a pungent onion."
msgstr "코를 톡 쏘는 양파군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Take that, onion."
msgstr "죽어라, 양파."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED"
msgid "An unnecessarily large onion."
msgstr "불필요하게 커다란 양파다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "A sizable magic gem."
msgstr "커다란 마법 보석이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "The charge has made it incredibly powerful."
msgstr "충전되어서 굉장히 강해졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "Simple magic is often the best."
msgstr "간단한 마법이 가장 효과적일 때가 많지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "This will be quite powerful with some fuel."
msgstr "연료와 사용하면 꽤 강력하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "I have a feeling of being watched, even from a considerable distance away."
msgstr "아주 멀리서 감시당하는 느낌이 종종 든다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "It's a focusing tool."
msgstr "초점이 되어주는 도구군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "Keep a distance, you crooked creature!"
msgstr "가까이 오지 마라, 이 못된 생물아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nothing. Am I supposed to be sad for the smelly brigand?"
msgstr "아무것도 없군. 그 냄새 나는 도둑을 불쌍히 여겨야 하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "Oh, goody."
msgstr "아, 전리품이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "I loathe swimming."
msgstr "난 수영이 싫어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "I'm beginning to forget what real palm trees looked like."
msgstr "이젠 진짜 야자수가 어떻게 생겼는지 가물가물해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "A runt of a tree."
msgstr "왜소한 나무군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "It fell from the tree. Perhaps I'll make use of it."
msgstr "나무에서 떨어졌어. 쓸모있을지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "One day it might grow into something useful."
msgstr "언젠가 쓸모있는 걸로 자라날지도 모르겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "It's a trap."
msgstr "함정이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Fruitcake's more agreeable cousin."
msgstr "과일 케이크와 비슷한데 더 먹을 만하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "I'm going to sing a song of madness."
msgstr "광기의 노래를 불러야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "A blank canvas."
msgstr "빈 캔버스군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "It has a certain elegance to it."
msgstr "우아한 느낌이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "I should like to avoid a pinch from that, I think."
msgstr "꼬집히고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Nice tux."
msgstr "멋진 턱시도군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Looks like the spicy kind."
msgstr "매운 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "Pops right into my mouth!"
msgstr "한입에 쏙 들어가는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "Slightly more exciting than the usual vegetable."
msgstr "원래 상태보다는 조금 더 흥미롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It looks horribly spicy."
msgstr "아주 매워 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "It is addicted to fermented berries."
msgstr "발효한 베리에 중독되었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "Now I'll have no problem keeping my cool."
msgstr "이제 시원하게 지낼 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It's no use to anyone now."
msgstr "이제는 그 누구에게도 쓸모없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Something else seems to be required."
msgstr "다른 무언가가 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "It seems my fortune's changing."
msgstr "내 운이 변하는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "They look superb."
msgstr "정말 맛있어 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "I've a habit of destroying beautiful things, don't I?"
msgstr "아름다운 것을 파괴하는 것이 나의 버릇이지 않은가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "It's dripping with nightmare essence."
msgstr "악몽의 정수가 뚝뚝 떨어지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "I think it looks much better this way."
msgstr "이쪽이 더 나아 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "I need to put on gloves for this."
msgstr "이걸 다루려면 장갑을 껴야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "That accursed thing!"
msgstr "저주스러운 것!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "Everybody loves a little mining."
msgstr "누구나 광물 캐는 것을 좋아하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "It works surprisingly well."
msgstr "의외로 잘 작동하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "I suppose I can't be picky."
msgstr "까다롭게 굴면 안 되겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "He's a slippery fellow."
msgstr "능구렁이 같은 놈이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "A fiery one."
msgstr "불 같은 놈이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Filthy."
msgstr "불결하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Rotten to the core."
msgstr "뼛속까지 썩었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "He's a slippery fellow."
msgstr "능구렁이 같은 놈이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "A fiery one."
msgstr "불 같은 놈이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Filthy."
msgstr "불결하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Rotten to the core."
msgstr "뼛속까지 썩었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "Blech. Disgusting brute."
msgstr "우웩. 역겨운 짐승이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "Oh, that's just demeaning."
msgstr "흠, 품위를 떨어뜨리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Pig roast!"
msgstr "돼지 구이!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "Er... charming."
msgstr "어... 매력적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Let's see you hide in there now."
msgstr "이제 이 안에 숨어 보시지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "I'd go inside too, if I was him."
msgstr "나였더라도 안에 들어갔을 테지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is not a sound structure."
msgstr "안전한 구조가 아니지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "I'll huff and I'll puff!"
msgstr "이제 숨을 크게 들이쉬고 내쉬어야지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "That's a man with his priorities in order!"
msgstr "뭐가 중요한지 잘 아는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "I dub thee, \"Bacon\"."
msgstr "그대의 이름은 베이컨으로 정했노라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "He's simple, but he's mine."
msgstr "단순하지만 내 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "What a slobbering fool."
msgstr "침 흘리는 바보군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "They're starting to organize."
msgstr "조직적으로 되고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "That one's gone feral."
msgstr "저것은 야성에 잠식당했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Not useful like this."
msgstr "이래서는 쓸모없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "It needs some kind of meat."
msgstr "뭔가 고기가 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "How quaint."
msgstr "참으로 구식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "It was him or me."
msgstr "살기 위해선 어쩔 수 없었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "That's just nasty."
msgstr "끔찍하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "Great. Now they have fire."
msgstr "이런. 이제 녀석들도 불을 가지게 됐군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "Perfect. I'll try not to spend it all in one place."
msgstr "완벽하군. 한군데에서 다 쓰지는 말아야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "Those pigs are getting more and more clever."
msgstr "점점 갈수록 돼지들이 더 똑똑해지고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "A more outdoorsy type might be able to make something of this."
msgstr "야외 활동을 즐기는 사람이라면 이걸로 뭔가를 할 수 있겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "Huh, it seems to belong in the ground."
msgstr "흠, 땅에 속하는 물건인 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "That's not exactly a welcome sight."
msgstr "불길한 광경이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "Hooray."
msgstr "만세."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "The tool of choice for perfectionists."
msgstr "완벽주의자들이 선호하는 도구로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "A feeble attempt to trick the weak minded."
msgstr "미약한 정신을 속이기 위한 얕은 속임수지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "The heat has made this a suitable meal."
msgstr "가열하니까 제법 괜찮은 식사가 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "I'm really supposed to put that contraption on my head?"
msgstr "정말 내 머리에 그 장치를 넣어야 해?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "That is a generic plant."
msgstr "평범한 식물이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "It's growing."
msgstr "자라고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "It's ready."
msgstr "준비되었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It wasn't hardy enough for the heat."
msgstr "더위를 견딜 정도로 튼튼하지는 않았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "I think she's enjoying this a bit too much."
msgstr "그녀가 너무 즐기는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "It's a unique take, I'll admit."
msgstr "참신하다는 건 인정해야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s seems untrustworthy..."
msgstr "%s은(는) 신뢰할 수 없을 것 같다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s has been lighting fires."
msgstr "%s이(가) 곳곳에 불을 붙이고 있었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s."
msgstr "안녕, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST"
msgid "%s needs heart-shaped assistance."
msgstr "%s에게 심장의 도움이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderous fiend! I'll stop at nothing!"
msgstr "살인마! 무슨 일이 있어도 처단해 주마!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s tethers lost spirits to this world."
msgstr "%s이(가) 길 잃은 혼령을 이 세계에 잡아두는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC"
msgid "You've changed."
msgstr "변했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME"
msgid "Jack? Wait, no."
msgstr "잭? 잠깐, 아니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD"
msgid "It is none other than the four of clubs!"
msgstr "다름 아닌 클로버 4군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER"
msgid "Little hand tools, how quaint."
msgstr "작은 수공구, 정말 기이하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful, madam. I know where this trail ultimately leads."
msgstr "조심해, 마담. 난 이 길이 결국 어디로 이어지는 지 알고 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "It looks like she'll have to wait, for once."
msgstr "일단은 기다려야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS"
msgid "She doesn't understand the full extent of the power she's toying with."
msgstr "자신이 가지고 노는 힘이 어느 범위까지인지 이해하지 못하는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful, madam. I know where this trail ultimately leads."
msgstr "조심해, 마담. 난 이 길이 결국 어디로 이어지는 지 알고 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING"
msgid "It looks like she'll have to wait, for once."
msgstr "일단은 기다려야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD"
msgid "At least it doesn't smell, like some other modes of transportation."
msgstr "적어도 다른 탈 것처럼 냄새가 나지는 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC"
msgid "At least it doesn't smell, like some other modes of transportation."
msgstr "적어도 다른 탈 것처럼 냄새가 나지는 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT"
msgid "Hmph. I think she puts it up there on purpose."
msgstr "흠, 일부러 거기다 올려 놓은 것 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful, madam. I know where this trail ultimately leads."
msgstr "조심해, 마담. 난 이 길이 결국 어디로 이어지는 지 알고 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING"
msgid "It looks like she'll have to wait, for once."
msgstr "일단은 기다려야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful, madam. I know where this trail ultimately leads."
msgstr "조심해, 마담. 난 이 길이 결국 어디로 이어지는 지 알고 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING"
msgid "It looks like she'll have to wait, for once."
msgstr "일단은 기다려야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC"
msgid "Careful, madam. I know where this trail ultimately leads."
msgstr "조심해, 마담. 난 이 길이 결국 어디로 이어지는 지 알고 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING"
msgid "It looks like she'll have to wait, for once."
msgstr "일단은 기다려야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC"
msgid "That... looks like it would hurt."
msgstr "그건... 아플 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "I keep it next to my pocket watch and my pocket comb."
msgstr "회중시계랑 휴대용 빗과 함께 가지고 다니지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "How quaint."
msgstr "참으로 구식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS"
msgid "There will be no perching on my shoulder. Got that, pal?"
msgstr "내 어깨에는 절대 못 앉아. 알겠지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT"
msgid "A bit theatrical, isn't it?"
msgstr "너무 연극 소품 같지 않나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Usually I'd get someone to seed this for me."
msgstr "평소라면 다른 사람에게 씨를 빼라고 할 테지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "A little more refined, at least."
msgstr "조금은 구색을 갖추게 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'd imagine it would take quite a while to eat."
msgstr "먹는데 시간이 꽤 걸릴 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Such labor is beneath me."
msgstr "나에게는 천한 노동이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "I can see my face reflected off the top."
msgstr "표면에 반사된 내 얼굴을 볼 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "It slithers all the way down."
msgstr "끝까지 미끈거리지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Fresh from the murky depths."
msgstr "어두운 심해에서 갓 나왔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "It's some algae."
msgstr "평범한 녹조류다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "It's the way of all mortal life."
msgstr "모든 유한한 생명체가 배설하는 것이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "Does it have to make such a horrible racket?"
msgstr "꼭 저렇게 끔찍한 소음을 내야 하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "I must exercise patience..."
msgstr "인내심을 키워야겠군..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "It will be finished shortly."
msgstr "곧 끝나겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Let's hope something palatable has come of it."
msgstr "맛있는 게 완성됐길 바라자고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "Dismally devoid of foodstuffs."
msgstr "우울할 정도로 음식이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "An instrument of the dark culinary arts."
msgstr "어둠의 요리 마법을 수행하는 도구군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
msgid "Fire on demand? I may have underestimated the young tree trooper."
msgstr "원할 때 불을 피울 수 있다고? 어린 스카우트를 과소평가했나 보군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Finally something with some taste."
msgstr "드디어 맛있는 것을 맛보겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah. The daily grind."
msgstr "아. 열심히 갈아 줘야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "Oh, how I miss sleeping indoors."
msgstr "실내에서 잠들던 때가 그립군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "Surely someone else can set it up."
msgstr "누가 설치해주겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "It is in the nightshade family, you know."
msgstr "이것도 가지속에 들어간다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "Potatoes are powerful things, not to be underestimated."
msgstr "감자는 과소평가하면 안 되는 강력한 거라고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "It's so delicate."
msgstr "무척 섬세하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "What an odd way to serve potatoes."
msgstr "감자를 특이하게도 요리했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "The potato may be eaten now."
msgstr "이제 감자를 먹어도 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It has more starch than my best suit."
msgstr "내가 가진 의상 중에 제일 좋은 것보다 전분이 더 많아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "How quaint."
msgstr "참으로 구식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "What foul manifestation of evil is this?"
msgstr "악의 끔찍한 발현인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "You're not one of mine... where did you come from?!"
msgstr "넌 내가 만든 녀석이 아니군... 어디서 온 거냐?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Surely there must be some water nearby."
msgstr "확실히 근처에 물이 있어야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "I really don't care for gardening."
msgstr "정원 가꾸기는 정말 별로야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "They'll put anyone in charge nowadays."
msgstr "요즘에는 아무나 대장 자리에 앉히나 본데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a puffin."
msgstr "퍼핀이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "I'm gonna turn you into puffin' stuff."
msgstr "얌전히 있어야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep is only a temporary escape."
msgstr "잠은 일시적인 도피에 불과하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "Hallowe'en was always my favorite."
msgstr "나는 언제나 할로윈을 좋아했지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER"
msgid "Delightful."
msgstr "마음에 들어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "It's been eons since I had a good biscuit."
msgstr "좋은 비스킷 먹어본지 참 오래 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "Well... perhaps just a slice."
msgstr "뭐... 한 조각만 먹을까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "A little more refined, at least."
msgstr "조금은 구색을 갖추게 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Why hello, Mr. Crane."
msgstr "안녕하군, 크레인 씨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How very spooky."
msgstr "얼마나 으스스한지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Such labor is beneath me."
msgstr "나에게는 천한 노동이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "A crude test of my weapons' power."
msgstr "내 무기의 위력에 대한 조잡한 시험이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "I wonder if she knows about this..."
msgstr "그녀도 이것에 대해 알고 있으려나..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "It speaks with the shadow."
msgstr "그림자와 대화를 나누는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Purple brings great power."
msgstr "보라색은 큰 힘을 불러오지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "A decent enough use of the gem's power, I suppose."
msgstr "보석의 힘을 적당히 쓰는 듯."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "I'm not sure how it draws magic from this."
msgstr "어떻게 여기에서 마법을 끌어오는지 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Best offer it something if we enjoy living."
msgstr "살고 싶다면 뭔가를 줘야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "It's a post."
msgstr "기둥이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Creeping ivy."
msgstr "담쟁이덩굴이 쫙 깔렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "A bit excessive..."
msgstr "좀 과도하군..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "I do like a good statue."
msgstr "훌륭한 조각상이라면 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Misdirected dedication."
msgstr "잘못된 헌신이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "It's seen better days."
msgstr "많이 늙었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Those are never growing back."
msgstr "다시는 자라지 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "Refined dishware."
msgstr "고급 접시."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "Homey."
msgstr "가정식이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "A tiny bit of domestication."
msgstr "약간 가정적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "Well, well, well..."
msgstr "자아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2"
msgid "I'll have use for this."
msgstr "이걸 쓸 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3"
msgid "On my way up in the world."
msgstr "신분 상승이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4"
msgid "We may wyrm our way out of this predicament yet."
msgstr "이 곤경에서 잘하면 빠져나갈 수 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT"
msgid "Ah, how refined."
msgstr "아, 고급스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Perfect with a bit of butter."
msgstr "버터가 조금 있으면 완벽하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP"
msgid "Dinner should be arriving any moment."
msgstr "저녁 식사가 곧 도착하겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN"
msgid "Perhaps it has some flavor to it."
msgstr "어쩌면 의외의 맛이 날지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR"
msgid "I suppose one could make baked goods with this."
msgstr "이걸로 뭔가를 구워낼 수 있을지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED"
msgid "I ought to mix it in with something else."
msgstr "다른 무언가와 섞어야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's see how the wyrm likes this."
msgstr "과연 이건 어쩌나 보자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH"
msgid "This is exactly what the wyrm wants."
msgstr "바로 이걸 원했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK"
msgid "Well, I suppose it will tide the wyrm over."
msgstr "지금은 이거라도 바쳐야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH"
msgid "Nope. It won't eat that."
msgstr "아니야. 그건 안 먹을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT"
msgid "I didn't cook that one."
msgstr "내가 요리한 게 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC"
msgid "I suppose that's why there are no vampires around."
msgstr "이것 때문에 여기에 흡혈귀가 없구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "I wonder if it still wards away the undead."
msgstr "이래도 언데드를 퇴치할까 궁금하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID"
msgid "He has no future ahead of him. A shame."
msgstr "미래가 없으니 참 안타까운 일이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK"
msgid "My bones are naturally fragile, I'm afraid."
msgstr "내 뼈는 워낙 약해서 무섭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM"
msgid "May I peruse your wares, ma'am?"
msgstr "뭘 파는지 구경해도 될까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL"
msgid "I believe I can barbeque."
msgstr "바비큐를 할 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM"
msgid "No use to me here."
msgstr "여기서는 소용없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL"
msgid "I'd prefer a larger grill."
msgstr "난 더 큰 그릴이 좋은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM"
msgid "At least it's portable."
msgstr "그래도 휴대용인 건 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE"
msgid "This is so very beneath me."
msgstr "이건 내 수준에서 한참 아래야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY"
msgid "And they thought their things were safe."
msgstr "물건이 안전할 거라 여겼겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK"
msgid "This should open some doors."
msgstr "이걸로 문을 몇 개는 열 수 있겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST"
msgid "A touch of civility."
msgstr "문명의 손길이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT"
msgid "A little civility."
msgstr "약간의 문명이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE"
msgid "This looks like it requires hard labor."
msgstr "중노동이 필요해 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE"
msgid "The stinking abode of those filthy fish creatures."
msgstr "역겨운 물고기 생물체들의 고약한 집이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1"
msgid "Let's see what they have today."
msgstr "오늘은 뭐가 있나 봐야지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2"
msgid "Well what do we have here?"
msgstr "대체 이건 뭐지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS"
msgid "Fungus has its uses."
msgstr "버섯도 나름대로 쓸 데가 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC"
msgid "I could, perhaps, produce a makeshift garnish."
msgstr "요리 위에 뿌려보는 것도 나쁘지 않을 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED"
msgid "It's as hollow as this withered world."
msgstr "이 시든 세계만큼 텅 비어 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION"
msgid "It's a pungent onion."
msgstr "코를 톡 쏘는 양파군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED"
msgid "Take that, onion."
msgstr "죽어라, 양파."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN"
msgid "This makes things much more convenient."
msgstr "여러 가지를 더 편리하게 만들어 주지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM"
msgid "It's an oven. For cooking."
msgstr "요리에 쓰는 오븐이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE"
msgid "Spikey. Like me."
msgstr "뾰족하군. 나처럼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL"
msgid "Some kind of gargoyle."
msgstr "가고일 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2"
msgid "Well that's attractive."
msgstr "매력적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN"
msgid "Just useless rubble now."
msgstr "쓸모없는 돌 더미가 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC"
msgid "Seems we've got it open."
msgstr "여는 데 성공한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED"
msgid "It needs a key."
msgstr "열쇠가 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK"
msgid "It's a monument to death."
msgstr "죽음의 기념비군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
msgid "Yes yes, ashes to ashes and all that."
msgstr "그래, 눈에는 눈이고 재는 재지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB"
msgid "You can't hide from me."
msgstr "나한테서 영영 숨을 순 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD"
msgid "It is no more."
msgstr "이제는 죽었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC"
msgid "How are birds getting in here?"
msgstr "새들은 대체 어떻게 여기 오는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Fast asleep."
msgstr "깊이 잠들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER"
msgid "Suitable lavishness."
msgstr "적당히 호화롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT"
msgid "Brackish."
msgstr "소금기 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL"
msgid "Nobody listens to me."
msgstr "아무도 내 말을 안 듣는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY"
msgid "Good. I can get out of here."
msgstr "좋아. 여기서 나갈 수 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT"
msgid "Magic could bring it to a boil faster, you know."
msgstr "마법을 사용하면 더 빨리 끓일 수 있다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO"
msgid "It is in the nightshade family, you know."
msgstr "이것도 가지속에 들어간다고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "The potato may be eaten now."
msgstr "이제 감자를 먹어도 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER"
msgid "I can put this to good use."
msgstr "유용하게 쓸 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM"
msgid "Well I'M not setting it up."
msgstr "나는 저거 설치 못해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL"
msgid "I shalln't let it speak with the kettle."
msgstr "주전자와 대화하지 못하게 해야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP"
msgid "I need to sweeten the pot."
msgstr "단지를 더 달게 만들어야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP"
msgid "Foul."
msgstr "불결하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE"
msgid "A bicycle built askew."
msgstr "자전거가 비뚤어졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE"
msgid "Carriage carnage."
msgstr "박살난 마차."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL"
msgid "They didn't pray hard enough."
msgstr "열심히 기도하지 않았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY"
msgid "Something has happened here."
msgstr "어떤 일이 일어났어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2"
msgid "Nobody has kept up with repairs."
msgstr "아무도 수리하지 않았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK"
msgid "Time's up."
msgstr "시간이 끝났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER"
msgid "A late clocktower."
msgstr "한때 시계탑이었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1"
msgid "No one's living there anymore."
msgstr "이젠 아무도 여기 살지 않지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2"
msgid "Such destruction."
msgstr "처참한 파괴의 현장이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3"
msgid "Nothing like the decline of a civilization."
msgstr "뻔한 문명의 몰락이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR"
msgid "If only it lead somewhere."
msgstr "뒤에 뭐가 있었으면 좋겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF"
msgid "It's no longer over anyone's head."
msgstr "더 이상 머리 위에 있지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC"
msgid "Now for some expert-level rummaging."
msgstr "전문가급의 탐색이 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED"
msgid "I cannot open it."
msgstr "열 수 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON"
msgid "Foul smelling, but delicious."
msgstr "냄새는 지독하지만 맛은 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED"
msgid "I do enjoy a good smoked salmon."
msgstr "뛰어난 훈제 연어는 맛있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT"
msgid "Adding too much is an a-salt on the senses."
msgstr "음식에 너무 많이 더하면 너무 짜지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK"
msgid "It must be ground down before we use it."
msgstr "쓰기 전에 우선 갈아야 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Any method to improve the food around here is welcome."
msgstr "어떻게든 여기의 음식을 맛있게 할 수만 있다면 시도할 가치가 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY"
msgid "Ah. It's ready."
msgstr "아. 준비되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM"
msgid "Just useless sticks until we assemble it."
msgstr "조립하기 전까지는 쓸모없는 막대지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP"
msgid "I would rather not get that on my gloves."
msgstr "장갑에는 묻히고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET"
msgid "It's already sticky."
msgstr "벌써 끈적이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING"
msgid "I don't have time to watch twigs grow."
msgstr "가지가 자라는 걸 지켜볼 시간은 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED"
msgid "Bittersweet."
msgstr "씁쓸하고 달콤하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "Instruments of toil."
msgstr "고생의 도구군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL"
msgid "I don't mind getting my hands dirty with this."
msgstr "이걸로는 손을 더럽혀도 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND"
msgid "Spicy."
msgstr "자극적이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC"
msgid "Aromatic."
msgstr "향기롭군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED"
msgid "That's not growing back anytime soon."
msgstr "금방 자라지는 않겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG"
msgid "That will spice things up."
msgstr "음식에 맛을 더해주겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "A sickly sweet aroma wafts from its branches."
msgstr "어지러울 정도로 달콤한 향이 가지에서 나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP"
msgid "It won't produce sap now."
msgstr "이젠 수액을 만들 수 없게 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS"
msgid "Well it's ruined now."
msgstr "이젠 망쳤군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY"
msgid "It is filling. Ever so slowly."
msgstr "차고 있군. 아주 느리게."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY"
msgid "The sap is ready for collection."
msgstr "이제 수액을 채취할 수 있게 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED"
msgid "This tree has seen better days."
msgstr "이 나무도 상태가 말이 아니군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG"
msgid "Don't touch the suit."
msgstr "양복은 건들지 마라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Charmed, I'm sure."
msgstr "매혹되었군, 분명히."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Fast asleep."
msgstr "깊이 잠들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE"
msgid "It could use renovations."
msgstr "리모델링이 필요하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE"
msgid "It's been a long time since this stood properly."
msgstr "이게 집 구실하던 시절에서부터 매우 오랜 시간이 지났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP"
msgid "Cooking syrup. Of course."
msgstr "당연히 요리용 시럽이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO"
msgid "It's a red, red tomato."
msgstr "붉고 빨간 토마토군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "It's a red, red roasted tomato."
msgstr "붉고 빨갛고 구운 토마토군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM"
msgid "Good day to you, sir."
msgstr "안녕하신가."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2"
msgid "I tip my hat to you sir."
msgstr "고맙군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP"
msgid "It's a big, bulbous turnip."
msgstr "커다랗고 둥근 순무군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "Hardly improves the taste."
msgstr "딱히 맛이 좋아지진 않았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT"
msgid "This would be more useful as flour."
msgstr "밀가루였으면 더 쓸 데가 많았을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS"
msgid "Am I supposed to plant these?"
msgstr "이걸 심어야 하는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I've been here too long... it actually looks tasty."
msgstr "내가 여기에 너무 오래 있었던 모양이군... 실제로 맛있군 이것이."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "Don't worry, rabbit. Everything is under control."
msgstr "안심해, 토끼. 다 잘 될 테니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT"
msgid "The rabbit goes in the hat, not on it. Preposterous."
msgstr "토끼는 모자 위가 아니라 안에 있어야지. 터무니없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "There's a world going on under there."
msgstr "아래에 또 다른 세상이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "The entrance has collapsed in on itself."
msgstr "입구가 내려 앉았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Cleverness killed the carrot."
msgstr "영리해서 당근이 죽었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh, isn't that clever."
msgstr "오, 영리하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN"
msgid "I doubt its reliability."
msgstr "믿음이 안 가는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST"
msgid "You think I'd trust their ilk to hold my things?"
msgstr "저런 족속에게 내 물건을 맡길 것 같나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "Tell scallywag Simon I've got a hat he'll never escape from!"
msgstr "못된 사이먼 녀석한테 전해! 나한테 절대 탈출할 수 없는 모자가 있다고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR"
msgid "About all they're good for."
msgstr "녀석들이 쓸모 있는 데라고는 이것뿐이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "Of course Simon's brute cousin fights his battles for him."
msgstr "역시 사이먼의 난폭한 친척들이 대신 싸우는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "You've embarassed me for the last time, Simon!"
msgstr "다시는 네게 망신을 당하지 않겠다, 사이먼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "Spare me the token gesture. Simon knows what he did."
msgstr "형식적인 제스쳐는 집어 치우라지. 사이먼은 자기가 무슨 짓을 했는지 잘 알아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "Out, out rain!"
msgstr "비는 사절이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "Not the most dapper of hats, but quite necessary."
msgstr "딱히 보기에 멋진 모자는 아니지만, 매우 쓸모 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "The rain did not come in time."
msgstr "비가 제 시간에 오지 않았군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "I could just look up and learn the same thing."
msgstr "조사 좀 하면 같은 것을 배울 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "Roughage."
msgstr "조악한 음식물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "If only the world had a single neck."
msgstr "세계의 목이 하나만 있다면 좋겠지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD"
msgid "Destroy it!"
msgstr "저걸 파괴해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO"
msgid "The jovial sound invades my mind. Keep it off."
msgstr "이 흥겨운 소리가 내 머릿속을 헤집는군. 꺼 버려라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST"
msgid "Forgive me if I've lost my taste for music."
msgstr "미안하지만 이제 음악을 들어도 별 느낌이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER"
msgid "Silence would be preferable."
msgstr "아무 소리도 안 나는 게 더 나을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN"
msgid "Forgive me if I've lost my taste for music."
msgstr "미안하지만 이제 음악을 들어도 별 느낌이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE"
msgid "Silence would be preferable."
msgstr "아무 소리도 안 나는 게 더 나을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK"
msgid "Silence would be preferable."
msgstr "아무 소리도 안 나는 게 더 나을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS"
msgid "Silence would be preferable."
msgstr "아무 소리도 안 나는 게 더 나을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END"
msgid "Forgive me if I've lost my taste for music."
msgstr "미안하지만 이제 음악을 들어도 별 느낌이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS"
msgid "Ugh, no more."
msgstr "크윽, 이제 그만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN"
msgid "Silence would be preferable."
msgstr "아무 소리도 안 나는 게 더 나을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE"
msgid "Forgive me if I've lost my taste for music."
msgstr "미안하지만 이제 음악을 들어도 별 느낌이 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "Red brings fire."
msgstr "붉은색이 불을 불러오지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "Not having a light would certainly be unlucky."
msgstr "빛이 없다면 운도 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "Its aura can be felt from anywhere. Quite useful."
msgstr "어디에서든 그 오라를 느낄 수 있군. 꽤 유용한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "A spot of luck."
msgstr "행운을 주겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "I forget what this one does."
msgstr "이게 어떤 작용을 하는지 잊어버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Kind of bitter."
msgstr "좀 쓰군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a red mushroom."
msgstr "빨간 버섯이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It'll have to come back for it."
msgstr "나중에 돌아와야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "It's all used up."
msgstr "다 따버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr "이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "There's wind in them there willows."
msgstr "바람에 흔들리는 버드나무가 생각나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "No more tubes."
msgstr "이제는 거둘 게 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST"
msgid "It may have some alchemical uses."
msgstr "연금술을 쓰는 데 사용했을지도 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Safety before dapperness."
msgstr "멋보다는 안전이 더 중요하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "Remnants of an extinct civilization."
msgstr "멸망한 문명의 잔재물이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "The fire learned how to burn it down."
msgstr "불이 뭔가를 완전히 태우는 방법을 익혔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't believe I forgot how to build those things."
msgstr "이걸 만드는 방법을 잊어버렸다니, 믿을 수 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "Flames have swallowed it whole."
msgstr "화염이 완전히 삼켜버렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "It unlocks recipes of middling utility."
msgstr "유용성이 적당한 레시피를 잠금 해제하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "Research complete."
msgstr "연구 완료군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "This is where I do my own personal research."
msgstr "내 연구를 진행하는 장소지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "That was its final act."
msgstr "이것으로 끝이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "Quite a dapper machine."
msgstr "꽤 멋진 기계군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL"
msgid "Presto change-o! Ahem... old habit."
msgstr "변해라, 얍! 에헴... 옛날 버릇이 나왔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "No one will be using that any longer."
msgstr "아무도 더는 사용할 수 없겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not above using this."
msgstr "나라고 이걸 사용하지 않을 순 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "There's a story behind that..."
msgstr "여기에는 사실 전해지는 얘기가 있는데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "I'm not sure I really want to give this up."
msgstr "이걸 포기하고 싶지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "Brutish grotesquerie."
msgstr "미개하고 추잡하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY"
msgid "I myself will carve this roast beast."
msgstr "이 구운 짐승은 내가 직접 자르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "The redbird comes from the fire lands."
msgstr "붉은 새는 불의 땅에서 왔지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "Silence, bird!"
msgstr "조용히 해라, 새야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "You're new."
msgstr "넌 새로 왔구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "Nothing up my sleeve..."
msgstr "소매엔 아무것도 없..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Is this the robot's doing?"
msgstr "이건 로봇이 하는 일인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "Better them than me."
msgstr "나보단 그들이 당하는 것이 낫지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "It's a rock."
msgstr "바위다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "Hmmm. Now what do I do with them?"
msgstr "흠. 이제 이걸로 뭘 한담?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "I banished these guys down here for a reason."
msgstr "이 녀석들을 여기로 추방했던 데에는 이유가 있었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN"
msgid "It is fruitless and useless now."
msgstr "열매도 쓸모도 없어졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Well that's a shame."
msgstr "안타깝게 됐군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It's ill."
msgstr "병에 걸렸군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "I think it's sick or something."
msgstr "아무래도 아픈 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "It labors to make my dinner."
msgstr "내 저녁을 만들기 위해 애쓰는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "What use are you to me if you don't have fruit?"
msgstr "열매가 없으면 무슨 쓸모가 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It resembles Woodie, does it not?"
msgstr "우디를 닮지 않았나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT"
msgid "I'd rather not shatter my teeth on that."
msgstr "씹어서 이가 다 나가고 싶진 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE"
msgid "It's ripe enough to eat now."
msgstr "이제 먹어도 될 만큼 익었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED"
msgid "It looks almost appetizing."
msgstr "거의 먹음직스러워 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT"
msgid "How off-putting. It's grown a sprout."
msgstr "참 정이 안 가는군. 싹이 자랐잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "I could get a chip of ice off the old block."
msgstr "바위에서 얼음을 쪼아낼 수 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "It's just a puddle."
msgstr "단순한 웅덩이일 뿐이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "It's just a puddle."
msgstr "단순한 웅덩이일 뿐이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "The top of this lava pit has cooled into a fine crust."
msgstr "용암의 겉이 차가워졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The fires are cooling."
msgstr "불이 식고 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "It's hot."
msgstr "뜨겁다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "It looks harmless."
msgstr "무해해 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "\"Moon\" rock."
msgstr "\"달\" 돌이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "I think it looks much better this way."
msgstr "이쪽이 더 나아 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "I think it looks much better this way."
msgstr "이쪽이 더 나아 보이는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "A castle for my home."
msgstr "내 집을 위한 성이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "The builders have left it in a state of abandonment."
msgstr "건축자들이 버려두고 갔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "You'd think this would have more uses."
msgstr "이거라면 쓸 데가 많을 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT"
msgid "Ugh. You have to build it?!"
msgstr "어휴. 직접 만들어야 한다고?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Are you prepared for what you'll find?"
msgstr "뭘 찾게 될지 마음의 준비는 됐나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "Disgusting. Why keep this around?"
msgstr "역겹군. 이걸 왜 아직도 갖고 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "Unsettlingly wobbly."
msgstr "불안하게 흔들리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Everything eventually turns to dust."
msgstr "모든 것은 결국 먼지가 되어 버리지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "Fuel must flow."
msgstr "연료가 흘러야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "The fuel runs deep in this."
msgstr "안에 연료가 깊이 흐르고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "A broken relic."
msgstr "부서진 유물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A relic best forgotten."
msgstr "잊힌 게 나은 유물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "It seems I am to be judged."
msgstr "나를 평가하려는 모양이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "And I may never put it back on."
msgstr "다시 장착할 수 없을지도 모르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "But that means I'd have to touch the smelly thing."
msgstr "저 냄새나는 걸 만져야 한다는 뜻도 되지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "But is it fast enough to escape the judgmental stares?"
msgstr "깐깐한 눈초리로부터 도망칠 수 있을 정도로 빠르긴 한가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW"
msgid "I hate it."
msgstr "싫은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "At least it affords some dignity to the rider."
msgstr "적어도 탄 사람의 품위를 어느 정도는 유지해주겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "I suppose the beast deserves a bit of protection."
msgstr "그 짐승도 어느 정도의 보호는 받아야겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "A bit spicy for my delicate palate."
msgstr "내 섬세한 입맛에는 좀 맵군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "This will extend the life of our supplies somewhat."
msgstr "보급품 수명을 어느 정도 연장하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "So salty."
msgstr "아주 짜군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED"
msgid "Blech, it's covered in beefalo spit."
msgstr "우욱, 비팔로 침으로 뒤덮여 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "Am I to be a salt miner now?"
msgstr "이제는 소금까지 캐야 하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "Odd..."
msgstr "이상하네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "It seems to be growing back..."
msgstr "다시 자라는 것 같은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "It's been mined down to nothing."
msgstr "하나도 남김없이 캐냈군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "Impressive."
msgstr "대단하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "That was quite impolite."
msgstr "참으로 무례하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "I can see its true nature now!"
msgstr "이제 진짜 모습을 볼 수 있군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "There are two ways to see that obstacle."
msgstr "저 장애물을 볼 수 있는 방법은 두 가지가 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr "이런."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "What has brought this blight upon my world?"
msgstr "누가 나의 세계에 이런 끔찍한 병을 일으킨 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Looks a little off, if you ask me."
msgstr "좀 상한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "A supple, woody stem."
msgstr "유연한 나무 줄기군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "It'll grow back."
msgstr "다시 자라겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "Nothing survives in this heat."
msgstr "이 더위에서 살아남을 수 있는 건 아무것도 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "Well... fine. I suppose that sums it all up, more or less."
msgstr "음... 좋아. 대략 요약이 되네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "Nothing is safe."
msgstr "그 무엇도 안전하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "The scarecrow has gone to a place where there is no fear."
msgstr "허수아비는 두려움이 없는 곳으로 떠났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "It's an empty shell of a man."
msgstr "속은 비어있는, 사람 형체의 껍데기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "At least the fire cut down on the smell."
msgstr "적어도 불 덕분에 악취는 좀 가셨군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Curious. It may yield some useful information."
msgstr "흥미롭군. 유용한 정보가 있을지도 모르겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "Can you really call that pile of refuse a hat?"
msgstr "저 쓰레기 더미를 정말 모자라고 불러도 되는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "I don't need glasses! Who told you I need glasses?"
msgstr "안경은 필요 없어! 누가 나한테 안경이 필요하대?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "How I've missed the act of creation."
msgstr "창조의 즐거움을 잊고 있었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "To sculpt, to carve, no more."
msgstr "이젠 조각 새기는 일도 끝이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "A block of marble might suffice."
msgstr "대리석 조각이 있으면 충분해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "Ah, yes. Not terrible."
msgstr "아, 그래. 나쁘지 않군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Hmph. I was never a fan of the Grecian look."
msgstr "흠. 난 전부터 그리스풍이 별로였어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "That looks much better."
msgstr "훨씬 낫군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "We'll get you out in a tick, friend."
msgstr "금방 꺼내주지, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Come now! I liked that one."
msgstr "쳇! 내 마음에 들었던 건데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "I've seen that head before... but never in marble."
msgstr "이 머리는 본 적이 있어... 대리석으로 되어있지는 않았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Waste of good marble if you ask me."
msgstr "훌륭한 대리석을 아깝게 낭비했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Back as intended."
msgstr "원래대로 돌아왔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "We'll get you out in a tick, friend."
msgstr "금방 꺼내주지, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "My creations! How rude."
msgstr "내가 만든 건데! 정말 너무해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "That looks... familiar..."
msgstr "저거 어째... 눈에 익은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Some truly questionable taste in decor."
msgstr "취향 정말 별로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Doesn't that feel better now?"
msgstr "기분이 좋지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "We'll get you out in a tick, friend."
msgstr "금방 꺼내주지, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Why would anyone want to cover this up?"
msgstr "대체 왜 이걸 덮은 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "That's quite the schnozz."
msgstr "코가 꽤 굉장하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "Well, it's useless now."
msgstr "이제 쓸모없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "Now to see if Higgsbury's ideas hold water."
msgstr "힉스버리의 생각이 통할지 확인해 봐야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "It looks passable."
msgstr "대충 괜찮을 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "It would be easy to wreck a vessel on one of those."
msgstr "난파되기 딱 좋군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "It's empty. Someone do something."
msgstr "비어 있군. 누가 뭐라도 해 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "It's full. Someone do something."
msgstr "꽉 차 있군. 누가 뭐라도 해 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "One more thing to lug from place to place."
msgstr "여기저기로 날라야 할 것이 하나 더 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "I suppose these won't plant themselves."
msgstr "저절로 땅에 심기는 일은 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "Broiled the life out of 'em."
msgstr "구워서 생기를 다 없앴다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "This is a conduit for strong revelatory magicks."
msgstr "강한 발견 마법을 위한 통로지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "A fine and noble endeavor."
msgstr "훌륭하고 고급스러운 일이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT"
msgid "Someone should clean that up."
msgstr "누가 좀 치워야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Finally, someone who'll carry my things."
msgstr "드디어 내 짐을 들어줄 사람이 생겼군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "The wilderness is tough on a tailor made suit."
msgstr "황무지에서 지내면 맞춤 양복은 금방 상하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
msgid "What have I become."
msgstr "내가 이 지경이 되다니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "I'm a shadow of myself. Ha-ha!"
msgstr "내가 나의 그림자가 되었군. 하하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "A pulse of malice and betrayal beats within."
msgstr "적의와 배신이 안에서 고동치고 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Mind the gap."
msgstr "떨어지지 않게 조심해야겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS"
msgid "You think you're the master of sleight of hand?"
msgstr "네 손재주가 그리 뛰어난 줄 아나 보지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS"
msgid "I'll leave a bitter taste in your mouth, pal."
msgstr "쓴맛을 보여주지, 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH"
msgid "What are you smiling at, pal?"
msgstr "뭘 보고 웃는 거냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE"
msgid "An unwelcome guest."
msgstr "불청객이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS"
msgid "You think you can look down on me?"
msgstr "감히 날 내려다볼 수 있을 것 같나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE"
msgid "Lovely."
msgstr "사랑스럽군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL"
msgid "This is some decent magic."
msgstr "뛰어난 마법이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE"
msgid "What shall I fashion from the shadows?"
msgstr "그림자로부터 무엇을 만들어 볼까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "There is work to be done."
msgstr "할 일이 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE"
msgid "Fancy..."
msgstr "멋지군..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "What a nasty creature. I wish I'd thought of it."
msgstr "못된 생물이군. 왜 저 생각을 못 했을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI"
msgid "Who dreamed up this icy abomination?"
msgstr "이 얼어붙은 흉물은 누가 상상해 낸 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "That was not worth the effort."
msgstr "애쓴 보람이 없었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "At least dealing with that monstrosity was good for something."
msgstr "적어도 그 괴물에 처리한 건 가치 있는 일이었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "This is some real advanced technology."
msgstr "최첨단 테크놀로지군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I'd rather let someone else do my dirty work."
msgstr "번거로운 일은 다른 사람한테 시키고 싶은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "Wilson should try it."
msgstr "윌슨한테 먹어보라고 해야겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "I suppose I've eaten worse."
msgstr "이보다 더 안 좋은 걸 먹었나봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "I hope the warts are not contagious."
msgstr "물집이 전염되는 건 아니겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "So much for the shade thing."
msgstr "그늘이 없어졌군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "Rustic, but excellent shade."
msgstr "소박하지만 훌륭한 그늘이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "Despite its origin, it could make some fine garments."
msgstr "출처는 고급이 아니지만, 결과물인 옷은 고급이겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "흠?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC"
msgid "No, go on, keep playing that same note. It's not irritating at all."
msgstr "아니, 계속 같은 음으로 연주해. 전혀 거슬리지 않으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
msgid "I've quite lost my taste for music."
msgstr "이제 음악을 들어도 별 느낌이 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't help but wonder... no, it couldn't be."
msgstr "혹시... 아니, 그럴 리가 없지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS"
msgid "It has a strangely calming effect."
msgstr "이상하게 마음이 편해지는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM"
msgid "What an odd noise."
msgstr "정말 이상한 소리야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL"
msgid "Stop attacking my mind!"
msgstr "내 정신을 그만 공격해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS"
msgid "Perhaps I should pay my respects as well."
msgstr "나도 경의를 표하는 게 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "Ha! I remember that one."
msgstr "훗! 기억나는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "A most tragic and unfitting end."
msgstr "아주 비극적이고 끔찍한 종말이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER"
msgid "You're not of much use to me now, are you?"
msgstr "이젠 나한테 별 쓸모가 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "A pity, %s. So ill-prepared for %s."
msgstr "안타깝군, %s. %s에 대한 준비가 전혀 안 되어 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "A pity, %s. She was not prepared for %s."
msgstr "안타깝군, %s. %s에 대한 준비가 전혀 안 되어 있었어."

