msgstr "\n수리할 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS"
