msgstr "물건이 충분하지 않아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION"
