msgstr "따라 부르고 싶다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
