msgstr "이건 엉뚱하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "Maybe Maxwell will teach us how to play."
msgstr "어쩌면 맥스웰이 게임을 가르쳐줄 지도 모르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Maybe Maxwell will teach us how to play."
msgstr "어쩌면 맥스웰이 게임을 가르쳐줄 지도 모르지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "It won't come undone!"
msgstr "안 풀어진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "We can't follow the rules if we don't know them."
msgstr "규칙이 뭔지 모르면 지킬 수도 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "We can't follow the rules if we don't know them."
msgstr "규칙이 뭔지 모르면 지킬 수도 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "It's not bouncy. What's the point?"
msgstr "탄력이 없는 공이다. 그게 무슨 공이지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "It's a friend for our finger!!"
msgstr "우리 손가락의 친구다!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "The monkey probably needed that."
msgstr "원숭이가 원하는 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "I kinda wanna drink what's left, but he won't let me."
msgstr "나는 남은 걸 마시고 싶은데, 얘가 못 마시게 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "We've already got some, thanks."
msgstr "고맙지만 이미 갖고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Maybe we should hide this before someone gets hurt."
msgstr "누군가 다치기 전에 이걸 숨겨야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "Haha! Everything looks so small!"
msgstr "하하! 다 조그맣게 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "That's boring."
msgstr "지루하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "It's watching us."
msgstr "우리를 보고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "Haha, it looks like a snail shell."
msgstr "하하, 달팽이 껍데기 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "Haha! Weird!"
msgstr "하하! 이상하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "Neat!!"
msgstr "멋지다!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "C'mon little croc! Let's adventure!"
msgstr "작은 악어야! 같이 모험 하자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "The plant is so pretty!"
msgstr "식물이 너무 예쁘다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It doesn't get any good channels."
msgstr "좋은 채널이 별로 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "What's it for?"
msgstr "용도가 뭘까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "Yay, a new toy!"
msgstr "이야, 새 장난감이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "Maybe we'll find a use for these."
msgstr "찾아보면 쓸데가 있을 수도 있겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "Another toy!"
msgstr "또 다른 장난감이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "I miss bath toys."
msgstr "욕조 장난감 가지고 놀고 싶다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "None of them match!"
msgstr "다 안 맞는다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "Oh no oh no!"
msgstr "이런, 안 돼!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr "저런..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Woah! We should find a big fish to put in there!"
msgstr "우와! 커다란 물고기를 잡아서 넣어야겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
