msgstr "저 불쌍한 모자를 뭉갤 순 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
