msgstr "이해는 할 수 없지만, 폭발성 점액을 지니고 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "Pieces of the broken."
msgstr "부러진 등딱지 조각이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "A rather diminutive specimen of the class Aves."
msgstr "꽤 작은 조류의 표본이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "It requires sustenance."
msgstr "영양 보충이 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "It tired itself out."
msgstr "지쳐 잠들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Without sustenance, it will surely perish."
msgstr "영양 보충을 못 하면 분명히 죽고 말 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "Your adorable appearance won't make me believe in you!"
msgstr "네가 귀엽다고 해서 널 믿지는 않아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "It's a small, raw piece of meat."
msgstr "작은 날고기 조각이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "High sodium content."
msgstr "나트륨 함량이 높지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "What a ruffian!"
msgstr "이런 무뢰한 같으니!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM"
msgid "Those young ones better mind their manners."
msgstr "그 어린애들이 예의 있게 행동해야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "재미있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL"
msgid "It needs much more to call it a snowman."
msgstr "눈사람이라 부르기엔 아직 한참 부족해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "A rare variant of gastropod."
msgstr "희귀한 복족류 동물이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Kelp makes for an excellent fertilizer if prepared correctly."
msgstr "다시마를 제대로 처리하면 훌륭한 비료가 되지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "Quite acceptable, though it would be even better if I left it for just a bit longer."
msgstr "꽤 잘 된 것 같지만 더 오래 두면 더 좋겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "It should sit for a while longer yet, to reach full potency."
msgstr "효능에 제대로 생기려면 아직 더 오래 둬야 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "Oh, the garden will enjoy this immensely!"
msgstr "오, 정원이 엄청나게 즐기겠군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Ovis chalybs, and a right mean looking one at that."
msgstr "사납게 생긴 오비스 찰립스로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "Ancient weapons technology."
msgstr "고대의 무기로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I fear I'll not be much use with that."
msgstr "나한테는 별로 쓸모가 없는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Such an ineffectual shape for a polearm."
msgstr "폴암으로 쓰기엔 모양이 별로 효과적이지 않은 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "What a handsome hunting implement."
msgstr "참으로 멋있는 사냥 도구네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "An electrically conductive spear! How intriguing."
msgstr "전도성 창이라! 참 흥미로운걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "This should keep my provisions from spoiling!"
msgstr "이러면 내 식량이 상하지 않겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "I'm not a fan of spicy food."
msgstr "나는 자극적인 음식을 별로 좋아하지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "My goodness that smell is pungent!"
msgstr "냄새가 코를 찌르는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "Just a pinch will do."
msgstr "한 꼬집이면 되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "A treacle of fruits."
msgstr "과일에서 추출한 당밀이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "It's dead."
msgstr "사망했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "A large, carnivorous arachnid species."
msgstr "커다란 육식 거미 종이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "They appear to be nocturnal."
msgstr "야행성인 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "Fascinating. These spiders have a communal hive."
msgstr "신기해라. 이 거미는 공동의 서식처에서 지내는 모양이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "Be sure to tidy up when you're finished, young arachnid."
msgstr "작업이 끝나면 정리를 확실히 해, 어린 거미야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "A highly portable spider egg sack."
msgstr "휴대성이 뛰어난 거미 알 주머니로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "This gland secretes a mildly toxic venom."
msgstr "이 분비 기관은 독성이 약한 독액을 분비하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Psionic control to exert over spiders. Excluding the boy, of course."
msgstr "거미를 염력으로 조종할 수 있지. 웨버 녀석은 빼고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "거미들의 은신처로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "This is the source of the spider infestation."
msgstr "거미 횡행의 출처입니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "That must be the center of the hive-mind."
msgstr "집단지성의 구심점이겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Ah, this species of arachnid has adapted to life on the cave ceiling."
msgstr "이 거미류 종은 동굴 천장 생태계에 적응했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "This arachnid has evolved the ability to heal others around it."
msgstr "이 거미는 능력이 진화해서 주변의 다른 것들을 치유할 수 있게 되었지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "This balm appears specially formulated to heal arachnids."
msgstr "이 크림은 거미를 치료하려고 특별히 제조된 것인 가봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "An arachnid with a thick carapace."
msgstr "갑각이 두꺼운 거미류네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "걸맞은 최후로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Those mineral deposits may have irritated it into hostility."
msgstr "광물 퇴적물 때문에 적개심이 생겼을지 몰라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "How convenient, it's sleeping."
msgstr "자고 있네, 정말 편리하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "Unfortunately, it seems that the arachnids only respond to one of their kind."
msgstr "불행히도 거미류는 한 종류에만 반응하는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "An arachnid that spits projectiles."
msgstr "발사체를 쏘는 거미류네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "He gave his life for his queen."
msgstr "여왕을 위해 목숨을 바쳤군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "It appears to be of the warrior caste."
msgstr "전사 계급인 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "A well deserved rest, no doubt."
msgstr "쉴 만 하니까 쉬는 거겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "It's incredible that they can create enough surface tension to stay above water at that size."
msgstr "그만한 크기로 물 위에 떠 있기에 충분한 표면 장력을 만들어 낼 수 있다는 것은 놀라운 일이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Arachnids seem to find the sound quite agreeable."
msgstr "거미는 그 소리가 들리면 상당히 기분 좋은 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH"
msgid "That fish matter is becoming a biohazard."
msgstr "생선 조각이 생물학적 위험 요소가 되어가고 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "It is heavy with bacteria."
msgstr "박테리아가 많군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "A bright red carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전 정보를 전달하는 밝은 빨간색의 운반체야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전자 정보 전달자를 내 손에 쥐었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "An odd, yet effective defense mechanism."
msgstr "이상하지만 효과적인 방어 메커니즘이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A lovely green carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전 정보를 전달하는 사랑스런 초록색 운반체야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전자 정보 전달자를 내 손에 쥐었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "A soft blue carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전 정보를 전달하는 부드러운 파란색 운반체야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I'm a carrier of a carrier of genetic information."
msgstr "유전자 정보 전달자를 내 손에 쥐었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Luminesca Cephalopoda! What beautiful bioluminescence!"
msgstr "빛나는 두족류라니! 아름다운 생물발광이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "Some sort of self-contained aurora."
msgstr "자체적으로 오로라를 방출하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Perhaps a larger staff would summon a larger star."
msgstr "지팡이가 더 크면 더 큰 별을 소환할지도 모르겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "It allows the user to attack from afar."
msgstr "멀리서 공격할 수 있게 해주는 무기야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "I've never seen a weather vane employed as a weapon."
msgstr "풍향계를 무기로 쓰는 것은 처음 보는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "That was an underhanded trick!"
msgstr "아주 뻔뻔한 속임수네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Something devious is lurking in the shadows."
msgstr "무언가 사악한 것이 그림자 속에 숨어 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "Something devious is lurking in the shadows."
msgstr "무언가 사악한 것이 그림자 속에 숨어 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "That was an underhanded trick!"
msgstr "아주 뻔뻔한 속임수네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "A strange rock formation."
msgstr "기묘한 바위 형상인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Another stalagmite."
msgstr "또 다른 석순이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "A mistake in need of correcting."
msgstr "시정이 필요한 오류로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "We could have learned much from each other."
msgstr "서로에게서 많은 것을 배울 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "The weaver's twisted creation."
msgstr "직조공의 왜곡된 창조물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "The penmanship is messy, but legible."
msgstr "악필이지만 알아볼 수는 있군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Nope, just a statue."
msgstr "그냥 평범한 조각상이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Is it petrified?"
msgstr "석화된 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "A simple statue."
msgstr "단순한 조각상이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "Someone has let that poor statue become overgrown with vines."
msgstr "누가 저 불쌍한 조각상을 덩굴에 뒤덮이게 내버려뒀군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "He's actually quite a sweet boy when you peel away the ego."
msgstr "자아라는 껍질을 벗겨내면 그 안에는 꽤 착한 소년이 들어있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's been sculpted from metamorphic rock."
msgstr "변성암으로 조각한 물건이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Melpomene. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "뮤즈 멜포메네의 그리스풍 조각상이네. 조각가의 자의적인 해석이 조금 들어갔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "A Grecian-inspired sculpture of the muse Thalia. Some liberties have been taken."
msgstr "뮤즈 탈리아의 그리스풍 조각상이네. 조각가의 자의적인 해석이 조금 들어갔군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "The rain may inadvertently turn it into a bird bath."
msgstr "빗물이 고이면 새들이 멱감는 곳이 될 수도 있겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "It has a variety of household uses."
msgstr "다용도 가재도구로 쓸 수 있겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Ship steering is no easy task."
msgstr "선박 조종은 쉽지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "A necessity should we want to steer our boat."
msgstr "배의 방향을 조종하고 싶다면 꼭 필요한 물건이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It tapers to a sharp point."
msgstr "한쪽이 점점 가늘어지면서 끝이 뾰족해지는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "Reminds me of the chair in my reading nook. Just stonier."
msgstr "내 독서 구역의 의자가 생각나네. 돌이라는 것만 빼면."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "If you're going to sit, you might as well read."
msgstr "이왕 앉아 있을 거라면 책도 읽는 게 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Perfect for enjoying a cup of tea and a good book."
msgstr "차 한 잔 마시면서 좋은 책을 읽기에 안성맞춤이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Perfect for enjoying a cup of tea and a good book."
msgstr "차 한 잔 마시면서 좋은 책을 읽기에 안성맞춤이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "This device is in a state of disrepair."
msgstr "이 장치는 고장 났군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "An automated unit for collecting and sorting items."
msgstr "물건을 모으고 분류하는 자동화 장치야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "This will offer some protection from the sun."
msgstr "태양을 어느 정도 차단해 주겠는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "This aubergine has been cooked and packed with comestibles."
msgstr "가지 속에 다른 식재료를 채우고 익혔지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "Pairs perfectly with some turkey and gravy."
msgstr "칠면조와 그레이비와 완벽하게 어울리는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It will wither if not replanted."
msgstr "다시 심지 않으면 시들고 말 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "Uniquely adapted to arid climates."
msgstr "건조한 기후에 특화된 식물이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I wonder how my garden is doing without me."
msgstr "내가 없는 동안 내 정원은 어떻게 되었을까 궁금하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A mollusk of exceptional size and functionality."
msgstr "이례적인 크기와 기능성을 가진 연체동물이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Oh dear. I believe this will require a key."
msgstr "이런. 열쇠가 필요하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "A place for everything, and everything in its place."
msgstr "모든 것을 두는 장소야. 그리고 모든 것이 제자리에 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "I'm afraid it will not be able to withstand these tectonic shifts forever."
msgstr "아쉽지만 이런 지각 변동을 언제까지나 버티지는 못할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "It would be prudent to attempt some repairs."
msgstr "수리해 보는 게 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "That should stabilize the cave's ceiling for now."
msgstr "일단은 동굴의 천장이 안정되겠군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "I'm afraid it will not be able to withstand these tectonic shifts forever."
msgstr "아쉽지만 이런 지각 변동을 언제까지나 버티지는 못할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Broken? Perhaps this material is not as indestructible as I surmised."
msgstr "부서졌잖아? 이 소재가 내 생각만큼 단단하지는 않은 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Dreadstone. This will hold."
msgstr "공포석이군. 이거면 버틸 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "It appears some construction is required."
msgstr "건설 작업이 필요한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "It appears some construction is required."
msgstr "건설 작업이 필요한 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "The perfect dish."
msgstr "완벽한 요리로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "This vest screams \"stylish, but well-read.\"."
msgstr "멋도 챙기면서 박식하다는 인상을 주는 조끼로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "It's always a hit at holiday get-togethers."
msgstr "명절 모임에서 언제나 인기 만점이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "It's as if all my worries and cares are fading away."
msgstr "근심과 걱정이 다 사라지는 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "The energy has been stabilized enough to form a functional blade."
msgstr "에너지가 효과적인 칼날을 형성할 정도로 안정화됐어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Oh my, that won't do at all."
msgstr "이런, 쓸모없게 되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Big enough for company."
msgstr "여럿이 모여도 충분할 만큼 커다랗군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "A considerable amount of food!"
msgstr "음식이 아주 많군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Most certainly the wrong type."
msgstr "잘못된 종류야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Organized belongings are key to an organized mind."
msgstr "소지품을 정돈해야 마음도 정돈돼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Interesting! These would improve my fishing significantly!"
msgstr "흥미롭군! 낚시가 훨씬 잘 되겠어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "I can improve my chances of success with better fishing implements."
msgstr "더 좋은 낚시도구가 있으면 성공 확률이 늘어나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "That's terrible for your teeth, dear."
msgstr "치아에 정말 안 좋지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Magnus Avis, fully developed."
msgstr "완전히 성장한 마그너스 아비스로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "It requires incubation."
msgstr "어미가 품어줘야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Full of cholesterol."
msgstr "콜레스테롤 함량이 높지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "You will catch your death of cold!"
msgstr "추워서 죽겠네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Development appears to be progressing."
msgstr "발육이 진행되는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "Exposure to temperature extremes may result in death."
msgstr "극도의 기온에 노출되면 사망할 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "A watched pot never boils."
msgstr "솥을 계속 보고 있으면 절대 안 끓지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "We shall soon reap the fruits of our labors."
msgstr "이제 곧 노고의 결실을 거둘 것입니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "What a tremendous Magnus Avis egg!"
msgstr "마그누스 아비스의 알이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "The nest is empty. Soon the cycle will begin anew."
msgstr "둥지가 비어있군. 곧 생의 순환이 다시 시작되겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "Like most comfort food, it will likely wreak havoc on the arteries."
msgstr "추억의 음식이 대부분 그렇듯 혈관에 아주 해로울 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "The spice is actually quite mild, quite to my liking."
msgstr "향신료가 꽤 순하군. 내 취향에 딱 맞아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "An adolescent avian."
msgstr "사춘기에 들어선 새로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Please keep your voice level to a minimum."
msgstr "목소리를 작게 낮추십시오."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "It seems to have had too much excitement."
msgstr "너무 흥분했나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "A very naughty bird!"
msgstr "아주 못된 새로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "I don't think it's powered yet."
msgstr "아직 동력이 없는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "It looks to be ready."
msgstr "이제 준비가 다 된 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "This machine can be used to travel between worlds."
msgstr "이 기계를 사용하면 다른 세계로 여행할 수 있지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This runestone has unique geometric properties!"
msgstr "독특한 기하학적 특성을 지닌 룬석이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "The device needs to be activated."
msgstr "장치를 작동해야 하는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "The device is in a partial state of completion."
msgstr "장치가 일부 완성되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "An electrical charge regulator."
msgstr "전기 충전 조절 장치네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "It applies basic mechanical principles."
msgstr "기본적인 물리적인 조작으로 작동하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Neither fully organic nor inorganic!"
msgstr "유기물도 무기물도 아닌 어정쩡한 물건!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A torus of alloys and wiring."
msgstr "합금과 배선의 원환체로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "The gem appears to focus the nightmare fuel."
msgstr "보석이 악몽 연료의 초점이 되어주는 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't doing me much good anyhow."
msgstr "어차피 별로 도움되지 않았는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "Sleeping in there would give me a stiff neck."
msgstr "저 안에서 자면 목이 뻣뻣해질 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "A horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "무시무시한 무언가가 진흙 안에서 기다리고 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Never grab the pointy end."
msgstr "뾰족한 쪽은 절대 잡으면 안 되지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Hmmm, reproductive organs."
msgstr "음, 생식기네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "I wonder how they breed?"
msgstr "어떻게 번식하는지 궁금하네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "There's more of it below than above!"
msgstr "위보다 아래쪽에 더 많아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "A tiny horror waiting in the mud."
msgstr "작지만 무시무시한 무언가가 진흙 안에서 기다리고 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "It appears to be all connected somehow."
msgstr "어째 전부 서로 연결된 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It appears to have expended its energy, but I cannot say for how long."
msgstr "기력을 다 쏟아부은 것 같아 보이지만, 얼마 동안 그랬는지는 모르겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "The nightmare fuel appears to have had an adverse affect on it."
msgstr "악몽 연료가 부정적인 영향을 미쳤던 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "What is the meaning of this?!"
msgstr "이게 무슨 뜻이지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "This is certainly not of this world. Curious."
msgstr "확실히 이 세계에 속한 것은 아니야. 궁금하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "It should remain inactive, as long as it's not disturbed."
msgstr "방해받지 않는 한 비활성화 상태를 유지하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "I believe it's storing up energy, but for what purpose?"
msgstr "에너지를 비축하는 중이겠지만 그걸 어디에 쓰지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "저런..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder how it came to be here."
msgstr "어떻게 여기까지 왔는지 궁금하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "That light is refracting rather unnaturally."
msgstr "빛이 좀 부자연스럽게 굴절되네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "This seems to be an interesting, ectoplasmic residue-bearing variety of zoisite."
msgstr "엑토플라즘 잔류물을 함유하는 흥미로운 지오사이트인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "Thulecite. An interesting choice."
msgstr "툴레사이트라, 흥미로운 선택이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "These could be combined to make a bigger piece."
msgstr "합쳐서 더 큰 조각을 만들 수 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "We were its intended recipient."
msgstr "우리가 목표였던 게 분명해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "He has left me to procure the kittens alone."
msgstr "내가 혼자 애옹이를 구하도록 내버려 두었어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Quite a wise feline."
msgstr "꽤 현명한 고양이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "The kitten was found before we arrived."
msgstr "우리가 도착하기 전에 누군가 애옹이를 찾아냈어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "I believe we're near."
msgstr "우리 가까이에 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "There is no clear evidence left to point us towards the kitten."
msgstr "애옹이가 있는 곳을 가리키는 명확한 증거는 남아 있지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "He encountered one of the kittens."
msgstr "애옹이 중 한 마리를 만났어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "The kittens are far enough away to hide their smell."
msgstr "애옹이들이 냄새를 숨길 수 있을 만큼 멀리 떨어져 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "He is guiding me to a kitten's hiding spot."
msgstr "애옹이가 숨은 곳으로 안내하고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "He is guiding someone else to a kitten's hiding spot."
msgstr "누군가를 애옹이가 숨은 곳으로 안내하고 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "What a nuisance!"
msgstr "정말 성가셔!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "The Tillweed's roots appear to have limited healing capabilities."
msgstr "엎을잡초의 뿌리는 치유력에 한계가 있는 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "It has formed a dangerous symbiotic relationship with fungal spores."
msgstr "버섯 포자와 위험한 공생 관계를 형성했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "The symbiotic bond between toad and fungus has reached its apex."
msgstr "두꺼비와 버섯 사이의 공생 유대가 정점에 도달했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "The soil has been disturbed here."
msgstr "이곳의 토양이 헤집어져 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "A new member of the Agaricus genus?"
msgstr "아가리쿠스 속의 새로운 종인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "The growth needs a catalyst to breach the surface."
msgstr "지면을 뚫고 자라려면 촉매가 필요한데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Fruit of Solanum lycopersicum."
msgstr "솔라눔 리코페르시쿰의 열매인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Roasted Solanum lycopersicum."
msgstr "구운 솔라눔 리코페르시쿰이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I always was quite good at growing tomatoes."
msgstr "항상 토마토를 잘 키웠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "심어야 자라겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "How bourgeois."
msgstr "부르주아 의류로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "It has been imbued with an ectoplasmic residue."
msgstr "엑토플라즘 잔류물에 물들었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "An improvised handheld light."
msgstr "조잡한 휴대 광원이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "A rather hearty meat pie."
msgstr "푸짐한 고기파이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "The path is open."
msgstr "길이 열렸네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It deconstructs the subject and reconstitutes them elsewhere."
msgstr "대상을 해체한 다음, 다른 곳에서 재구성하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "The bezoar's magic has been activated."
msgstr "위석의 마법이 작동하는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "A bezoar formed in the gut of a large beast."
msgstr "큰 짐승의 위장에서 형성된 위석이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Mmmm, natural!"
msgstr "오오, 천연 식품이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "All brawn and no brain, I'm afraid."
msgstr "안타깝지만 힘만 있고 두뇌가 모자라는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "This is quite advanced technology."
msgstr "꽤 첨단 기술로 보이는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "A simple stick-and-basket trap."
msgstr "막대와 바구니로 구성된 단순한 덫이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "Microscopic barbs on the thorns make them quite unpleasant."
msgstr "가시에 미세한 가시가 또 돋아 있어서 불쾌하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "It hunts similarly to Dionaea muscipula."
msgstr "끈끈이귀개과 파리지옥과 사냥 방식이 유사하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd be careful of that if I were you."
msgstr "내가 너라면 저걸 조심하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "It's covered with a thin film of canine digestive fluid."
msgstr "겉에 개의 소화액이 얇은 막을 형성하고 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "A crude attempt at tricking me."
msgstr "나를 속이려는 얕은 꾀로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "The charred skeleton of a storage chest."
msgstr "보관용 궤짝이 타고 남은 것입니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A storage chest."
msgstr "보관용 궤짝이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "A large storage chest."
msgstr "커다란 보관용 궤짝이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Looks suspicious..."
msgstr "수상쩍은데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "The flora grows thick here."
msgstr "이곳엔 식물이 무성하게 자라는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "This fig mixture appears to induce rapid arboreal growth."
msgstr "이 무화과 혼합물이 수목 성장이 빨라지게 하는 가봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "It produces quite literal sound waves!"
msgstr "문자 그대로 소리의 파도를 만들어내는군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "What a lovely set of bottle washers! Too bad they're all melted."
msgstr "멋진 병 세척 도구입니다! 안타깝지만 다 녹았습니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "I don't appreciate the insinuation, dear."
msgstr "괜히 기분이 나쁜데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Ah, it's a scale replica of that mischievous robot."
msgstr "그 심술궂은 로봇의 축소형 복제품이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "A muscular hydrostat that's been sat near something hygroscopic."
msgstr "흡습성 물체 근처에 방치된 근육형 유체로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little lady."
msgstr "묘하게 기분 좋고 낙관적인 분위기의 작은 여인상이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I think it's quite lovely, despite the cracks left by age..."
msgstr "세월의 풍파로 조금 깨지긴 했지만 예쁘네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "In medieval chess, this piece was called the elephant."
msgstr "중세시대엔 이 말이 코끼리라고 불렸는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "The groove in this piece symbolizes the bishop's ceremonial headwear."
msgstr "여기 난 홈은 비숍의 제식용 모자를 상징하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "This would be a practical eating utensil if it weren't bent."
msgstr "구부러지지 않았으면 유용한 식기가 될 수 있었을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Beware of Greeks bearing gifts."
msgstr "그리스인이 주는 선물은 경계해야 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "A good illustration of gyroscopic precession."
msgstr "회전 운동을 잘 보여주지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "A fake membranophone."
msgstr "가짜 막명 악기로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "An instrument of self-sufficiency."
msgstr "자급자족을 위한 도구네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "I have an excellent meringue recipe."
msgstr "정말 맛있는 머랭 레시피 아는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "My grandmother used to knit."
msgstr "우리 할머니가 뜨개질을 하셨었는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "It reminds me of home."
msgstr "고향이 생각나네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "What a positively adorable kitty cat. Sigh."
msgstr "정말 귀여운 냥이네. 하아아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "What an unpleasant scent."
msgstr "참으로 불쾌한 향이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "It appears to be a primitive cup fashioned from a tuber."
msgstr "덩이줄기로 만든 원시적인 잔이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I miss the comforts of home."
msgstr "안락한 집이 그립네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It was once called the \"tower\", long ago."
msgstr "한때는 탑이라고 불렸는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "Calling it a \"castle\" is plainly incorrect."
msgstr "이걸 성이라고 부르는 건 시대적인 오류지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Oh, I just love the bard."
msgstr "음유시인의 낭만을 좋아하는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "Knights are better pieces when they're active in the center."
msgstr "기사는 중앙에서 활동할 때 제일 효과적이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "In German it is referred to as the \"springer\"."
msgstr "독일어로는 \"스프링어\"라고 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "Oh, I got my hopes up for a nice crystal ball."
msgstr "어머, 내가 전부터 멋진 수정 구슬에 대한 로망이 있었는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "A decorative arachnid adornment! How darling!"
msgstr "거미류 장식품이네! 정말 귀엽군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "The paw grants three wishes, with terribly ironic results. So the story goes."
msgstr "앞발은 세 가지 소원을 들어주되, 아이러니한 방법으로 들어준다고 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Odorless. I believe it may have been sugar water."
msgstr "아무 냄새가 안 나네. 그냥 설탕물이었을 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Dunk those in boiling water before wearing them, dear."
msgstr "착용하기 전에 끓는 물에 담그는 게 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Luckily it is much too brittle to inflict any real damage."
msgstr "다행히도 공격에 쓰이기 전에 먼저 부서질 것 같군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "This simply does not work right."
msgstr "제대로 작동하지 않는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "It appears to be an abandoned glove."
msgstr "버려진 장갑인 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "What a positively, delightfully odd little fellow."
msgstr "묘하게 기분 좋고 낙관적인 분위기의 작은 인물상이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "What a cute little mollusk shaped scale!"
msgstr "귀여운 연체동물 모양의 저울이로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "This does not seem like it came from this world."
msgstr "이 세계의 물건 같지는 않은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "Goodness, it seems quite wistful."
msgstr "어머나, 꼭 우수에 젖어 있는 것처럼 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Perhaps I ought to save it for Webber."
msgstr "가지고 있다가 웨버에게 주면 좋을 지도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "A waste of a unique flora specimen."
msgstr "독특한 식물 표본이 아깝게 되었네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "What a curious device!"
msgstr "참으로 기묘한 장치야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "What an odd contraption."
msgstr "정말 이상한 장치인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "This spacecraft looks to have inadequate thermal controls."
msgstr "열 통제 기능이 별로인 우주선 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "I do hope WX-78 is feeling alright."
msgstr "WX-78의 상태가 괜찮아야 할 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "I think I'll keep this. I know someone who might like it."
msgstr "이건 갖고 있는 게 좋겠다. 좋아할 만한 사람이 있으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "It reminds me of my bathtub. I could use a long soak."
msgstr "집에 있는 욕조가 생각나네. 오랫동안 물에 몸을 담그고 싶은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "What a coincidence. My cardigan is missing a button!"
msgstr "마침 잘 됐네. 마침 내 가디건에서 단추가 하나 떨어졌는데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "My, I don't think it's supposed to do that."
msgstr "이런, 원래는 저렇지 않은 것 같은데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "저런..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "A place to display only the largest aquatic specimens."
msgstr "가장 큰 해양 생물만을 전시하는 장소로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n잡은 사람: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nQuite the accomplishment!"
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n잡은 사람: {owner}\n대단한 업적이군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nOh ho! I seem to be the victor!"
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n잡은 사람: {owner}\n호호! 내가 우승한 것 같군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nFishing is really quite easy, isn't it?"
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n잡은 사람: {owner}\n낚시는 참 쉬워. 그렇지 않아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "Oh dear..."
msgstr "저런..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "I'm afraid that's that."
msgstr "이게 끝이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "I suppose I must put my gardening prowess to the test!"
msgstr "내 정원 가꾸기 솜씨를 시험해 봐야 할 것 같아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nA very respectable harvest."
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n심은 후 {day}째 날에 수확\n꽤 부끄럽지 않을 정도로는 거둬들였어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nMy, quite the accomplishment!"
msgstr "무게: {weight}\n심은 후 {day}째 날에 수확\n결실이 꽤 많아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "I'm afraid the weight of this bit of produce is too small to tabulate."
msgstr "무게가 너무 가벼워서 표로 만들 수 없군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Durable outerwear."
msgstr "내구성이 뛰어난 외투야"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "Ample protection against the elements."
msgstr "기후에 충분히 대비하기 위한 옷가지야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "Unpalatable, but high in protein."
msgstr "딱히 구미가 당기진 않지만 단백질 함량이 높지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "A utilitarian proboscis."
msgstr "쓸모가 많은 코로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "A specimen of leather and fur."
msgstr "가죽과 털을 갖춘 표본이군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "A dried collection of plant matter."
msgstr "건조한 식물로 구성되었군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION"
msgid "I surmise this was a crucial part of ancient farming methods."
msgstr "고대 농법의 중요한 부분이었으리라 생각해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE"
msgid "The ground. You step on it."
msgstr "지면이지. 발로 디디는 곳이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "The ground. You step on it."
msgstr "지면이지. 발로 디디는 곳이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG"
msgid "Oh my..."
msgstr "세상에..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR"
msgid "The ground. You step on it."
msgstr "지면이지. 발로 디디는 곳이야."

