msgstr "구운 브라시카 라파지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "It can't begin growing until it's been planted, dear."
msgstr "심어야 자라겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS"
msgid "Best steer clear of those spikes, dear."
msgstr "저 가시는 멀리하는 게 좋겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING"
msgid "The tree is burning."
msgstr "나무가 불타고 있는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT"
msgid "A carbonized tree."
msgstr "탄화된 나무인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It has been harvested."
msgstr "이미 수확이 끝난 상태인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "It's afflicted with an agrarian disease beyond my curing."
msgstr "내가 치료할 수 없는 식물병에 걸렸어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "This species yields lumber and pliable sprigs. Useful."
msgstr "목재와 유연한 가지를 모두 얻을 수 있는 나무로군. 아주 유용해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "Seeds encased in a mature strobilus."
msgstr "성숙한 솔방울 안에 종자가 들어있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "It is fast growing into a fine young tree."
msgstr "튼튼한 묘목으로 빠르게 자라나고 있네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "It would be a waste of time and resources to chop that old thing."
msgstr "저 고목을 자르는 건 공연한 시간과 자원의 낭비라고 보는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "Some small twigs."
msgstr "작은 잔가지로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1"
msgid "How curious, I wonder who might have constructed such a thing?"
msgstr "정말 궁금해, 누가 그런 것을 만들었을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2"
msgid "How curious, I wonder who might have constructed such a thing?"
msgstr "정말 궁금해, 누가 그런 것을 만들었을까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "A simple apparatus for keeping dry."
msgstr "젖지 않게 해주는 간단한 기구인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "A common way to prepare eel."
msgstr "장어를 요리하는 일반적인 방법이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It's under construction."
msgstr "공사 중인데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET"
msgid "A healthy, balanced breakfast."
msgstr "몸에 좋고 균형 잡힌 아침 식사군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "How terrible to see it all go to waste!"
msgstr "모든 것이 쓰레기가 되는 것을 보는 건 정말 끔찍해!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER"
msgid "It's quite piquant."
msgstr "제법 톡 쏘는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Ah, this style does take me back..."
msgstr "아, 이 스타일은 과거로 돌아가게 하네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "This unusual fabric may be quite useful."
msgstr "이 특이한 천은 꽤 쓸모있을지도 모르겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT"
msgid "Prolonged use will surely have detrimental effects on the mind."
msgstr "장기간 사용하면 분명 정신에 부정적 영향을 미칠 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG"
msgid "This particular projectile gains strength with distance before returning to origin."
msgstr "이 투사체는 멀어질수록 강해진 다음 원래 위치로 돌아오는군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT"
msgid "Now that I'm familiar with the material, it's a simple matter to repair it."
msgstr "이제 재료에 익숙해졌으니 수리하는 건 간단하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE"
msgid "A common harvesting implement, with an admittedly unsettling appearance."
msgstr "흔한 수확 도구지만, 생김새는 누가 봐도 불길하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA"
msgid "It provides a useful barrier against acid droplets."
msgstr "산성비를 막아주는 유용한 도구지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY"
msgid "His ingenuity with limited materials is very impressive."
msgstr "한정된 재료로 창의성을 발휘하다니 대단하군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "Salutations, waffles."
msgstr "와플이라니, 반가워라."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
