msgstr "바보 새. 일어나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
