msgstr "왜 실패한 거지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC"
msgid "A big gross mushroom! Burn it!"
msgstr "크고 징그러운 버섯이다! 태워야겠는걸!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT"
msgid "Mold problem's taken care of."
msgstr "곰팡이 문제 해결인걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY"
