msgstr "아주 잘 먹었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
