msgstr "우와, 내가 만든 버전보다 진보된 기술이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_ENGINEERING_CAN_SIDEGRADE"
