msgstr "내 버전에 비하면 구닥다리야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK"
