#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "What a bunch of slackers!"
msgstr "이런 게으름뱅이들!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like he thinks he's the boss around here."
msgstr "자기가 대장이라고 생각하는 모양이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "The foundation doesn't look very stable."
msgstr "기반이 불안정해 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "There's no way they've got a permit for that."
msgstr "저런 거에 건축 허가가 나왔다고?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "Now that's some claws for alarm. Ha!"
msgstr "무시무시한 집게다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "Heh. I think this guy's tryin' to ice me out!"
msgstr "헤. 쌀쌀맞기도 하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "Just a hired hand. Er, claw."
msgstr "일손... 아니, \"일집게\"를 고용했군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "I've had supervisors crabbier than him."
msgstr "저 녀석보다 \"게팍한\" 상사 밑에서도 일해 봤어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "Come on out, don't be shy."
msgstr "나와라, 부끄러워하지 말고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "You're pretty swell, for a tiny monstrosity."
msgstr "작은 몬스터치곤 너 꽤 멋지다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "I spy with my little guy..."
msgstr "꼭꼭 숨어라 머리카락 보일라..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "You're pretty cute for a giant bug, hey?"
msgstr "거대한 벌레치곤 너 꽤 귀엽다?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "I'm going to spoil you rotten."
msgstr "널 무진장 귀여워해주겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "You're just a fluffball on legs!"
msgstr "다리 달린 털북숭이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "You sure are fragile, aren'tcha lil fella?"
msgstr "너 정말 약하구나, 그렇지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "Hey there, feathers."
msgstr "안녕, 깃털뭉치야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Pups love you no matter who you are."
msgstr "네가 어떤 존재라도 상관없어. 넌 귀여우니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks a bit flighty. Ha!"
msgstr "나는 짐승 같군. 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "Hauling you around is murder on the feet! Ha!"
msgstr "넌 무거워서 들고 다녔다간 체력이 금방 동나겠구나! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "A trail of crumbs to follow!"
msgstr "부스러기를 따라가자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "Charm bracelets were never really my thing."
msgstr "장식 달린 팔찌는 내 취향이 아니야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "A fire waiting to happen."
msgstr "언제라도 불이 날 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "Looks more like a toy than a sword."
msgstr "검이라기보다는 장난감 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Not to my lichen. Ha!"
msgstr "이에 끼는 이끼다. 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Doesn't hold a candle to steel pipe."
msgstr "쇠파이프에 비하면 아무것도 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Prepped and ready for the assembly line."
msgstr "이제 조립 라인에 들어갈 준비가 다 됐다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Yeesh big guy, I was just tryin' to help you out!"
msgstr "이봐, 덩치. 나는 그저 도와주려던 거야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "That pig's seen better days."
msgstr "저 돼지는 오늘 일진이 안 좋아 보이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "He sure is in a sorry state."
msgstr "참 딱한 처지네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "He seems to be minding his own business."
msgstr "그냥 자기 할 일을 하고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "Take it easy, big boy!"
msgstr "진정해, 덩치 큰 친구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "I stand corrected. That rock ain't goin' nowhere."
msgstr "내 생각이 틀렸어. 저 바위는 꿈쩍도 안 할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "That marble doesn't look structurally sound to me."
msgstr "저 대리석은 구조적으로 불안정해 보이는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "Food poisoning and a half."
msgstr "식중독에 걸릴 확률이 150%다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "They're picked clean dry."
msgstr "깨끗하게 발라서 말렸다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "That's an impressive blaze."
msgstr "대단한 불길이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Completely charred."
msgstr "완전히 탔다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Done and done."
msgstr "끝장났다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Another tree."
msgstr "또 다른 나무다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "Why does a tree need a mouth?!"
msgstr "왜 나무에 입이 있지?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Remember when you'd always knock down my house of cards?"
msgstr "네가 매번 내 카드 집을 무너뜨리던 것 기억나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "Looks like some frou-frou clutter to me."
msgstr "고상한 척하는 잡동사니 같아 보이는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "Looks nice enough, but it feels kinda empty."
msgstr "보기 좋긴 한데, 조금 휑한 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "It ain't a lamp, but it'll work."
msgstr "램프는 아니지만 충분하겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "Lookin' fresh as a daisy!"
msgstr "데이지만큼 상큼해 보이네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "That's not gonna last much longer."
msgstr "별로 오래 가지 않을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "I think it's time to retire this one."
msgstr "이건 치워야 할 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "A good lamp will keep ya workin' through the night!"
msgstr "좋은 램프가 있으면 밤새도록 일할 수도 있지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "One of them highbrow \"still life\" pieces, huh?"
msgstr "이것도 그 고상하신 \"정물화\" 작품인가 보네?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "That frame looks kinda plain with nothin' in it."
msgstr "저 액자는 아무것도 안 들어 있어서 조금 밋밋해 보여."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "It's a pretty good likeness."
msgstr "꽤 닮았네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Looks like she has a new addition."
msgstr "뭔가가 추가된 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "A bouncy fluffster."
msgstr "통통 튀는 모피다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Don't even think about it, you dumb lug!"
msgstr "꿈도 꾸지 마라, 이 덜 떨어진 덩치야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "There's no comin' back from that."
msgstr "이제는 살아날 수 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "She's the deerly departed."
msgstr "잘 가, 사슴."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "That just ain't right."
msgstr "이건 뭔가 잘못됐잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "That is one creepy refrigeration unit."
msgstr "참 오싹한 냉장 장치야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "It needs that spooky ol' eye to work."
msgstr "작동하려면 그 소름 끼치는 눈알이 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "Time to roll up the ol' sleeves!"
msgstr "소매를 걷어붙일 시간이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "You lookin' at me? Are YOU lookin' at ME?"
msgstr "뭘 보냐? 날 보냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with this?"
msgstr "이걸로 뭘 할 수 있다는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "Looks dangerous!"
msgstr "위험해 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "It's closed for business."
msgstr "영업 중지 상태다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Helps you see, see?"
msgstr "시력에 도움이 된다니까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL"
msgid "What an incredible tool!"
msgstr "굉장한 도구다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV"
msgid "Lazy builders."
msgstr "게으른 직원들 같으니."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Time to get my hands dirty."
msgstr "손에 흙을 묻힐 때가 되었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "S'not picking anything up."
msgstr "아무 반응이 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm probably one of the few left that knows how to use these."
msgstr "이걸 쓸 수 있는 사람은 이제 나 말고 별로 없겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "I'm sitting right on top of... something."
msgstr "내 밑에... 뭔가가 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "It's getting something."
msgstr "뭔가 반응이 온다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Gonna hit paydirt any second now."
msgstr "금방 잡힐 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "Just like in the bossman's workshop."
msgstr "꼭 작업반장의 작업실 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "I guess it wants the Voxola?"
msgstr "복솔라를 원하는 걸까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "At least I assembled it right."
msgstr "적어도 제대로 조립은 됐다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "That's a Voxola! What's it doing here?"
msgstr "복솔라 제품이다! 이게 왜 여기에 있는 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "Leave the dock buildin' to me."
msgstr "부두 건설은 내게 맡겨두라고."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "I don't like seeing \"spare\" parts lyin' around..."
msgstr "다 만들었는데 왜 부품이 남았지? 불길한데..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "That's a lot of ruffles to sew on..."
msgstr "꿰매어야 할 프릴이 너무 많아..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "It's not gonna build itself."
msgstr "저절로 만들어지지는 않을 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "This baby's got everything you need!"
msgstr "필요한 게 전부 담겨 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "It's the beast's tummy!"
msgstr "짐승의 몸통이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "Can't believe Warly's got me eatin' salads."
msgstr "왈리가 나한테 샐러드를 먹인다니, 믿을 수가 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "Get a load of this flying welding torch!"
msgstr "비행 용접기다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "For the snootiest of snoots."
msgstr "아주 화려한 궤짝이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Snooty, but durable."
msgstr "너무 거창하지만, 튼튼하긴 해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty fancy for a heater."
msgstr "히터치곤 고급스럽다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED"
msgid "We oughta fix that."
msgstr "고쳐야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH"
msgid "That's a proper furnace."
msgstr "제대로 된 화로다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL"
msgid "Could use a bit more kick."
msgstr "화력이 더 세면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "Snooty fruit."
msgstr "화려한 과일이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked the snoot right out of it."
msgstr "익히니까 화려한 느낌이 다 사라졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "We'll be eating this stuff for days!"
msgstr "며칠 동안은 먹겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "씨앗 한 줌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT"
msgid "Front and center!"
msgstr "앞면과 가운뎃부분이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE"
msgid "Where's the beef?"
msgstr "소고기는 어딨지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT"
msgid "That's the business end."
msgstr "이 부분이 제일 중요하지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES"
msgid "Showy."
msgstr "매우 화려하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE"
msgid "It's evil-lookin', but tough as nails."
msgstr "사악해 보이지만, 무지 튼튼해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT"
msgid "Lookin' sharp! Literally."
msgstr "예리해 보이는걸! 말 그대로 말이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK"
msgid "Must be a lot of the stuff growing down there."
msgstr "저 아래에 이런 게 잔뜩 자라는 모양이네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG"
msgid "Oof. Kitschy."
msgstr "흠. 투박하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Yeesh, that thing's on fire!"
msgstr "이런, 불이 붙었다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Looks like there was an accident here."
msgstr "여기서 사고가 일어난 모양이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Wonder if driftwood's a good buildin' material?"
msgstr "유목은 좋은 건축 재료일까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC"
msgid "This tree's seen better days."
msgstr "나무가 많이 시들었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK"
msgid "Can't say a raw drumstick sounds too appealing."
msgstr "익히지 않은 닭다리는 별로 먹고 싶지 않다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED"
msgid "Can't be beat."
msgstr "최고의 음식이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH"
msgid "Sure beats goin' down to the caves."
msgstr "동굴로 들어가는 것보다는 훨씬 낫네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "I love getting my hands dirty."
msgstr "손에 흙을 묻히는 게 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY"
msgid "I'll replant that if no one else wants to."
msgstr "아무도 원하지 않으면 내가 다시 심어야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS"
msgid "Looks like some gardening's in order."
msgstr "조경 작업이 좀 필요한 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "Well it's not gonna replant itself."
msgstr "저절로 심어지는 일은 없으니까."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL"
msgid "Those are some tall tails, I tell ya!"
msgstr "꼬리 참 기네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING"
msgid "Needs replanting."
msgstr "다시 심어야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH"
msgid "Can't fool me, ha!"
msgstr "난 못 속이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL"
msgid "Why not do some real work instead of just liftin' these things?"
msgstr "그저 들어 올리는 대신 실제로 일을 하는 건 어때?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM"
msgid "Better get some ice on that!"
msgstr "누가 저기 얼음 좀 올려 놔!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM"
msgid "Awful fancy for something you just pick up and put down over and over."
msgstr "반복해서 들었다 내려놨다 하는 일에 끔찍한 환상이 있나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN"
msgid "Awful fancy for something you just pick up and put down over and over."
msgstr "반복해서 들었다 내려놨다 하는 일에 끔찍한 환상이 있나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT"
msgid "Is that what he uses for a warm-up?"
msgstr "이걸로 몸을 푸는 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE"
msgid "Awful fancy for something you just pick up and put down over and over."
msgstr "반복해서 들었다 내려놨다 하는 일에 끔찍한 환상이 있나 봐."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM"
msgid "You'll really be feelin' the burn! Ha!"
msgstr "저걸로 운동하면 후끈하겠는데! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN"
msgid "Powerful stench! I respect that."
msgstr "고약한 악취로군! 장난이 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Whew! That'll put some hair on your hair."
msgstr "휴! 이렇게 지독한 악취는 처음이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It sure is making a big stink."
msgstr "확실히 심한 악취가 풍겨."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "씨앗 한 줌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE"
msgid "Ugh. Maybe one of those little moth guys will clean this mess up."
msgstr "윽. 저 조그마한 나방 녀석 중 하나가 이 난장판을 치울 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH"
msgid "Quite the tenacious little worker."
msgstr "꽤 끈기있고 귀여운 일꾼이거든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN"
msgid "Sorry little fellas, but you've got some material I need."
msgstr "작은 친구들에게 미안하지만 필요한 재료가 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT"
msgid "I hate cold weather."
msgstr "추운 날씨는 싫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EEL"
msgid "You're looking a little eel. Ha!"
msgstr "장하다, 장어. 훗!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED"
msgid "I'll eat anything once."
msgstr "뭐든 한 번은 먹어보겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT"
msgid "Look how weird it is! Ha!"
msgstr "정말 이상하게 생겼네! 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED"
msgid "Did that make it better? I don't know."
msgstr "익혀서 맛이 더 좋아졌나? 모르겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "It sure makes a big impression. Ha!"
msgstr "깊은 인상을 줄 게 분명해. 하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "씨앗 한 줌이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "Ain't no picnic for the livin' round here."
msgstr "이곳에서 살아가는 건 쉽지 않지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT"
msgid "Nice and toasty."
msgstr "따뜻하잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "That's a shame."
msgstr "안타깝다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "Sturdily built."
msgstr "튼튼하게 만들었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "I miss lamps."
msgstr "램프가 있었으면 좋았을 텐데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Pretty sure this one won't move."
msgstr "이건 안 움직이겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "That's not gonna last much longer."
msgstr "별로 오래 가지 않을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED"
msgid "That bouquet's seen better days."
msgstr "이젠 시들어 보잘 것 없어진 꽃다발이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING"
msgid "That's an impressive blaze."
msgstr "대단한 불길이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT"
msgid "Completely charred."
msgstr "완전히 탔다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "As long as the job's done."
msgstr "일만 제대로 끝냈다면야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a tree."
msgstr "평범한 나무다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING"
msgid "Impressive blaze."
msgstr "대단한 불길이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
msgid "Completely charred."
msgstr "완전히 탔다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Glad that's over with."
msgstr "다 끝내서 다행이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Yep. Definitely a tree."
msgstr "음. 나무가 확실하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "Nice and dry underneath."
msgstr "이 아래에 있으면 뽀송뽀송하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "Guess I'll really be seein' the world through different eyes."
msgstr "정말 다른 눈으로 세상을 보게 될 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Yeesh, what an eyesore."
msgstr "으윽, 눈에 거슬린다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "Can't fault them for doing their job with the big overseer right there."
msgstr "바로 거기서 거대한 감독관과 함께 일을 하고 있다고 해서 비난할 수는 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "You'd think I'd be used to this kind of thing by now."
msgstr "지금쯤이면 이런 일에 익숙해졌을 거라고 생각하겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "Y'know? I'm not even gonna ask."
msgstr "글쎄? 물어보기도 싫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "That's a fine piece of work."
msgstr "훌륭한 작업물이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "Lemme assemble it."
msgstr "내가 조립하겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "I hate seeing hard work wasted."
msgstr "노력이 헛수고가 되는 건 보기 괴롭다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "You reap whatcha sow."
msgstr "뿌린 대로 거둔다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Our hard work is paying off."
msgstr "힘든 농사의 결실이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "It needs a bit of a kick."
msgstr "도움이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "Let's get to planting, then!"
msgstr "그럼 심자!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "Not the crops!"
msgstr "작물이 아니네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Time to harvest!"
msgstr "수확할 시간이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Woo-wee, that's a big one!"
msgstr "와아, 정말 크다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "Looks like I'd better get to weeding."
msgstr "잡초를 뽑는게 나을 것 같아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "A plant."
msgstr "식물이로군."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "Seems to be coming along."
msgstr "따라오는 것 같네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "Should've picked it sooner."
msgstr "더 빨리 뽑아야 했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Such a waste."
msgstr "정말 아깝네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "It has a lot of work ahead of it."
msgstr "앞으로 할 일이 많아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "Now that's handy!"
msgstr "이제 편하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "This gizmo will get us gardening in no time flat!"
msgstr "이 장치를 사용하면 순식간에 정원을 가꿀 수 있어!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "Let's clear out that clutter."
msgstr "어수선한 걸 치우자."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "Too fancy."
msgstr "너무 고급스럽다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "Well la-dee-da."
msgstr "아주 요란하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "I've got ugly handwriting."
msgstr "나는 매우 악필이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "That's not a good sign."
msgstr "좋은 징조가 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "Not a whole lotta use for that."
msgstr "쓸모가 별로 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "Kinda useless. Looks nice, anyway."
msgstr "딱히 쓸모는 없다. 보기에는 훌륭하지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "If only I had a cap to put it in."
msgstr "이걸 꽂을 모자가 있었으면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She doesn't look none too happy."
msgstr "별로 행복해 보이지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "A clearly handmade fence."
msgstr "손으로 뚝딱 만든 게 분명한 울타리다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "A clearly handmade gate."
msgstr "분명히 손으로 뚝딱 만든 문이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "Just gotta assemble it now."
msgstr "이제 조립하면 된다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "Just needs to be assembled."
msgstr "조립만 하면 된다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "It does the trick."
msgstr "제 역할은 다해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "There's a right tool for every job."
msgstr "일마다 적합한 도구가 있기 마련이지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "Plants can't get enough."
msgstr "식물이 좋아하는 거다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr "좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Sure is a cheery looking design!"
msgstr "확실히 발랄해 보이는 디자인이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "Never tried one back home, seemed too fancy-shmancy for me."
msgstr "집에서 한 번도 해본 적이 없었어. 지나치게 어수선할 것 같았거든."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "Gotta say, that's good eatin'!"
msgstr "잘 먹었다고 해야하나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "Just the kind of thing you'd want on your lunch break."
msgstr "점심시간에 딱 맞는 그런 거지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "A bit hoity-toity, but I've gotta admit it's pretty tasty."
msgstr "약간 거만한 느낌이긴 하지만 꽤 맛있다고 해야겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "Doesn't look too hard to operate."
msgstr "작동하기 어려워 보이지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Lucky firecrackers!"
msgstr "행운의 폭죽이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "Natural light, huh? Might be useful."
msgstr "천연 조명인가? 쓸 데가 있을지도 모르겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "I could think of a couple uses for these babies."
msgstr "어떻게 쓰면 좋을지 몇 가지 생각이 나긴 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "Get outta here, bucko!"
msgstr "나가라, 똥개야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "Definitely a workplace hazard."
msgstr "확실히 작업장의 위험 요소야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "Yeesh, that pen's piping hot!"
msgstr "으윽, 그 펜 엄청 뜨겁네!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "On its last legs."
msgstr "거의 다 꺼졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "It's the pits out here."
msgstr "불구덩이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "Properly roaring."
msgstr "활활 피어 오른다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "It's gonna go out soon."
msgstr "곧 꺼진다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "About as cozy as it gets out here."
msgstr "이 정도면 제법 포근하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "My sister was afraid of the dark."
msgstr "내 여동생은 어둠을 무서워했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "This \"magic\" stuff's a safety hazard."
msgstr "이 '마법'의 힘은 안전 위해 요소이기도 하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Needs a top up."
msgstr "연료 보충이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "We should mass produce these things."
msgstr "이건 대량 생산해야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Witness the efficiency of the future!"
msgstr "이것이 미래의 효율이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "I'd rather eat for a day than not at all."
msgstr "아무것도 안 먹는 것보단 하루라도 먹는 것이 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "Seems a bit unfair to the fish."
msgstr "물고기에게는 불공평한 일이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "Not a bad way to unwind."
msgstr "좋은 휴식 방법이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "Is it safe to eat like that?"
msgstr "이 상태로 먹어도 안전하나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Nothing fancy, just how I like it."
msgstr "고급 음식은 아니군. 마음에 꼭 든다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "You sure that's fish? Looks pretty shrimpy to me."
msgstr "생선 맞아? 꼭 새우 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "I won't turn down a bite!"
msgstr "음식을 거절할 수는 없지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "I've never seen a fish this shape before."
msgstr "이런 모양의 물고기는 처음 본다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "That's some good eating."
msgstr "맛이 제법 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "Now there's a nice practical way to store fish!"
msgstr "이거야말로 생선을 보관하는 실용적인 물건이로군!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "I hate picking bones outta my teeth."
msgstr "이 사이에서 가시를 빼는 건 성가시다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "So archaic..."
msgstr "원시적인 도구다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "Sure beats drownin'."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit cutesy."
msgstr "꽤 귀엽다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Not sure how to feel about that..."
msgstr "이걸 보고 뭘 느껴야 하는지 모르겠다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "For getting dolled up."
msgstr "에쁘게 차려입을 때 쓰는 거다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "I guess a bunch of petals count as food."
msgstr "꽃잎을 모아 놓고 음식이라고 부를 수도 있구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "Woah! It doesn't even need electricity!"
msgstr "와! 전기도 필요 없다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "I think I'll steer clear of that."
msgstr "이건 가까이 가지 말아야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "That's how I feel after a long shift."
msgstr "오래 일하고 나면 나도 저렇게 된다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Just a bunch of leaves."
msgstr "나뭇잎을 잔뜩 모은 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Gotta protect the assets."
msgstr "자산을 보호해 준다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "I'm not one for flowers, especially when they crowd out my hard working crops!"
msgstr "나는 꽃을 좋아하지 않아. 특히 꽃이 열심히 자라는 농작물을 밀어낼 때는 말이지!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "That's a pretty fancy thing to put on a big shaggy beast."
msgstr "거대하고 텁수룩한 짐승으로 꾸미는 건 꽤 재미있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "No bones about it, that's a fossil. Ha!"
msgstr "뼈 없는 화석이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "What is this a skeleton of?!"
msgstr "이건 무엇의 해골일까?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "That was not assembled correctly."
msgstr "제대로 조립되지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "Some more assembly required."
msgstr "조립을 더 해야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Fruit wrapped in a blanket of pancake."
msgstr "팬케이크 담요로 감싼 과일이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "Now this one's a good little worker!"
msgstr "이제 이건 훌륭하고 귀여운 일꾼이야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "It croaked."
msgstr "꼴깍 죽었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "Yep! That's a frog."
msgstr "그래! 개구리다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "Shouldn't you be off hopping or something?"
msgstr "폴짝 뛰어다니지 않고 뭐 하니?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "Mmm! Love Warly's dishes."
msgstr "으음! 왈리 음식은 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "It's really not as bad as it looks."
msgstr "의외로 보기보다 나쁘지 않다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "Not glamorous, but I'll eat it."
msgstr "딱히 좋아 보이진 않지만 먹어야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Them's good eats."
msgstr "제법 맛있는 요리다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "Surprisingly tasty."
msgstr "놀랍게도 맛있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "Perfect after a long day of work."
msgstr "기나긴 하루 일과 후에 완벽한 마무리야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "You play nice with the other lizards now, hey?"
msgstr "이제 다른 도마뱀 친구들이랑 사이좋게 지낼 거지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "Lookit you, all orange!"
msgstr "이것 좀 봐, 주황색이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "I hope you earned that break."
msgstr "너는 쉴 자격이 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Get outta here! Shoo!"
msgstr "저리 가! 훠이!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "Now I'm the boss!"
msgstr "이제 내가 보스야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "Gotta get those vitamins, I guess."
msgstr "비타민을 보충하기 위해 먹어야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Wouldn't mind lining my workboots with this stuff."
msgstr "이걸 작업화 안쪽에 붙이면 좋겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "I don't like the look of those chompers."
msgstr "저 이빨들 생긴 게 마음에 안 드네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "Watch out, it's gonna blow!"
msgstr "조심해, 터진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "Something scare ya? You look petrified!"
msgstr "겁이라도 먹었나? 돌처럼 굳었잖아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "At least it's not trying to kill us now."
msgstr "그래도 지금 우릴 죽이려고 하지 않으니 다행이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Makes everything taste better."
msgstr "무엇이든 더 맛있게 해준다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "Bet that brought out the flavor."
msgstr "익히니까 풍미가 더 살아났다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'm not scared of a bit of garlic breath."
msgstr "마늘 냄새가 좀 나는 건 두렵지 않아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "I got no idea what they'd grow into."
msgstr "이게 자라면 뭐가 될지 전혀 모르겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "I'd never turn down grub!"
msgstr "음식은 거절하지 않는다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "I'm a bit homesick."
msgstr "향수병이 느껴진다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "That ain't no engine grease I ever seen."
msgstr "저런 엔진 오일은 처음 보는걸."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "Someone's in tough spot."
msgstr "누가 곤경에 처했어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Looks like somethin's caught inside."
msgstr "뭔가 안에 갇힌 모양이야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "We can take it to go!"
msgstr "포장이요!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "And just like that, I ain't hungry no more."
msgstr "식욕이 뚝 떨어지네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "At least we found some use for that muck."
msgstr "적어도 저 역겨운 걸 쓸 곳은 찾았어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "Guess I should put'er together."
msgstr "이제 조립해야겠지."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "Still gotta tinker with it a bit."
msgstr "좀 더 작업이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
