msgstr "그 뿔, 치료받아야겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
