msgstr "으윽, 음... 착한 고래인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "I'm sure I can use this for somethin."
msgstr "쓸모가 있을 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "I'm a growing gal, you know!"
msgstr "난 아직도 성장하는 중이라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "I hate fashion."
msgstr "나는 패션이 싫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "A shiny way to cut stuff down."
msgstr "찬란하게 사물을 절단할 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "A shiny way to smash up rocks."
msgstr "찬란하게 돌을 부술 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "I mean why not, hey?"
msgstr "뭐, 나쁠 건 없잖아?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "A little too snazzy for my taste."
msgstr "나에겐 너무 화려하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "Awfully ritzy for yard work."
msgstr "마당 일을 하기에는 너무 화려해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Gold! What a prospect."
msgstr "금이군! 굉장한 발견이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "I could think of one or two uses for that, tops."
msgstr "이걸 사용할 만한 방법이 한두 가지밖에 생각이 안 난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "Needs a little boost."
msgstr "약간의 도움이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "Grass fire!"
msgstr "풀에 불났다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "You should see a doctor."
msgstr "의사의 진찰이 필요한 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "Not lookin' too lush."
msgstr "싱싱해 보이지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "That's some tall grass."
msgstr "높이 자란 풀이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "It's on break."
msgstr "휴식 중이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "It couldn't stand the heat."
msgstr "더위를 견디지 못했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "How can he see anything like that?"
msgstr "어떻게 그런 것을 볼 수 있지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "I didn't know lizards could wilt."
msgstr "도마뱀도 시들 줄은 몰랐다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that lizard made of grass?"
msgstr "풀로 만들어진 도마뱀인가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "Better than nothing."
msgstr "없는 것보다는 낫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Nobody's in there."
msgstr "안에 아무도 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It's occupied."
msgstr "가득 찼네."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
