msgstr "이거면 충분할 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
