msgstr "나쁘지 않은데!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "I can do some experimentin' with that."
msgstr "실험을 좀 할 수 있겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
