msgstr "너, 가위바위보 할 때 \"찌\"밖에 못 내지? 하하!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN"
