msgstr "유치하지만 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
