msgstr "석공의 솜씨가 엿보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN"
