msgstr "하! 틀렸다! 볼프강은 웃기다고 생각한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN"
msgid "Was little den holding whole boat together?"
msgstr "그 작은 둥지가 온 배를 지탱하던 건가?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS"
msgid "Little boat doesn't like deep water, is falling apart!"
msgstr "작은 배가 깊은 물 싫어한다. 부서진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PECKED"
msgid "What I do to deserve this?"
msgstr "내가 뭘 잘못했나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES"
msgid "Trees! Getting! STRONG!"
msgstr "힘이! 세진! 나무다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "Bah! Tiny plant is smell terrible!"
msgstr "윽! 작은 식물한테서 끔찍한 냄새가 난다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE"
msgid "Someone is music making?"
msgstr "누가 음악 만드나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED"
msgid "Will see what tiny seed grows into."
msgstr "작은 씨앗이 자라는 것을 보게 될 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1"
msgid "Plant learning is easy! Just need right hat!"
msgstr "식물에 대해 배우는 건 쉬워! 단지 제대로된 모자가 필요할 뿐이라고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL"
msgid "Ooooh, time tunnel make Wolfgang dizzy..."
msgstr "으악, 타임터널이 볼프강을 어지럽게 하네..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID"
msgid "The void hungers for sweet Wolfgang!"
msgstr "공허가 볼프강 먹으려 한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE"
