msgstr "볼프강 물이 돼 버린 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED"
