msgstr "볼프강 눈에 이상한 게 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1"
