msgstr "안녕! 볼프강이 지금 이야기할 거야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2"
msgid "You are doing well, yes?"
msgstr "잘 지내고 있는 거지, 그렇지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3"
