msgstr "볼프강은 털복숭이 친구를 따라가야 한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED"
