msgstr "아니! 빛이 없어졌구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT"
