msgstr "악! 볼프강을 놀래키지 마라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED"
