msgstr "볼프강 살아있어서 다행이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT"
msgid "Is too weak for race."
msgstr "경주 나가기에는 너무 약하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT"
