msgstr "아. 볼프강 대포알 깜빡했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
