msgstr "볼프강은 책 빛 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
