msgstr "큰 연못에 털 났다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
