msgstr "다 없어졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
