msgstr "탔구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "So sneaky!"
msgstr "몰래 다닐 수 있다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
