msgstr "맛이 나쁘다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
