msgstr "갈대 뭉치다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
