msgstr "바위를 부숴서 벽돌을 만들었다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "H-how about friendly game of arm wrestle, yes?"
msgstr "우, 우리 우정의 표시로 팔씨름이나 할까?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
