msgstr "카드 덱 절반으로 찢기는 볼프강의 전매특허 묘기다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "Tiny thing has no purpose. Is what makes it fancy."
msgstr "이 쪼끄만 것 쓸데없다. 그래서 고급인 거다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "Wolfgang will be careful not to break."
msgstr "볼프강 깨뜨리지 않게 조심한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
