msgstr "볼프강은 캄캄한 것이 싫다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
