msgstr "꺼지지 말아라, 작은 빛아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "Little flowers are weaker than usual."
msgstr "작은 꽃이 평소보다 약하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "Wolfgang likes little light."
msgstr "볼프강 작은 빛이 좋다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "Is art!"
msgstr "예술이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "Is picture of nothing!"
msgstr "공기 그림이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "Next draw Wolfgang's good side!"
msgstr "다음에는 볼프강의 잘생긴 쪽 그려라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Fuzzy fragile beast got mightier."
msgstr "약하고 부드러운 동물이 힘세졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "Not very mighty. More fragile."
msgstr "별로 힘세지 않다. 연약하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "He looks mightier than me!"
msgstr "나보다 힘세 보인다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
