msgstr "흥! 덩치 녀석, 이제는 안 세다. 잠깐, 죽은 것 맞지?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "No-no-no. This not what Wolfgang sign for."
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼. 볼프강은 이런 것 바라지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "Scary eye put chill in Wolfgang's spine."
msgstr "무시무시한 눈 때문에 볼프강 소름 돋는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "Okay, scary eye gone but now is too hot for Wolfgang."
msgstr "좋다, 무시무시한 눈 사라졌지만 볼프강한테 너무 더워졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "Is not ready! Wolfgang will fix this."
msgstr "준비가 안 됐다! 볼프강이 해결한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "Yuck yuck yuck!"
msgstr "우웩, 우웩, 우웩!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "Is only mighty part of fragile beast."
msgstr "연약한 짐승에서 유일하게 힘센 부분이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "You stand no chance in fight with Wolfgang!"
msgstr "볼프강과 싸우면 너는 못 이긴다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "Is tuft of grass."
msgstr "풀 뙈기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Sand cannot stop Wolfgang!"
