msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON"
msgid "Tiny spider will be crushed in Wolfgang's mighty jaws! Or maybe not."
msgstr "작은 거미는 볼프강의 턱에 박살날 거야! 아니면 아닐 수도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER"
msgid "Tiny spider will be crushed in Wolfgang's mighty jaws! Or maybe not."
msgstr "작은 거미는 볼프강의 턱에 박살날 거야! 아니면 아닐 수도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR"
msgid "Tiny spider will be crushed in Wolfgang's mighty jaws! Or maybe not."
msgstr "작은 거미는 볼프강의 턱에 박살날 거야! 아니면 아닐 수도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER"
msgid "Tiny spider will be crushed in Wolfgang's mighty jaws! Or maybe not."
msgstr "작은 거미는 볼프강의 턱에 박살날 거야! 아니면 아닐 수도."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Flowers would be good against cow smell."
msgstr "소 냄새에는 꽃이 좋아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT"
msgid "Is cozy sleeping hat."
msgstr "잠잘 때 쓰는 포근한 모자다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT"
msgid "Is strange glow."
msgstr "이상한 빛이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL"
msgid "Scary stuff."
msgstr "무서운 거다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH"
msgid "Wolfgang feels chill crawling up mighty spine..."
msgstr "볼프강은 거대한 척추가 스멀스멀 거리는 오한을 느낀다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT"
msgid "Is light, but not good light."
msgstr "빛이지만 좋은 빛이 아니다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE"
msgid "Wolfgang must eat with eyes closed."
msgstr "볼프강 눈 감고 먹어야 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM"
msgid "No bad light."
msgstr "나쁜 빛이 없다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN"
msgid "Good time is soon."
msgstr "좋은 시간이 곧 온다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC"
msgid "Is safe from bad light."
msgstr "나쁜 빛으로부터 안전하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY"
msgid "I think bad light not get stronger."
msgstr "나쁜 빛이 더 강해지지 않았다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING"
msgid "Bad light time is ending."
msgstr "나쁜 빛 시간이 끝난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN"
msgid "The bad light comes soon."
msgstr "나쁜 빛이 곧 온다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING"
msgid "The bad light is here and getting stronger."
msgstr "나쁜 빛이 와서 점점 강해진다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK"
msgid "Wolfgang like fists better."
msgstr "볼프강은 주먹을 더 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD"
msgid "Is real? Is not real? Is sharp!"
msgstr "진짜구나? 진짜 아니구나? 날카롭구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NITRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NITRE"
msgid "Is rock, but different."
msgstr "바위지만 다르다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION"
msgid "It grew from burny rain?"
msgstr "불타는 비에서 자랐나?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Fills Wolfgang's head with the plant know-hows!"
msgstr "볼프강은 식물 노하우를 배운다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR"
msgid "Wolfgang will be mighty rower!"
msgstr "볼프강 힘센 뱃사공 된다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD"
msgid "Oar feels so light in Wolfgang's mighty hands!"
msgstr "볼프강의 힘센 손에서 노가 가볍게 느껴진다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY"
msgid "Wolfgang is pretty sure that is not right way to use paddle."
msgstr "볼프강은 노를 그렇게 쓰는 게 아닌 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY"
