#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM"
msgid "Is just lump of mud?"
msgstr "그냥 진흙 덩어리냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL"
msgid "Float well, tiny bobber!"
msgstr "잘 떠라, 꼬마 낚시찌야!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY"
msgid "Feather of yellow bird float well on water!"
msgstr "노란 새 깃털 찌가 물에 잘 뜬다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW"
