msgstr "작은 시계는 지금 자고 있어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC"
msgid "Wolfgang would like to try!"
msgstr "볼프강이 해보고 싶다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE"
msgid "Tiny scale fit in palm of Wolfgang's hand!"
msgstr "작은 저울이다. 볼프강 손바닥만 하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE"
msgid "Ah, bring back good memories."
msgstr "아아, 좋은 기억 떠오른다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS"
msgid "Is faithful bird friend!"
msgstr "충직한 짹짹이 친구다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT"
msgid "Fancy feathers makes Wolfgang feel important."
msgstr "화려한 깃털이 있으니 볼프강 중요한 사람 같다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Look like smartypants brain."
msgstr "똑똑한 뇌처럼 보인다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED"
msgid "Ha ha ha! Brain is cooked! Not so smart now."
msgstr "하하하! 뇌가 요리되었구나! 이제 안 영리하구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Is big and good for lifting!"
msgstr "크고 들기에도 좋아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS"
msgid "Is seeds for growing."
msgstr "키우는 씨앗이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POND"
msgid "Is all wet."
msgstr "완전히 축축하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL"
msgid "Eel needs cooking!"
msgstr "장어는 요리해야 한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH"
msgid "Is fishy."
msgstr "비린내 난다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE"
msgid "Plant is so small! Is funny to me."
msgstr "식물이 너무 작구나! 나에겐 웃기는구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POOP"
msgid "Smelly!"
msgstr "냄새가 고약하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM"
msgid "Wolfgang could smash food like that if he wanted."
msgstr "볼프강 마음만 먹으면 이렇게 음식 깨부술 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "Good meal needs time to stew."
msgstr "훌륭한 식사 만들려면 끓일 시간이 필요하다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "Will be ready soon, my friends!"
msgstr "곧 준비된다, 친구들아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "A meal with friends!"
msgstr "친구와 함께 식사한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY"
msgid "Wolfgang will find something to cook!"
msgstr "볼프강이 요리할 재료 찾는다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Wolfgang will cook good meal for friends, meal like home!"
msgstr "볼프강이 친구를 위해 고향 음식을 맛있게 만든다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM"
msgid "Never afraid of dark forest again. Not that Wolfgang ever afraid."
msgstr "이제 어두운 숲 안 무섭다. 볼프강 한 번도 안 무서웠지만."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE"
msgid "Is little pile with mighty taste."
msgstr "힘센 맛을 내는 무더기다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Wolfgang will turn grinder with his mighty muscles!"
msgstr "볼프강이 힘센 근육으로 그라인더 돌린다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT"
msgid "Is good, solid tent!"
msgstr "훌륭하다. 튼튼한 텐트다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM"
msgid "Wolfgang will set up tent. Make it strong!"
msgstr "볼프강이 텐트 세운다. 튼튼하게!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO"
msgid "Wolfgang's favorite veggie."
msgstr "볼프강이 좋아하는 채소다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK"
msgid "Ha! Lifting and potatoes are three of Wolfgang's favorite things!"
msgstr "하! 들어올리기와 감자는 볼프강이 가장 좋아하는 세 가지다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "Wolfgang is very proud of tiny cooking friend."
msgstr "볼프강이 요리하는 친구 매우 자랑스럽게 생각한다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO"
msgid "Wolfgang loves potato."
msgstr "볼프강이 감자 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "Is golden brown! Texture like sun!"
msgstr "황금빛 갈색이다! 태양 같은 질감이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Is... is most beautiful thing Wolfgang has ever seen..."
msgstr "그것은... 볼프강이 본 것 중 가장 아름다워..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Is little tiny seeds for burying."
msgstr "땅에 묻는 작은 씨앗이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "Wolfgang worry greenthumb is gangrene."
msgstr "볼프강 식물 키워본 적 없는데."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "Is made of nothings!"
msgstr "재료가 아무것도 아니다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "Ha! Silly monkey forget leg day."
msgstr "하! 바보 같은 원숭이 하체 운동 안 했다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Need water."
msgstr "물이 필요해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Wolfgang can carry much water in that."
msgstr "볼프강은 그 안에 많은 양의 물을 실을 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "No monkey steals from Wolfgang!"
msgstr "그 어떤 원숭이도 볼프강한테서 못 훔친다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Feather bird likes water."
msgstr "깃털 달린 새가 물을 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "You is small, feather friend."
msgstr "너 작다, 깃털 달린 친구야."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "Wolfgang will not disturb."
msgstr "볼프강은 방해 안 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "Is big as head of weakling man! Not Wolfgang head."
msgstr "작은 사람의 머리만큼 크구나! 볼프강 머리는 아니구나."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER"
msgid "Wolfgang is best pumpkin carver. Best."
msgstr "볼프강 최고의 호박 조각가다. 최고!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Is tasty cookie."
msgstr "맛있는 쿠키다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "Wolfgang's belly is going to grow bigger than muscles..."
msgstr "볼프강 배가 근육보다 커진다..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Very gourd!"
msgstr "좋은 호박이구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "Now is actual head! Wolfgang afraid!"
msgstr "이제 진짜 머리구나! 볼프강아, 무섭구나!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Is even bigger than weakling science man's head!"
msgstr "약골 과학자의 머리보다 훨씬 낫다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Is seeds for growing."
msgstr "키우는 씨앗이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "Wolfgang will try to go easy on tiny punch man."
msgstr "볼프강 작은 펀치 인간 봐주려 노력한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "Little rocks are too bright!"
msgstr "작은 돌 너무 밝다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "This amulet... it frightens Wolfgang."
msgstr "이 부적은... 볼프강에게 두려움을 준다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Prettier rock."
msgstr "더 예쁜 돌이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "Is creepy, but maybe Wolfgang not get lost so much now."
msgstr "기분은 나쁘지만, 앞으로 볼프강이 길을 헤매지 않아도 될지도 모른다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "Enjoy hearty meal from Wolfgang!"
msgstr "볼프강의 푸짐한 식사를 받아라!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Little stone. Wolfgang will cook for you."
msgstr "작은 돌. 볼프강이 요리해주겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
msgid "Is post."
msgstr "기둥이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY"
msgid "Is plant."
msgstr "식물이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
msgid "Is big lady."
msgstr "큰 여자다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1"
msgid "Nice stone lady."
msgstr "착한 돌 여자이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
msgid "Is silly statue. Wolfgang not afraid."
msgstr "이상한 조각상이다. 볼프강은 무섭지 않다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO"
msgid "Is old."
msgstr "늙었다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH"
msgid "Is all gone."
msgstr "다 사라졌다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER"
msgid "Is for fancy eating."
msgstr "고급 요리에 쓰는 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Is little tiny seeds for burying."
msgstr "땅에 묻는 작은 씨앗이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH"
msgid "Is shame Wolfgang forget cabbage casserole recipe."
msgstr "볼프강이 배추 캐서롤 레시피를 잊어버려서 안타깝다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL"
msgid "Is making of small foods."
msgstr "작은 음식을 만드는 것이다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1"
msgid "Goat lady and fish men would like."
msgstr "염소 여자와 물고기 남자가 좋아하겠다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2
