msgstr "껍질 달린 유리 짐승이냐?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "Wolfgang will steer clear of the pinchers."
msgstr "볼프강은 집게발 가까이 안 간다."

