msgstr "볼프강도 무시무시한 집게 손이 있었으면 좋겠다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
