msgstr "콧수염이 여전히 멋지다, %s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
