msgstr "도끼를 놓고 싸우자, 수염 친구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
