msgstr "꽤 가볍다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
