msgstr "꽤 가볍다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
