msgstr "좋은 작은 빛이잖아."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "Pretty light."
msgstr "꽤 가볍다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
