msgstr "볼프강은 방해 안 한다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
