msgstr "네 놀이는 재미없다, 뿔 달린 친구!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire is not game, horn man."
msgstr "불은 장난이 아니다, 뿔 달린 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Is scary horn man, %s! H-hello!"
msgstr "무서운 뿔 달린 친구, %s! 안-녕!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "Fluffy ghost!"
msgstr "복슬복슬한 유령이다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Horn man is evil!"
msgstr "뿔 달린 친구는 못됐다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Scary horn man is nice sometimes."
msgstr "무서운 뿔 달린 친구도 가끔은 상냥할 때가 있다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG"
msgid "Nice stealing bag."
msgstr "좋은 도둑질용 자루다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER"
msgid "Wolfang not need. Wolfgang never die."
msgstr "볼프강한테 필요 없다. 볼프강 안 죽는다."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR"
