msgstr "안녕, 작은 영혼들아!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
