msgstr "꼬마 물고기, 버릇 고약하다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
