msgstr "가시가 정말 많다!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
