msgstr "쓰러지면 아주 난장판이 되겠어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
