#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS"
