msgstr "내 발굽은 건드리지 마."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT"
