msgstr "내 손가락을 조심해."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT"
