msgstr "푹 쉬어, 기계 친구."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP"
msgid "See? Stop tidying and appreciate the chaos around you!"
msgstr "내가 말했지? 청소는 그만두고 혼돈을 즐겨!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED"
msgid "I'm not a fella who needs a metal umbrella."
msgstr "난 금속 우산 따위 필요 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING"
msgid "I'm not a fella who needs a metal umbrella."
msgstr "난 금속 우산 따위 필요 없어."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC
