msgstr "찾은 사람이 임자 I"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WINONA.WINONA_WAGSTAFF_2_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WINONA.WINONA_WAGSTAFF_2_DESC"
msgid "Broaden the scope of your Inspectacles to locate higher-grade supply caches.\nGain mastery over all technology found in Advanced Cacheboxes."
