#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.molehat_goggles
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.molehat_goggles"
msgid "Two noses are better than one."
msgstr "두 개의 코가 한 개보다 낫다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.molehat_tail
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.molehat_tail"
msgid "Nose to tail. Nothing wasted."
msgstr "코부터 꼬리까지 버릴 것이 하나도 없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatmedium_blue
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatmedium_blue"
msgid "Let's see how pristine YOU look after a few weeks at sea."
msgstr "누구나 바다에서 몇 주를 보내면 후줄근해지기 마련이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatmedium_red
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatmedium_red"
msgid "Judging by the smell, that \"gold\" stitched into the brim might actually be bits of banana peel..."
msgstr "냄새를 보아하니 챙에 꿰매진 \"황금\"은 사실 바나나 껍질의 일부일지도 모른다..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatsmall_beads
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatsmall_beads"
msgid "You probably should have tried putting the necklace on before the bandana."
msgstr "두건을 쓰기 전에 목걸이를 차는 게 좋았을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatsmall_belt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.monkeyhatsmall_belt"
msgid "A look that says \"I ripped my pants, but didn't want to see them go to waste\"."
msgstr "\"바지가 찢어졌지만 버리고 싶지 않았어\"라고 말하는 듯하다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moondial_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moondial_an"
msgid "New moon, new look!"
msgstr "새로운 달에 맞춰 새로운 모습으로 단장했다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_crystal"
msgid "A jeweled, opalescent staff, imbued with the moon's shimmering power."
msgstr "보석 박힌 오팔색 지팡이다. 빛나는 달의 힘이 넘쳐흐른다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_portal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_portal"
msgid "Summon the chilling magic of the moon."
msgstr "달에서 오싹한 마법을 소환합니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_relic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.moonstaff_relic"
msgid "Let the moon send a shiver down your spine."
msgstr "달이 그대의 등골을 오싹하게 만들기를."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.multitool_axe_pickaxe_pickaxeaxe
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.multitool_axe_pickaxe_pickaxeaxe"
msgid "How much could a pickaxe axe?"
msgstr "곡괭이 도끼는 얼마일까요?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_farm_handmade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_farm_handmade"
msgid "Create a cozy homestead for your fungal friends."
msgstr "버섯 친구들을 위한 아늑한 집."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_farm_mystical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_farm_mystical"
msgid "Dewy really know how mushrooms grow?"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_an"
msgid "Put this living work of art someplace where it will really shine!"
msgstr "이 살아있는 예술품은 적절한 장소에 놓으면 아주 멋지다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_cawnival"
msgid "These mushrooms have a warm glow that reminds you of summer."
msgstr "이 버섯은 여름을 떠올리게 하는 따스한 빛을 내뿜는다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_hallowed
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_hallowed"
msgid "A pumpkin's grin, a flickering light, guiding ghosts through the Hallowed Night."
msgstr "호박의 웃음이 깜박이는 불빛처럼 핼러윈에 유령들을 인도한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_lily
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_lily"
msgid "If a suaver lamp was ever made out of a mushroom, the world has yet to see it."
msgstr "버섯으로 만든 세련된 램프는 세상의 빛을 본 적이 없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light2_victorian"
msgid "Nothing creates an ambiance quite like a glowing fungus."
msgstr "빛나는 곰팡이만큼 분위기를 조성하는 것은 없습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_an"
msgid "This mushlamp was made to dazzle."
msgstr "매우 눈부신 버섯 램프."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_festive
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_festive"
msgid "Merry and bright."
msgstr "유쾌하고 밝다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_hallowed
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_hallowed"
msgid "On Hallowed Nights, the wise ones stay, close to the glow that keeps dark at bay."
msgstr "핼러윈이 되면 현명한 이들은 어둠을 몰아내는 빛에 가까이 머무르곤 한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_tiffany
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mushroom_light_tiffany"
msgid "This mushlamp isn't any brighter than a regular lamp, but it'll make guests think you're extremely cultured."
msgstr "이 버섯 램프는 보통 램프보다 밝지는 않지만, 손님들이 그 주인을 아주 교양 있는 사람이라고 생각할 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_balatro
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_balatro"
msgid "This chest contains a gift to make a fool out of you!"
msgstr "이 상자에는 당신을 웃음거리로 만들 선물이 들어 있다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards"
msgid "This chest contains something magnificent."
msgstr "이 상자에는 굉장한 물건이 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards2
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards2"
msgid "This chest contains all the magnificence that couldn't fit in the first chest!"
msgstr "이 상자에는 첫 번째 상자에 미처 들어가지 못했던 웅장한 것들이 가득 들어 있다!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards_silk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_beards_silk"
msgid "This chest seems to be full of cobwebs..."
msgstr "이 상자에는 거미줄이 가득 찬 모양이다..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_classic_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_classic_4"
msgid "This chest contains\n4x curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 골동품\n4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_fixed
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_fixed"
msgid "This chest contains a gift just for you."
msgstr "이 상자에는 당신만을 위한 선물이 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_ice_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_ice_4"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nWinter's Feast curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 겨울 축제\n골동품 4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_invisible_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_invisible_5"
msgid "Oh my...\nThere appears to be nothing in this chest at all."
msgstr "이런...\n이 상자에는 아무것도 없는 것 같습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_lava_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_lava_4"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nForge Event curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 Forge 이벤트\n골동품 4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_monkeyhat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_monkeyhat"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nMoon Quay pirate hats."
msgstr "이 상자에는 달빛 부두 해적 모자\n4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_nature_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_nature_4"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nSpring curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 봄 골동품\n4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_terraria
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_terraria"
msgid "This chest contains an assortment of Inspired curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 다양한 영감을 받은 골동품이 들어 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat"
msgid "This chest contains\na Hallowed Nights costume."
msgstr "이 상자에는\nHallowed Nights 복장이 들어 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat_alt"
msgid "This chest contains\na Hallowed Nights costume."
msgstr "이 상자에는\nHallowed Nights 복장이 들어 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat_furniture
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_trickortreat_furniture"
msgid "This chest contains\nHallowed Nights curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는\nHallowed Nights 골동품이 들어있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_ugly_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_ugly_3"
msgid "This chest contains\nan assortment\nof festive apparel."
msgstr "이 상자에는\n구색\n을 갖춘 축제 의상이 들어 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_victorian_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_victorian_4"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nGorge Event curios."
msgstr "이 상자에는 Gorge 이벤트\n골동품 4개가 들어 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_wormholes
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.mysterybox_wormholes"
msgid "This chest contains 4x\nwormhole accoutrements."
msgstr "이 상자에는 4배의\n웜홀 장신구가 들어 있습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightmare_torch_relic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightmare_torch_relic"
msgid "Almost scarier than just being in the dark."
msgstr "어둠 속에 있는 것만큼이나 무섭다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_cotl
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_cotl"
msgid "This blade will shear through anything that opposes you."
msgstr "이 칼날은 앞을 막아서는 그 어떤 것도 잘라버릴 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_curve
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_curve"
msgid "Try not to listen to its whispers..."
msgstr "이것의 속삭임을 듣지 않도록..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_lightsbane
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_lightsbane"
msgid "A sword born of darkest pitch with blades of blackest shade."
msgstr "가장 어두운 그림자의 칼날을 가진 암흑의 정점에서 태어난 검이죠."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_sharp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_sharp"
msgid "Show them no mercy."
msgstr "적에게 자비를 베풀지 말라."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_wizard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.nightsword_wizard"
msgid "Your enemies are usually slain before the curse can take effect. A pity, really."
msgstr "안타깝게도 당신의 적들은 저주의 효과가 드러나기도 전에 죽어버리곤 한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.none"
msgid "Your usual look."
msgstr "평소 모습."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.oar_driftwood_invisible
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.oar_driftwood_invisible"
msgid "Convey an incredibly convincing impression of a driftwood oar."
msgstr "유목 노에서 풍기는 믿을 수 없게 설득력 있는 인상을 전달하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.oar_invisible
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.oar_invisible"
msgid "Convey an incredibly convincing impression of an oar."
msgstr "노에서 풍기는 믿을 수 없게 설득력 있는 인상을 전달하세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ocean_trawler_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ocean_trawler_pirate"
msgid "Haul fish aplenty to feed your scurvy dogs and scallywags."
msgstr "선원들에게 먹일 수많은 물고기를 옮길 수 있게 해준다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ocean_trawler_pirate_kit
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.ocean_trawler_pirate_kit"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.oceanfishingrod_hotline
