#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_bee
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_bee"
msgid "It doesn't hit harder than a regular spear, although it certainly still stings."
msgstr "보통의 창보다 더 세게 찌르지는 않지만 아픈 것은 마찬가지."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_forge_gungnir
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_forge_gungnir"
msgid "Jagged and sharp are fine qualities for a weapon in battle."
msgstr "전투에 알맞게 끝이 삐죽삐죽하고 날카롭다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_forge_lance
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_forge_lance"
msgid "Keep the drill pointed toward your foes and you'll be triumphant."
msgstr "드릴을 항상 적에게만 향하면 승리할 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_hockey
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_hockey"
msgid "The Canadian weapon of choice."
msgstr "캐나다에서 선호하는 무기."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_northern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_northern"
msgid "A rustic, sturdy spear."
msgstr "투박하고 튼튼한 창."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_ragged
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_ragged"
msgid "This spear has seen more than its fair share of battles."
msgstr "이 창은 전투에서 타당하게 해야할 몫 이상을 했습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_rose"
msgid "No sharper than any other spear, though much lovelier."
msgstr "다른 창보다 더 뾰족하지는 않지만 훨씬 더 아름답다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_simple
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_simple"
msgid "A rudimentary weapon, sharp and ready for a quarrel."
msgstr "기본적인 무기. 예리하게 연마해서 싸울 준비를 마쳤다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_lunar"
msgid "A shining spear weilded by only the most powerful of the moon's chosen warriors."
msgstr "달의 선택받은 전사 중 가장 강력한 이들만이 사용할 수 있는 빛나는 창."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_northern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_northern"
msgid "A weapon imbued with the ferocity of a storm."
msgstr "폭풍의 맹렬함이 깃든 무기."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_valkyrie"
msgid "Swoop in and strike your foes as quick as lightning."
msgstr "번개처럼 빠르게 달려들어 적을 공격할 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_wrestle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_charged_wrestle"
msgid "The weilder of this weapon is sure to receive thunderous applause in the ring."
msgstr "이 무기를 사용하면 경기장에서 우레 같은 박수 갈채를 받을 수 있을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_lunar"
msgid "A shining spear weilded by only the most powerful of the moon's chosen warriors."
msgstr "달의 선택받은 전사 중 가장 강력한 이들만이 사용할 수 있는 빛나는 창."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_northern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_northern"
msgid "A weapon imbued with the ferocity of a storm."
msgstr "폭풍의 맹렬함이 깃든 무기."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_valkyrie"
msgid "Swoop in and strike your foes as quick as lightning."
msgstr "번개처럼 빠르게 달려들어 적을 공격할 수 있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_wrestle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lightning_wrestle"
msgid "The weilder of this weapon is sure to receive thunderous applause in the ring."
msgstr "이 무기를 사용하면 경기장에서 우레 같은 박수 갈채를 받을 수 있을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_lunar"
msgid "The shining spear of the moon's chosen champion."
msgstr "달에 선택받은 투사의 빛나는 창."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_northern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_northern"
msgid "A fierce weapon favored by Viking warriors."
msgstr "바이킹 전사들이 선호하는 험악한 무기."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_valkyrie"
msgid "Sure to soar straight and true to its target."
msgstr "목표를 향해 똑바로 날아갈 것입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_wrestle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spear_wathgrithr_wrestle"
msgid "Let them try to wrestle this away from you."
msgstr "적이 무기를 빼앗으려고 들지 모르지만 소용없다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_porcelain
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_porcelain"
msgid "A finely crafted portable pantry."
msgstr "정교하게 제작한 휴대용 식료품 창고."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_rustic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_rustic"
msgid "Bound for great things, and even greater meals."
msgstr "위대한 운명이 엮여 있는 파우치. 아주 훌륭한 식사를 만들어낸다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_silver
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_silver"
msgid "Yes, Chef!"
msgstr "예, 세프!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.spicepack_survivor"
msgid "The preferred carryall of the vagabond chef."
msgstr "방랑 요리사가 좋아하는 캐리올."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_carpet
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_carpet"
msgid "A \"table\" that would be a truly elegant addition to any unkempt wilderness base."
msgstr "텅 빈 황무지 기지에 추가하면 진정으로 우아해질 \"테이블\"입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_cawnival
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_cawnival"
msgid "A small, festive \"table\" that reminds you of feathered friends."
msgstr "깃털 달린 친구가 떠오르는 작고 축제에 적합한 \"테이블\"입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_cawnival_alt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_cawnival_alt"
msgid "A small, festive \"table\" that reminds you of feathered friends."
msgstr "깃털 달린 친구가 떠오르는 작고 축제에 적합한 \"테이블\"입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_dragonfly"
msgid "An \"endtable\" inspired by the most opulent of bloodthirsty monsters."
msgstr "가장 호화로운 피에 굶주린 괴물들에게서 영감을 받은 \"작은 테이블\"입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_vintage
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.stagehand_vintage"
msgid "A quaint decorative \"table\" that would make your grandmother proud."
msgstr "할머니를 자랑스럽게 만들 기이한 장식용 \"테이블\"입니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_crystal"
msgid "A blindingly beautiful staff, filled with the magic of stars."
msgstr "별의 마법으로 가득 찬, 눈부시게 아름다운 지팡이."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_portal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_portal"
msgid "Call on the power of otherworldly stars."
msgstr "다른 세상에서 별들의 힘을 불러오세요."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_relic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.starstaff_relic"
msgid "Wrap yourself in the warm glow of the stars."
msgstr "별의 따스한 빛이 몸을 감싼다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_nautical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_nautical"
msgid "It never hurts to keep an extra eye out on the ocean."
msgstr "바다를 각별히 주의하면 결코 다치지 않습니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_nautical_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_nautical_item"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_wagstaff
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_wagstaff"
msgid "One must stay the course, in the name of progress."
msgstr "진보의 이름으로, 길에서 벗어나서는 안 된다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_wagstaff_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.steeringwheel_wagstaff_item"
