msgid "Organize your foraged scraps in class and style."
msgstr "수집한 잡동사니를 품위와 스타일 있게 정리한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_upgraded_traveltrunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_upgraded_traveltrunk"
msgid "Its traveling days may be over, but it'll always have the memories."
msgstr "여행의 나날은 끝났을지도 모르지만, 추억만은 영원히 남아 있을 것이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_upgraded_vintage
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_upgraded_vintage"
msgid "Adds a nice, homey touch to any camp."
msgstr "어떤 캠프에나 따듯한 가정의 느낌을 더해줍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_vintage
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.treasurechest_vintage"
msgid "Adds a nice, homey touch to any camp."
msgstr "어떤 캠프에나 따듯한 가정의 느낌을 더해줍니다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trident_merm
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trident_merm"
msgid "A young warrior must learn to turn the tide in their favor."
msgstr "젊은 전사는 전투의 흐름을 가져오는 법을 터득해야만 한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trophyscale_fish_handmade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trophyscale_fish_handmade"
msgid "What waits to be weighed 'neath the waves?"
msgstr "파도 밑에서 무엇이 저울에 오르기를 기다리는가?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trophyscale_oversizedveggies_plant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.trophyscale_oversizedveggies_plant"
msgid "This hardy bloom is ready to weigh all your farm-fresh veggies."
msgstr "이 튼튼한 꽃은 신선한 채소의 무게를 잴 준비가 되어있다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_circus"
msgid "Keeping dry is the main attraction."
msgstr "마른 상태 유지가 핵심이다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_heart
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_heart"
msgid "Lovers love to walk in the rain."
msgstr "연인들은 빗속에서 함께 걷는 것을 좋아한다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_parasol
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_parasol"
msgid "The previous owner must not have liked the sun."
msgstr "이전 소유주는 태양을 좋아하지 않은 것 같다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_spider
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.umbrella_spider"
msgid "This itsy bitsy spider has no fear of rain."
msgstr "이 꼬마 거미는 비를 무서워하지 않는다."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wagdrone_rolling_fancy
