#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.ASPARAGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.ASPARAGUS"
msgid "Green spears of vegetabley goodness. -W"
msgstr "Green spears of vegetabley goodness. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.CARROT"
msgid "The perennial favorite of Bunnymen. -W"
msgstr "The perennial favorite of Bunnymen. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.CORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.CORN"
msgid "An a-maize-ingly versatile crop. -W"
msgstr "An a-maize-ingly versatile crop. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.DRAGONFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.DRAGONFRUIT"
msgid "Produces a delectable fruit with a striking appearance. -W"
msgstr "눈에 띄는 모양의 맛있는 과일을 생산합니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.DURIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.DURIAN"
msgid "A foul smelling fruit, favored by a certain green swamp dweller. -W"
msgstr "어떤 녹색 늪에 사는 존재들이 좋아하는 역한 냄새가 나는 과일입니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.EGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.EGGPLANT"
msgid "Zero percent egg, ninety-nine percent plant. Science has yet to explain the rest. -W"
msgstr "0% 계란, 99% 식물. 과학으로도 아직 나머지를 설명하지 못합니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.GARLIC"
msgid "Cloves of garlic pair well with a nice stake. -W"
msgstr "다진 마늘은 좋은 스테이크와 잘 어울리죠. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.MISSING
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.MISSING"
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "알 수 없음"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.ONION
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.ONION"
msgid "A ripe onion plant is enough to bring tears of delight to any gardener. -W"
msgstr "잘 익은 양파 식물은 모든 원예원사에게 기쁨의 눈물을 가져다주기에 충분합니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.PEPPER"
msgid "A hot pepper plant is the perfect thing to spice up your garden. -W"
msgstr "고추 식물은 완벽하게 정원에 활기를 불어넣습니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.POMEGRANATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.POMEGRANATE"
msgid "Never take the juicy sweetness of a pom for granate. -W"
msgstr "폼의 즙이 풍부한 단맛은 화강암에 양보하세요. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.POTATO"
msgid "Sturdy, dependable, and loved by moustachioed strongmen. -W"
msgstr "튼튼하고 믿음직스러워 콧수염을 기른 강자들에게 사랑받고 있습니다. -W"

#. STRINGS.UI.PLANTREGISTRY.DESCRIPTIONS.PUMPKIN
